,"content":"| Webinar data                | What it's for       |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Webinar Join Short Link** | A shortened version |","table":"table-4"},"1802":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-92","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"| Webinar data            | What it's for          |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **Webinar Replay Link** | Their replay page link |","table":"table-4"},"1803":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-93","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"| Webinar data                  | What it's for       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Webinar Replay Short Link** | A shortened version |","table":"table-4"},"1804":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-94","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"| Webinar data     | What it's for                                      |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Phone Number** | Their phone, if your registration form collects it |","table":"table-4"},"1805":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-95","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#map-custom-fields","content":"Pick the matching CRM field beside each one. **Refresh** pulls in fields you have just created in the CRM."},"1806":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-96","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#reminders-from-crm","content":"Mapping the **join link** lets you send reminders from your CRM instead of EasyWebinar's own reminder emails, because each contact gets their own working link."},"1807":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-97","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#verify-the-result","content":"The integration shows under **Connected apps** as **Ready to use**."},"1808":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-98","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#verify-the-result","content":"Your rules appear under **Current mappings**."},"1809":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-99","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#verify-the-result","content":"Register a test contact and check the tag and fields arrive in your CRM."},"1810":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-100","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#change-or-disconnect","content":"**Change integration** swaps the connected tool. **Disconnect** removes it from the webinar."},"1811":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-101","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#what-it-is","content":"An integration links one webinar to a CRM or email tool you already use. It has two halves. **Event mappings** apply a tag when someone does something, such as attending or missing the session. **Custom fields** copy webinar details, such as the title and each person's join link, into fields on the contact."},"1812":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-102","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#what-it-is","content":"Registrants and attendees are separate events, so the integration can tell someone who only signed up from someone who turned up. Everything is set on the webinar itself, not across your whole account."},"1813":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-103","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#what-its-for","content":"CRM mapping brings your registrants and attendees into the system you already work in, without exporting anything. Each contact arrives with a tag that says what they did, so your next step can depend on it."},"1814":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-104","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#how-it-helps","content":"**Follow-up matches behaviour.** A no-show can start a replay sequence, while an offer click goes to sales."},"1815":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-105","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#how-it-helps","content":"**Strong signals stand out.** **Watched full** and **Clicked offer** sit apart from a plain registration."},"1816":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-106","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#how-it-helps","content":"**Your CRM sends the reminders.** A mapped join link gives each contact their own working link."},"1817":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-107","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#how-it-helps","content":"**Each webinar feeds its own list.** Integrations are set per webinar."},"1818":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-108","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#without-it","content":"Everyone on the list gets the same follow-up, whether they watched to the end or never turned up. Interested people wait in a spreadsheet while the moment passes. Sales has no way to tell a casual sign-up from someone who clicked the offer."},"1819":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-109","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#why-buyers-care","content":"It matters to teams whose pipeline already lives in a CRM. A webinar only counts there once its people show up in that CRM, tagged in a way that sales and marketing automation can act on. That is the point of tracking webinar leads in your CRM."},"1820":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-110","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"Consider a typical case. A two-person revenue operations team at a payroll software company owns the HubSpot instance. Marketing runs a quarterly live briefing on payroll compliance for finance managers, and around 400 people register. The goal is to route engaged attendees to sales development reps within a day."},"1821":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-111","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"A common workaround is to download the attendee list after each session, clean it up and import it into HubSpot. That tends to take a day or two, and the file usually holds only names and whether people attended. Reps then call everyone in the same order, and the warmest leads may cool while they wait."},"1822":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-112","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"The briefing itself doesn't need to change. What changes is how much of each person's session reaches the CRM, and how fast. An attendee who stayed to the end is a different lead from one who left after ten minutes, and the CRM should know that."},"1823":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-113","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"EasyWebinar connects HubSpot on the webinar's **Integrations** tab. The team maps **Watched full** to an engaged tag that alerts the reps, and **Missed** to a no-show tag for the replay sequence. On the **Custom fields** tab they map **Webinar Join Link**, so HubSpot can send its own reminders with each person's link."},"1824":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-114","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#approach","content":"The events table under Map events to tags lists all eleven triggers, including **Left early** and **Stayed on webinar at least**. How other platforms tag behaviour and send webinar data to a CRM is covered in How CRM mapping compares, below."},"1825":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-115","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-registration-fields","content":"The **Phone Number** field only has something to send if your registration form collected it. Select the form block in the page builder and add the **Phone** field; custom registration fields covers the other fields you can add."},"1826":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-116","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-people-view","content":"People is every registrant and attendee across all your webinars in one table, and you can filter it by behaviour and source and export the list. It is a quick way to check who should have received a tag, or to follow up with people outside your CRM rules."},"1827":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-117","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-cloning","content":"When you clone a webinar, **Integration settings** is one of the groups you can copy. Tick it to bring this webinar's integration settings across to the copy."},"1828":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-118","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-easycrm","content":"You don't need EasyCRM to run webinars. It's for managing the people your webinars produce. Registrants reach it by connecting EasyCRM as an integration on a webinar, as on this page, or with **Import from EasyWebinar** on its Leads screen."},"1829":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-119","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-easycast","content":"The **Social media** category on the Integrations tab is separate from CRMs. To broadcast a webinar to YouTube or LinkedIn while it runs, use EasyCast, under **Integrations** in the sidebar."},"1830":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-120","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, showing how different teams set their mappings up."},"1831":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-121","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#revops","content":"A RevOps team maps **Clicked offer** and **Watched full** to separate tags, so lead routing in the CRM can treat them as different signals. The **Webinar Title** field records which webinar each contact came from."},"1832":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-122","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#marketing-teams","content":"A marketing team maps **Missed** and **Didn't watch replay** to tags that start a replay sequence. People who still haven't watched get a second nudge from the email tool the team already uses."},"1833":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-123","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#course-creators","content":"A creator selling a course through webinars tags **Clicked offer** and keeps those contacts out of the general nurture sequence. That stops buyers who are close to purchase from getting beginner emails."},"1834":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-124","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#several-webinars","content":"A team running one webinar per product line connects each webinar to its own list. When they launch a new live session from an existing one, cloning with **Integration settings** ticked keeps the mappings."},"1835":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-125","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"EasyWebinar tags contacts by what they did in the session, sends each person's join link into a CRM field, and offers its own CRM, EasyCRM, that connects the same way. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"1836":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-126","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"CRM features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"1837":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-127","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform        | Tags by what attendees did | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| --------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                        | Yes                           | Yes                         |","table":"table-5"},"1838":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-128","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform  | Tags by what attendees did | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| --------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (segment by behaviour) | Yes (Unique Join Link)        | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-5"},"1839":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-129","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform      | Tags by what attendees did            | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Partly (registrant and attendee data) | Yes (connection link)         | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-5"},"1840":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-130","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Tags by what attendees did         | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Yes (attended, missed, left early) | Yes (live room link)          | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-5"},"1841":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-131","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"| Platform     | Tags by what attendees did | Join link sent to a CRM field | Own CRM in the same product |\n| ------------ | -------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Yes (trigger-based tags)   | Yes (join links)              | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-5"},"1842":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-132","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"1843":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-133","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"**A CRM in the same product.** EasyCRM is EasyWebinar's own CRM and connects to a webinar like any other integration. Demio's integration guide has you connect an outside account in your User settings, and no Demio CRM is documented. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"1844":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-134","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"**Tags for how long people stayed.** EasyWebinar's **Stayed on webinar at least** and **Watched full** each apply their own tag. Livestorm's HubSpot article describes sending registrant and attendee data to HubSpot. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"1845":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-135","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"**Tags without a separate tool.** EasyWebinar's **When**, **Then** and **Value** choices tag contacts directly from the webinar. eWebinar's CRM guide also covers connecting products it doesn't integrate with directly through Zapier. See EasyWebinar vs eWebinar."},"1846":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-136","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"**Points in the session you choose.** EasyWebinar's **Joined webinar after** and **Left webinar before** let you set the point in the session. WebinarJam's trigger examples include leaving early, evaluated after the session concludes. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"1847":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-137","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"1848":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-138","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**Integrations are per webinar.** Connecting one doesn't connect the rest, and different webinars can feed different lists."},"1849":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-139","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**Connecting needs an account with that service**, and you sign in to it during setup."},"1850":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-140","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**Tags and custom fields must exist in your CRM first.** Use **Refresh** after adding a field."},"1851":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-141","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**There are 14 integrations**, including EasyWebinar's own EasyCRM."},"1852":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-142","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**EasyCRM is a plan add-on**, switched on from the **Add-ons** tab under **Settings → Manage Plan**."},"1853":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-143","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-no-shows","content":"Yes, with the **Missed** event."},"1854":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-144","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-how-many-events","content":"Eleven, from **Registered** to **Clicked offer**. Each mapping applies the tag you choose when its event fires."},"1855":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-145","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-missing-field","content":"Create it in your CRM, then click **Refresh**."},"1856":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-146","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-other-tools","content":"Check whether it accepts data from one of the listed platforms, or use EasyCRM."},"1857":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-147","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-every-webinar","content":"Yes, integrations are set per webinar. Cloning a webinar with **Integration settings** ticked brings those settings across to the copy."},"1858":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-148","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-different-lists","content":"Yes. Because each webinar has its own integration settings, each one can send people to a different list."},"1859":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-149","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-registrants","content":"Yes. Registrants and attendees sync as separate events, so you can treat no-shows differently."},"1860":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-150","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-join-link","content":"Yes. Map **Webinar Join Link** to one of your custom fields on the Custom fields tab."},"1861":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-151","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-need-easycrm","content":"No. EasyCRM is for managing the people your webinars produce. Connect the CRM you already use instead if you prefer."},"1862":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-152","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-streaming","content":"Not from this tab. Use **EasyCast**, a separate item under **Integrations** in the sidebar."},"1863":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-153","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Offers and the countdown timer: the offers behind the **Clicked offer** event."},"1864":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-154","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Limits and defaults: the per-webinar integration rule alongside other account limits."},"1865":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-155","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Webinar analytics: compare attendance and offer clicks with what reached your CRM."},"1866":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-156","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Team members and roles: give the colleagues who manage your integrations their own login."},"1867":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-157","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#related","content":"Automate follow-ups with CRM tools: ideas for the sequences your tags can trigger."},"1868":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"page","content":"What Is EasyWebinar? A Webinar Platform for Live, Simulive and Evergreen Webinars","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary"},"1869":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-0","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary","content":"A one-page overview of the EasyWebinar webinar platform: the three webinar types, the live room, selling, AI, follow-up, who it suits and its limits."},"1870":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-1","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"1871":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-2","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#what-it-is","content":"What EasyWebinar is"},"1872":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-3","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#how-parts-connect","content":"How the parts connect"},"1873":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-4","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"Who EasyWebinar is for"},"1874":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-5","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#webinar-types","content":"The three webinar types"},"1875":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-6","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#live","content":"Live"},"1876":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-7","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#simulive","content":"Simulive"},"1877":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-8","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#evergreen","content":"Evergreen"},"1878":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-9","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"How you set up and run a webinar"},"1879":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-10","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#live-room","content":"What happens in the live room"},"1880":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-11","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#selling","content":"Selling and engagement"},"1881":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-12","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#ai","content":"How AI helps"},"1882":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-13","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#follow-up","content":"Follow-up: analytics and your CRM or ours"},"1883":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-14","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#teams-security","content":"Teams, agencies and security"},"1884":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-15","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#limits","content":"Limits"},"1885":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-16","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"1886":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-17","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#what-is-easywebinar","content":"What is EasyWebinar?"},"1887":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-18","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-is-it-for","content":"Who is EasyWebinar for?"},"1888":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-19","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#what-it-doesnt-do","content":"What doesn't EasyWebinar do?"},"1889":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-20","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#download","content":"Do attendees need to download anything?"},"1890":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-21","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#simulive-vs-evergreen","content":"What is the difference between simulive and evergreen?"},"1891":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-22","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#keep-crm","content":"Can I keep my current CRM?"},"1892":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-23","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#sell-a-course","content":"Can I sell a course with EasyWebinar?"},"1893":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-24","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#zoom-in","content":"Can attendees zoom in on my slides?"},"1894":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-25","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#stream-out","content":"Can I stream my webinar to YouTube or LinkedIn?"},"1895":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-26","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#security","content":"Is EasyWebinar secure?"},"1896":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-27","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#cost","content":"How much does EasyWebinar cost?"},"1897":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-28","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#why-choose","content":"Where can I read why teams choose it?"},"1898":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-29","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/product-summary#related","content":"Related"},"1899":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-30","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary","content":"What is EasyWebinar? It is a webinar platform for live, simulive and evergreen webinars that collect leads and sell. This overview gives you the whole product on one page: what it does, who it suits, how the parts connect and where its limits sit."},"1900":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-31","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question        | Short answer                                                                         |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What is it?** | A webinar platform built for conversions, for live, automated and on-demand webinars |","table":"table-0"},"1901":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-32","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question          | Short answer                                                                                |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar types** | Live, Simulive and Evergreen, all using the same pages, emails, polls, offers and analytics |","table":"table-0"},"1902":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-33","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question               | Short answer                               |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **How attendees join** | From any browser, with nothing to download |","table":"table-0"},"1903":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-34","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question    | Short answer                                                                                    |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Selling** | Offers with countdown timers in the room, and paid registration through your own Stripe account |","table":"table-0"},"1904":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-35","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question | Short answer                                                                                              |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **AI**   | Drafts your script, pages, emails, polls and offers; from Pro, answers attendee questions from your files |","table":"table-0"},"1905":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-36","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question | Short answer                                                        |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **CRM**  | Your CRM or ours: keep the one you use, or use the built-in EasyCRM |","table":"table-0"},"1906":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-37","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question          | Short answer                                                                      |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Streaming out** | EasyCast streams a live webinar to YouTube, LinkedIn or a custom RTMP destination |","table":"table-0"},"1907":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-38","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question     | Short answer                                                                     |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Security** | EasyWebinar holds a SOC 2 Type II report and follows GDPR-aligned data practices |","table":"table-0"},"1908":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-39","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question    | Short answer                                                                               |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Not for** | Hosting or delivering courses: it is the conversion layer in front of your course platform |","table":"table-0"},"1909":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-40","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#at-a-glance","content":"| Question  | Short answer                                                                          |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Trial** | The standard trial is 7 days and needs a card; current prices are on the pricing page |","table":"table-0"},"1910":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-41","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#what-it-is","content":"Take a typical case. An independent bookkeeper who works with restaurant owners runs a free live talk each month, and new clients book after it. Between talks, people still land on her site and find nothing to watch, so she asks what kind of platform could run the talk live and then keep it running."},"1911":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-42","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#what-it-is","content":"That is the job EasyWebinar is built for. A host builds a webinar with a registration page, emails, polls and offers. It runs live or from a recording, and the host follows up through analytics, integrations or the built-in EasyCRM. The short version of its approach is to run a webinar live, find the version that converts, then turn that session into an automated webinar that runs every day."},"1912":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-43","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#what-it-is","content":"In this video, EasyWebinar shows its webinar platform running live and evergreen webinars from one account."},"1913":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-44","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#how-parts-connect","content":"A webinar's registration page collects registrants and can take payment through your Stripe account. Registrants then get emails from the **Notifications** tab, with SMS (Beta) and WhatsApp (Beta) as extra channels. They join the room live, or a recording plays at a set time (simulive) or around the clock (evergreen). Attendance, offer clicks and revenue then flow into the webinar's **Analytics** and the **People** view, and out to your CRM or into EasyCRM."},"1914":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-45","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"EasyWebinar suits people whose webinars have to keep working after the live hour. That covers creators, coaches, consultants, small businesses and marketing teams. In practice, these are the groups that use it most:"},"1915":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-46","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"**Course creators** run the sales webinar for a course they host elsewhere, then let a recorded version sell every day."},"1916":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-47","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"**Coaches and consultants** run a free talk live, answer questions in the room and follow up the people who clicked an offer."},"1917":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-48","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"**SaaS and product teams** run product demos and onboarding sessions as evergreen webinars that new users watch when it suits them."},"1918":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-49","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"**Agencies** run webinars for several clients, each in a separate client workspace."},"1919":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-50","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"**Small businesses and solo operators** handle the pages, emails and follow-up without a separate marketing stack."},"1920":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-51","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"**B2B marketing teams** send registrants, attendance and offer clicks into the CRM they already use."},"1921":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-52","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"**Customer success teams** run release briefings and training live, then keep the recording available."},"1922":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-53","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-its-for","content":"It sits between a simple meeting room and an enterprise event platform. It is simple enough for a first webinar, and it can run your whole webinar funnel."},"1923":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-54","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#webinar-types","content":"You choose a type when you create a webinar, and the choice decides how the session is delivered. All three use the same pages, emails, polls, offers and analytics; only the delivery differs."},"1924":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-55","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#live","content":"You present in real time at a set date and time. Attendees join at that moment, and chat and Q&A happen as they happen. Choose a live webinar when people come for the interaction: a launch, a workshop or a question session."},"1925":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-56","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#simulive","content":"A recording plays at scheduled times, and everyone watching a session sees the same moment together. The chat still works as a shared room, and you can be in it answering questions. A simulive webinar suits a presentation you give over and over."},"1926":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-57","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#evergreen","content":"A recording runs on a repeating schedule rather than a fixed date. An evergreen (automated) webinar can offer just-in-time sessions that start shortly after each person registers, in their local time. It can also offer instant viewing on demand and recurring sessions."},"1927":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-58","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#evergreen","content":"The type is fixed once you create the webinar. To change it, you clone the webinar and pick a new type. This is also how you turn a session that worked live into an evergreen webinar from a past live recording."},"1928":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-59","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"Every webinar follows the same order, whichever type you choose. Here is what you do, and what to check at each step."},"1929":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-60","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"**Create the webinar and choose its type.** Name it, pick Live, Simulive or Evergreen, then set the schedule. The live webinar setup guide walks through each step."},"1930":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-61","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"**Add the video for recorded types.** EasyWebinar can host the video itself, or play one that lives on YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia."},"1931":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-62","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"**Build the pages.** Use the registration page builder for the registration, thank-you and replay pages."},"1932":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-63","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"**Set up polls and offers.** Do this on the **CTAs** tab, and add a countdown timer to an offer if it has a deadline."},"1933":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-64","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"**Set up chat and Q&A.** These sit on the **Engagement** tab and are set before the webinar runs, not during it."},"1934":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-65","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"**Schedule the emails.** A common pattern is reminder emails a day, an hour and fifteen minutes before."},"1935":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-66","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"**Run it, then read the results.** Go live, or let the recording play, then open **Analytics** to see where people dropped off."},"1936":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-67","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"Step 1 is where the webinar type is decided, so pick Live, Simulive or Evergreen with care, because changing it later means cloning the webinar."},"1937":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-68","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"Once the webinar exists, it opens on its Overview tab. This is the home screen for one webinar, with live stats, scheduling, sessions, pricing, presenters and seven share links. The Overview tab guide explains each panel."},"1938":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-69","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#set-up","content":"The Overview tab shows how one webinar is performing and holds its share links, so it is the screen you check before and after each session."},"1939":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-70","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#live-room","content":"The live room is where you present. You arrive in a green room where nothing is broadcast, so you can check your camera framing and test your screen share. Co-hosts and moderators wait backstage, and your audience doesn't see or hear them until you bring them on. The live webinar guide covers the room from start to finish."},"1940":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-71","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#live-room","content":"Two features help when you share a screen or slides:"},"1941":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-72","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#live-room","content":"**Draw on your share.** Whoever is sharing their screen or slides can draw on them, and everyone in the session sees each line as it is drawn. Only the person sharing can draw."},"1942":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-73","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#live-room","content":"**Attendees can zoom in.** Attendees in live-room webinars can zoom in and move around a shared screen, video or slides, up to 400%. The zoom happens only in that attendee's browser, so nobody else's view changes."},"1943":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-74","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#live-room","content":"**EasyCast** streams your live webinar to YouTube, LinkedIn or a custom RTMP destination at the same time. Use it when part of your audience watches on those channels, and keep the registration page as the place where leads are collected."},"1944":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-75","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#selling","content":"EasyWebinar is built around webinars that sell, so the selling tools sit inside the room rather than after it."},"1945":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-76","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#selling","content":"**Polls** keep the audience taking part. Polls work best when they are easy to answer, such as a question about the audience."},"1946":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-77","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#selling","content":"**Offers** appear in the room with a button that opens your checkout. Offers can carry a countdown timer to add urgency."},"1947":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-78","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#selling","content":"**Paid registration** lets attendees pay through a secure Stripe checkout, with the money going straight to your Stripe account. Paid webinars need a connected Stripe account first."},"1948":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-79","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#selling","content":"**Chat and Q&A** let the audience talk to you. You can set live chat for everyone or hosts only, and run questions and answers in public, in private or not at all."},"1949":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-80","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#selling","content":"**Chat Simulation (Beta)** adds a scripted or AI-written chat to a recorded webinar. You run simulated chat (Beta) as AI Simulation or Manual Simulation, not both."},"1950":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-81","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#ai","content":"AI in EasyWebinar works before and during the webinar, while the platform and its results stay the point."},"1951":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-82","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#ai","content":"Before the webinar, Create with AI drafts your script, pages, emails, polls and offers. The draft emails arrive with merge tags in place, so dates, times and join links fill themselves in. Create with AI is credit-based, and you still review and edit everything it writes."},"1952":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-83","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#ai","content":"During the webinar, the AI Moderator answers attendee questions from documents you give it, such as PDFs and other files. It is available from the Pro plan onward. The AI overview explains what AI drafts, what it answers and what you still check."},"1953":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-84","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#ai","content":"In this video, EasyWebinar shows how AI fits into running live and evergreen webinars."},"1954":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-85","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#follow-up","content":"After a webinar, you need to know who came, who left early and who clicked. Webinar analytics shows the funnel from page visitors to registrations, live attendance and replay views. It also counts **Missed**: people who registered and never showed up, who are often the group most worth emailing."},"1955":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-86","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#follow-up","content":"The People view lists everyone who registered or attended across all your webinars. You can filter by behaviour and source, then export the list."},"1956":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-87","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#follow-up","content":"For the CRM, the rule is your CRM or ours. Keep HubSpot, Salesforce Pardot (Account Engagement), ActiveCampaign, Mailchimp or Kit (formerly ConvertKit), or use EasyCRM natively. Other connections include GoHighLevel, Keap, AWeber, Drip, Ontraport and Zapier. You map your webinar data as rules: when an event happens, then take an action, with a value such as a tag."},"1957":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-88","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#follow-up","content":"EasyCRM is the CRM built into EasyWebinar, and the two share one login. It holds leads, clients, deals, tasks, broadcasts and workflows. You don't need it to run webinars; it helps when your webinar leads outgrow a spreadsheet."},"1958":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-89","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#teams-security","content":"Each person gets their own login rather than sharing one. Sharing a login means you can't tell who did what, and only one of you can be in the live room as a host. The team members guide covers the Admin and User roles."},"1959":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-90","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#teams-security","content":"Agencies can add client workspaces. Each client gets a separate account you manage, and their webinars, registrants and settings stay apart from yours. Adding a workspace doesn't use a seat."},"1960":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-91","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#teams-security","content":"On security, EasyWebinar holds a SOC 2 Type II report and follows GDPR-aligned data practices."},"1961":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-92","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#limits","content":"These are the boundaries to plan around before you choose EasyWebinar:"},"1962":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-93","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#limits","content":"**The webinar type is fixed after creation.** Clone the webinar to change it."},"1963":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-94","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#limits","content":"**Some features start on higher plans.** Automation, EasyCRM, checkout and EasyCast start at Growth, and the AI Moderator starts at Pro. The limits and defaults page lists the allowances."},"1964":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-95","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#limits","content":"**It is not a course platform.** EasyWebinar does not host or deliver courses; it runs the webinar in front of your course platform."},"1965":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-96","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#limits","content":"**SMS, WhatsApp and Chat Simulation are in Beta.**"},"1966":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-97","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#limits","content":"**Attendee zoom has a narrow scope.** It works on desktop in live-room webinars and the green room. It is off on phones, in windows narrower than 768px and in automated webinars, and recordings never include it."},"1967":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-98","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#limits","content":"**Drawings are shared and short-lived.** Everyone in the session sees them, and they disappear when the share stops. They are not in the recording, and you can't draw on a video share."},"1968":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-99","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#limits","content":"**There is no free plan.** The standard trial is 7 days and requires a card."},"1969":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-100","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#what-is-easywebinar","content":"EasyWebinar is a webinar platform for live, simulive and evergreen webinars that collect leads and sell. You build pages, emails, polls and offers, run the webinar live or from a recording, then follow up through analytics and your CRM."},"1970":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-101","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#who-is-it-for","content":"It suits creators, coaches, consultants, small businesses and marketing teams whose webinars have to keep working after the live hour. Agencies use client workspaces, and SaaS and customer success teams run demos and training as evergreen sessions."},"1971":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-102","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#what-it-doesnt-do","content":"It does not host or deliver courses, and it is not a free tool: there is no free plan. Automation, EasyCRM, checkout and EasyCast start at the Growth plan, and the AI Moderator starts at Pro."},"1972":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-103","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#download","content":"No. Attendees join from any browser, with nothing to download, no plugin and no account."},"1973":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-104","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#simulive-vs-evergreen","content":"A simulive webinar plays a recording at set times, so everyone watches together. An evergreen webinar runs on a repeating schedule, with just-in-time, on-demand and recurring sessions that each registrant picks."},"1974":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-105","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#keep-crm","content":"Yes. You can keep HubSpot, Salesforce Pardot (Account Engagement), ActiveCampaign, Mailchimp or Kit (formerly ConvertKit), or use EasyCRM natively. EasyCRM is optional for running webinars."},"1975":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-106","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#sell-a-course","content":"Yes, as the conversion layer in front of your course platform. You run the sales webinar, show an offer in the room that opens your checkout, and follow up. The course sales guide shows the set-up."},"1976":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-107","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#zoom-in","content":"Yes, in live-room webinars on desktop, up to 400%. The zoom happens only in that attendee's browser. It is off on phones, in narrow windows and in automated webinars, and recordings never include it."},"1977":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-108","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#stream-out","content":"Yes, with EasyCast. It streams a live webinar to YouTube, LinkedIn or a custom RTMP destination at the same time, and it starts at the Growth plan."},"1978":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-109","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#security","content":"EasyWebinar holds a SOC 2 Type II report and follows GDPR-aligned data practices. Ask EasyWebinar directly for any detail beyond that."},"1979":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-110","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#cost","content":"Prices change, so this page doesn't list them. The pricing page has current plans, and the standard trial is 7 days with a card required."},"1980":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-111","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#why-choose","content":"The post on why teams choose EasyWebinar sets out the case in more depth."},"1981":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-112","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#related","content":"Webinars overview"},"1982":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-113","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#related","content":"Clone a webinar"},"1983":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-114","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#related","content":"Video hosting"},"1984":{"id":"/product-docs/product-summary-115","page_id":"/product-docs/product-summary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/product-summary#related","content":"EasyWebinar product documentation"},"1985":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"page","content":"Limits and defaults","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Reference"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults"},"1986":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-0","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","content":"Every limit, allowance and default setting in EasyWebinar in one place, with its unit and where it applies."},"1987":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-1","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"Attendee capacity by plan"},"1988":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-2","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"Webinars and scheduling"},"1989":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-3","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#registration-and-selling","content":"Registration and selling"},"1990":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-4","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#video-and-media","content":"Video and media"},"1991":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-5","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#ai-credits","content":"AI credits"},"1992":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-6","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#easycrm-allowance","content":"EasyCRM sending allowance"},"1993":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-7","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#team-and-account","content":"Team and account"},"1994":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-8","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#add-ons","content":"Add-ons"},"1995":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-9","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#related","content":"Related"},"1996":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-10","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","content":"Use this page to check a number before you plan a webinar. Each row names the unit and where the limit applies. Prices are not listed here; see the live pricing page for current prices."},"1997":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-11","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"| Plan       | Live attendees | Automated attendees |\n| ---------- | -------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Launch** | 50             | Not listed          |","table":"table-0"},"1998":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-12","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"| Plan       | Live attendees | Automated attendees |\n| ---------- | -------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Growth** | 200            | 1,000               |","table":"table-0"},"1999":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-13","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"| Plan    | Live attendees | Automated attendees |\n| ------- | -------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Pro** | 500            | 2,500               |","table":"table-0"},"2000":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-14","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"| Plan      | Live attendees | Automated attendees |\n| --------- | -------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Scale** | 1,000          | 5,000               |","table":"table-0"},"2001":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-15","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"Capacities as shown in the plan chooser. Plans are billed monthly or yearly. The **Plan** tab under **Settings** meters live attendees, automated attendees and storage."},"2002":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-16","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"**Live attendees** counts people joining live sessions in the current period."},"2003":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-17","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"**Automated attendees** counts people watching simulive and evergreen sessions."},"2004":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-18","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"**Usage resets with your billing period**, so the meters show the current period only."},"2005":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-19","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#attendee-capacity","content":"Check the meters before a big promotion. Running out of live attendee capacity mid-launch is an avoidable problem, and add-ons for high-traffic webinars covers planning for a large audience."},"2006":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-20","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item         | Value                          | Notes |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------ | ----- |\n| Webinar name | Character counter on the field |       |","table":"table-1"},"2007":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-21","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item         | Value                | Notes                          |\n| ------------ | -------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Webinar type | Fixed after creation | Clone the webinar to change it |","table":"table-1"},"2008":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-22","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item                 | Value            | Notes                              |\n| -------------------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| Default webinar type | **Live Webinar** | Choose the type when you create it |","table":"table-1"},"2009":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-23","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item                       | Value             | Notes                        |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Default schedule frequency | **Specific Date** | Also **Daily** or **Weekly** |","table":"table-1"},"2010":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-24","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item             | Value                 | Notes |\n| ---------------- | --------------------- | ----- |\n| Default timezone | Your account timezone |       |","table":"table-1"},"2011":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-25","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item                        | Value                                | Notes |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----- |\n| Default schedule preference | Show only the next available session |       |","table":"table-1"},"2012":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-26","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item          | Value              | Notes                   |\n| ------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------- |\n| Past sessions | Can't be scheduled | Past dates are disabled |","table":"table-1"},"2013":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-27","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item                  | Value                       | Notes                                             |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| Just-in-time interval | 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes | Evergreen webinars only; see choosing an interval |","table":"table-1"},"2014":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-28","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item                                  | Value                      | Notes                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Sessions in the attendee's local time | Just-in-time sessions only | Live and scheduled sessions use the webinar's timezone |","table":"table-1"},"2015":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-29","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#webinars-and-scheduling","content":"| Item                  | Value | Notes                                                                |\n| --------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Webinars live at once | One   | Starting another shows \"You can only have one event live at a time.\" |","table":"table-1"},"2016":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-30","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#registration-and-selling","content":"| Item            | Value    | Notes                       |\n| --------------- | -------- | --------------------------- |\n| Default pricing | **Free** | Choose **Paid** at creation |","table":"table-2"},"2017":{"id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults-31","page_id":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/reference/limits-and-defaults#registration-and-selling","content":"| Item           | Value      | Notes                                                      |\n| -------------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------