ment and nonprofit events"},"2573":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-42","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"How EasyWebinar compares for paid webinars and workshops"},"2574":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-43","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare-stronger","content":"Why EasyWebinar is the stronger choice for paid webinars and workshops"},"2575":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-44","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"2576":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-45","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#common-questions","content":"Common questions about paid webinars"},"2577":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-46","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-charge","content":"How do I charge for an online workshop?"},"2578":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-47","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-replay","content":"Do paid attendees get the replay?"},"2579":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-48","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-webinar-vs-workshop","content":"What is the difference between a webinar and a workshop?"},"2580":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-49","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-money","content":"Where does the money go?"},"2581":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-50","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-abandoned","content":"Is someone registered if they close the checkout without paying?"},"2582":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-51","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-recorded","content":"Can I sell a recorded seminar instead of teaching live?"},"2583":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-52","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-change-price","content":"Can I change the price after tickets go on sale?"},"2584":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-53","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-private","content":"How do I keep buyers' questions private?"},"2585":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-54","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-disclaimer","content":"Can I add a disclaimer or a consent box?"},"2586":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-55","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-ends","content":"What happens when the workshop ends?"},"2587":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-56","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-sms","content":"Can I send text reminders to buyers?"},"2588":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-57","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-who-paid","content":"Where do I see who has paid?"},"2589":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-58","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-regulated","content":"Can I run paid workshops on health or financial topics?"},"2590":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-59","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-upsell","content":"Can I sell something else during a paid workshop?"},"2591":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-60","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#further-reading","content":"Further reading"},"2592":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-61","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#related","content":"Related"},"2593":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-62","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","content":"A paid webinar turns your live online workshop or seminar into something people buy before they get the join link. To run one, you need four things: a price on the registration page, a way to take payment, a room built for teaching, and a clear rule about the replay. EasyWebinar takes payment through your own Stripe account at the moment of registration. It runs the session with chat, Q&A and polls, and lets you sell the replay as its own option."},"2594":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-63","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#at-a-glance","content":"| Stage            | What you decide                               | Where it happens in EasyWebinar                              |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Before you build | Live, simulive or evergreen, and paid or free | The create flow, where the type and **Paid** are chosen once |","table":"table-0"},"2595":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-64","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#at-a-glance","content":"| Stage          | What you decide                                                              | Where it happens in EasyWebinar                  |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| Taking payment | The price, what the ticket is called, and whether a replay option is on sale | **Step 3 of 4 · Pricing**, with Stripe connected |","table":"table-0"},"2596":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-65","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#at-a-glance","content":"| Stage        | What you decide                                                  | Where it happens in EasyWebinar              |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| Registration | Which details you ask for, and whether a consent box is required | The registration form on the **Content** tab |","table":"table-0"},"2597":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-66","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#at-a-glance","content":"| Stage                | What you decide                                                    | Where it happens in EasyWebinar |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| Getting people there | Confirmation, reminders and, if you have phone numbers, SMS (Beta) | The **Notifications** tab       |","table":"table-0"},"2598":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-67","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#at-a-glance","content":"| Stage    | What you decide                                                    | Where it happens in EasyWebinar                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| Teaching | How people talk to you and each other, and when you ask a question | **Engagement** and **CTAs** tabs, then the live room |","table":"table-0"},"2599":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-68","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#at-a-glance","content":"| Stage      | What you decide                                   | Where it happens in EasyWebinar |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| The replay | Who gets it, for how long, and what it looks like | The **Replay** tab              |","table":"table-0"},"2600":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-69","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#at-a-glance","content":"| Stage      | What you decide                              | Where it happens in EasyWebinar                            |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Afterwards | What buyers see next, and what you've earned | **End of Session**, follow-ups and **Analytics → Revenue** |","table":"table-0"},"2601":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-70","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#where-it-fits","content":"Picture a trainer who has run free sessions for a year and now wants to charge for a deeper, hands-on one. The questions arrive at once: how do people pay, how do only buyers get in, and what happens to the recording? A paid webinar answers all three in one place."},"2602":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-71","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#fits-what-its-for","content":"A paid workshop or seminar sells your time and attention live, to a group, for a set price. People pay at registration, so everyone in the room has already said yes to you."},"2603":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-72","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#fits-how-it-helps","content":"**Payment and the seat arrive together.** A buyer pays on the Stripe checkout and is registered once the payment goes through."},"2604":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-73","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#fits-how-it-helps","content":"**The money lands in your own account.** Stripe pays out to your bank on its usual schedule."},"2605":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-74","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#fits-how-it-helps","content":"**The replay becomes a second product.** You can sell live access alone or live access with the recording."},"2606":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-75","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#fits-how-it-helps","content":"**One webinar shows its revenue.** The Overview tab and the Revenue view show what this workshop took."},"2607":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-76","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#fits-without-it","content":"Without a paid route, you either give the workshop away or stitch together a payment link, a spreadsheet and a meeting invite. People who paid get missed, and people who didn't pay find the link."},"2608":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-77","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#fits-why","content":"This matters most to coaches, consultants, wellness practitioners and specialist trainers whose knowledge is the product. It matters most when the first paid session goes on sale."},"2609":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-78","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A registered nutritionist runs a free monthly talk for new parents and now wants to sell a 90-minute live meal-planning workshop. She wants buyers to ask questions as she goes, and she wants to sell the recording to people who can't make the time."},"2610":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-79","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#approach","content":"The usual way to do this joins several tools together. A payment page takes the money, a form or spreadsheet tracks who paid, and someone emails a meeting link by hand. That tends to work for ten people and break at forty. A late payer misses the email, or a forwarded link lets in someone who never paid."},"2611":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-80","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#approach","content":"What changed is simple. Once payment and registration happen in the same step, there is no gap between paying and getting the join link. The list of registrants is the list of buyers, so nothing needs to be checked by hand before the session."},"2612":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-81","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#approach","content":"EasyWebinar puts the price on the registration page and sends the buyer to a Stripe checkout when they click **Register Now**. Once payment goes through, it registers them and shows their personal join link. It also lets the nutritionist add a **Live + Replay bundle** with its own price, so the recording is sold rather than given away."},"2613":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-82","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#approach","content":"You can see the split for yourself on any paid webinar. The **Revenue by Source** view separates paid registrations from offers sold in the room. The way this compares with other platforms is covered in How EasyWebinar compares for paid webinars and workshops, below."},"2614":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-83","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#webinar-vs-workshop","content":"A webinar is usually a talk with questions at the end. A workshop asks the audience to do something during the session: answer, try, decide. A seminar sits between the two, with an expert leading a group through one subject in depth. The guide to seminar types and how to host one covers the formats in more detail."},"2615":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-84","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#webinar-vs-workshop","content":"Charging changes three things, whichever of these you run. First, the promise has to be specific, because people are buying a result rather than attending out of curiosity. Second, the room has to give buyers a voice, so chat and Q&A matter more than on a free talk. Third, the replay stops being a courtesy. It becomes part of what you sell, so you need to decide who gets it before you take the first payment."},"2616":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-85","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#webinar-vs-workshop","content":"The product side is the same in each case. A paid workshop in EasyWebinar is a webinar with **Paid** chosen on the pricing step, plus the engagement settings that suit teaching."},"2617":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-86","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#ways-to-charge","content":"There are four common ways to take money for a live session. Each one catches some problems and misses others, so it helps to see them side by side before you build."},"2618":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-87","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#ticket-at-registration","content":"The buyer pays and registers in one step, and only buyers receive the join link. This catches the biggest risk, which is paid buyers who never get in. It misses anyone who wants to try before they buy, so it suits a known audience or a second, deeper session."},"2619":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-88","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#separate-checkout","content":"You sell on a payment page and send the link afterwards. This works with any payment tool. It misses timing: anyone who pays late, or whose email is filtered, depends on you noticing in time."},"2620":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-89","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#membership-link","content":"You sell access elsewhere and post the join link inside it. This suits hosts who already sell there. It misses the workshop's own numbers, because sales and attendance live in different places."},"2621":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-90","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#free-then-sell","content":"The workshop is free, and you sell a paid next step during it with an offer button. This catches the biggest audience. It misses the commitment a paid ticket brings, and it puts the sale at the end rather than the start."},"2622":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-91","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#confirmed","content":"EasyWebinar does the first and fourth natively. Paid registration takes payment through Stripe before registering the buyer. Offers shown during the session open the button URL you set, which can be your own checkout or booking page. Its paid webinar features cover live, simulive and evergreen webinars."},"2623":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-92","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#choose-format","content":"You choose the webinar type once, when you create it, and **the type can't be changed later**. Make this choice before you think about pricing."},"2624":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-93","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#choose-format","content":"| If your workshop is                                       | Choose   | Why                                                 |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| Taught in real time, with questions answered as they come | **Live** | You present, and chat and Q&A happen as they happen |","table":"table-1"},"2625":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-94","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#choose-format","content":"| If your workshop is                                             | Choose       | Why                                                                                 |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| A polished recording, played at set times, with you in the chat | **Simulive** | Everyone watching a session sees the same moment, so the chat still works as a room |","table":"table-1"},"2626":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-95","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#choose-format","content":"| If your workshop is                                                 | Choose        | Why                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| A recorded seminar that should sell whether or not you're available | **Evergreen** | It runs on a repeating schedule, and each registrant picks a session |","table":"table-1"},"2627":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-96","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#choose-format","content":"Simulive and evergreen webinars both offer **Free** or **Paid** on their pricing step, so a recorded paid seminar is possible from the start. If you'd rather prove the workshop live first, turn a past live session into an evergreen one by cloning it. The simulive setup explains how a recording plays at set times."},"2628":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-97","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#choose-format","content":"Time zones work differently by type. A live session runs at one fixed time in the timezone you set, and the registration page shows that time with its timezone. If your buyers are spread across regions, add more sessions with **Add Session** rather than expecting the time to shift for each person."},"2629":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-98","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"It helps to see the full job without any webinar platform, because each step is something that can go wrong."},"2630":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-99","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"Write the promise: who the workshop is for, what they'll leave with, and how long it runs."},"2631":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-100","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"Set a price, and decide now whether the recording is included, sold separately or not offered."},"2632":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-101","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"Create a payment page and a registration form, and make sure both ask for the same email address."},"2633":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-102","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"After each payment, copy the buyer onto your attendee list and send them the join link."},"2634":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-103","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"Send reminders a day before, an hour before and shortly before the start."},"2635":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-104","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"Check the list against payments before you go live, so nobody unpaid is let in."},"2636":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-105","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"Teach, keeping one person on chat and questions if you can."},"2637":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-106","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"Record the session, upload it somewhere private, and send it to whoever the replay rule covers."},"2638":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-107","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"Send buyers their next step, then add up what came in and how many turned up."},"2639":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-108","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#by-hand","content":"Steps 3, 4 and 6 are where most hand-run workshops fail. A copied email is wrong, a payment arrives at night, or a forwarded link gets through."},"2640":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-109","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#same-job","content":"EasyWebinar collapses steps 3, 4 and 6 into one. The buyer's email carries over from the registration form to the Stripe checkout, and they are registered only once the payment goes through. Reminders are set once on the **Notifications** tab. Recording shows as **Auto Recording Enabled** in the live room when it's switched on. The **Replay** tab handles step 8, and **Analytics → Revenue** answers step 9."},"2641":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-110","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#build-it","content":"The full pricing walkthrough lives on paid webinars and paid registration. This section covers only the choices a workshop host has to get right."},"2642":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-111","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#choose-paid","content":"Create the webinar from **My Webinars → Create a Webinar**, as the live webinar setup describes. On **Step 3 of 4 · Pricing**, **Free** is selected until you change it."},"2643":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-112","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#choose-paid","content":"This is the one moment to decide that your workshop is paid, because switching a free webinar later keeps the free form."},"2644":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-113","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#choose-paid","content":"Choose **Paid** here rather than later. If you switch an existing free webinar to paid, its registration page keeps the free form. In that case, create a new webinar and choose **Paid** on this step."},"2645":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-114","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#name-the-ticket","content":"Choosing **Paid** reveals the **Pricing Title**, an optional **Description**, the **Live webinar price** in US dollars and the Stripe connection. The title and description appear on your registration page and at checkout, so write them as the buyer would describe the purchase."},"2646":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-115","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#name-the-ticket","content":"Name the ticket for what buyers get, such as a 90-minute live workshop, and connect Stripe here if it isn't linked yet."},"2647":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-116","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#name-the-ticket","content":"If Stripe isn't connected, a **Payments · Action required** panel shows a **Connect with Stripe** button. Payouts go directly to your own bank account, and EasyWebinar never holds your funds. If the paid option isn't behaving as expected, check that **Paid Webinars** shows as active on the **Add-ons** tab under **Settings → Manage Plan**."},"2648":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-117","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#decide-replay","content":"Turn on **Live + Replay bundle** if you want to sell a second option that includes the replay recording, with its own price. The registration page then shows two options to choose from. Make this call before the page goes live, because it changes what your first buyers are promised."},"2649":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-118","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#registration-form","content":"The form starts with **Full name** and **Email**. On the **Content** tab you can add a **Phone** field, your own custom registration fields, and **GDPR Compliance**, which adds a consent checkbox you word yourself and can make mandatory."},"2650":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-119","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#registration-form","content":"Ask only for what you'll use. Nielsen Norman Group's form research found that every field you cut increases a form's conversion rate, and a paid form already asks for a payment. The UK's data protection rules also expect personal data to be limited to only what is necessary for your purpose. A phone number earns its place only if you plan to send SMS reminders."},"2651":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-120","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#registration-form","content":"If your workshop needs a disclaimer, for example on financial or health topics, add it as a text block in the registration page builder. Its templates include **Coach**, **Education** and **Health & Wellness** categories."},"2652":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-121","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#reminders","content":"The **Registration Confirmation** email goes out the moment someone registers and carries their join link, so leave it on. Add webinar reminder emails on the **Notifications** tab, each with its own timing before the start. A common pattern is three: a day before, an hour before and fifteen minutes before."},"2653":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-122","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#reminders","content":"SMS (Beta) works only for people whose phone number you have. Set your sender name in **Email Settings** to a name buyers will recognise, as the confirmation email settings explain."},"2654":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-123","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#after-paying","content":"Once payment goes through, the buyer is registered and sent to your thank-you page. It shows their personal join link and the session date, with calendar buttons."},"2655":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-124","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#after-paying","content":"Run one test purchase before launch and check that this page shows the right session and a working join link."},"2656":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-125","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#after-paying","content":"Buyers outside the US may be offered the price in their own currency beside the dollar price, and Stripe handles the conversion. If someone closes the checkout without paying, they are not registered."},"2657":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-126","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#teach-it","content":"A paid audience expects to be heard. Set the room up on the **Engagement** and **CTAs** tabs before the session, not during it."},"2658":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-127","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#teach-chat","content":"Live chat has two visibility settings. **Everyone** lets attendees see and answer each other, which suits most workshops. **Hosts only** makes each attendee's messages private to your team. Choose it for sensitive topics, or where buyers shouldn't see each other's questions."},"2659":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-128","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#teach-qa","content":"Q&A is a separate queue from chat. **Private Q&A** shows questions only to hosts and moderators, so one person's question doesn't set the agenda. A common workshop setup is **Everyone** for chat plus **Private Q&A**."},"2660":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-129","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#teach-polls","content":"Polls let you stop and ask the room something. Ask a question about the audience rather than a test, such as which step they're stuck on. The answer tells you where to spend the next ten minutes."},"2661":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-130","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#teach-cohost","content":"You enter through a green room and backstage where nothing is broadcast. A co-host or moderator lands backstage, not on stage. They can watch chat and Q&A until you bring them on. The live webinar walkthrough covers going live and ending the session."},"2662":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-131","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#teach-cohost","content":"Before you go live, check the header reads **Auto Recording Enabled**. That recording is what your replay page will show, as the automatic recording guide explains."},"2663":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-132","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#replay-access","content":"\"Do paid attendees get the replay?\" is the question buyers ask most, so answer it on the registration page. You have three choices."},"2664":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-133","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#replay-access","content":"| Your rule            | How to set it                                              |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Live only, no replay | Leave **Live + Replay bundle** off and the replay page off |","table":"table-2"},"2665":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-134","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#replay-access","content":"| Your rule                 | How to set it                                       |\n| ------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| Replay sold as an upgrade | Turn on **Live + Replay bundle** with its own price |","table":"table-2"},"2666":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-135","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#replay-access","content":"| Your rule                 | How to set it                                                                        |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Replay for a limited time | Turn on **Enable replay page** and choose **Expire after days** or **Specific date** |","table":"table-2"},"2667":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-136","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#replay-access","content":"The **Replay** tab controls the page itself. **Always Available** keeps it up with no expiry, which suits training that keeps its value. Once the page is on, it reads that anyone with the link can watch, so treat the link as public and share it with care."},"2668":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-137","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#replay-access","content":"**Webinar Replica** gives replay viewers the same video, offers, polls and chat replay as the live session. **Custom Build** lets you design a different page. The replay page settings cover both, along with **After the replay ends**, which sends viewers on when the recording finishes."},"2669":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-138","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#after-workshop","content":"When the stream ends, attendees stay on a finished webinar unless you fill in **End of Session** on the **Settings** tab. Point it at your booking page, your next workshop or a thank-you page. This is how a seminar that sells a coaching programme or a consultation turns into booked calls."},"2670":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-139","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#after-workshop","content":"During the session, an offer can show a button that opens your own checkout or booking page. Offer sales show under **Paid Offer** in the Revenue view, apart from ticket sales."},"2671":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-140","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#after-workshop","content":"On the **Notifications** tab, **Webinar Follow-ups** go to registrants, attendees or no-shows after the session. **Attendee Action Follow-ups** respond to what someone did, such as clicking an offer. The webinar follow-up email templates give wording for each group."},"2672":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-141","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#measure-it","content":"Two measures tell you most about a paid workshop. Both sit inside the webinar, so you don't need a spreadsheet."},"2673":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-142","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#checkout-completion","content":"This is the share of people who reached checkout and paid. Work it out as completed checkouts divided by completed plus abandoned checkouts. A low figure points at the price, the ticket wording or a surprise at checkout rather than at your marketing."},"2674":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-143","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#checkout-completion","content":"Find it in the webinar's **Analytics** tab under **Revenue**, then **Paid Webinar**. It lists completed, pending and abandoned checkouts, and a searchable list of every transaction with its status."},"2675":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-144","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#paid-attendance","content":"This is the share of paid registrants who showed up, live or on replay. Paid buyers usually care, but they still forget. A gap here is a reminder problem, not a sales problem."},"2676":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-145","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#paid-attendance","content":"The webinar analytics funnel shows **Live Attended**, **Replay Watched** and **Total Attended**, which counts each person once. The People view lists who registered and who attended."},"2677":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-146","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#measure-limits","content":"Pending checkouts haven't finished yet, so leave them out until they settle. Replay views are counted apart from live attendance, so a bundle buyer who watched both shows under **Both**. On a small workshop, a few people can swing either percentage widely, so look across several sessions before you change the price."},"2678":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-147","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#measure-limits","content":"You can also check the **Revenue** total on the webinar Overview tab, next to **Registration Pricing**."},"2679":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-148","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#worked-example","content":"This is an illustrative calculation with sample figures, not an EasyWebinar output. Suppose you want 30 people in the live room and you know roughly how your page performs."},"2680":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-149","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#worked-example","content":"| Step                       | Sample figure | Arithmetic     |\n| -------------------------- | ------------- | -------------- |\n| Registration page visitors | 1,000         | Starting point |","table":"table-3"},"2681":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-150","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#worked-example","content":"| Step                                      | Sample figure | Arithmetic |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------- |\n| Click **Register Now** and reach checkout | 80            | 1,000 × 8% |","table":"table-3"},"2682":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-151","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#worked-example","content":"| Step              | Sample figure | Arithmetic                   |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Complete checkout | 48            | 80 × 60% checkout completion |","table":"table-3"},"2683":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-152","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#worked-example","content":"| Step             | Sample figure | Arithmetic |\n| ---------------- | ------------- | ---------- |\n| Abandon checkout | 32            | 80 − 48    |","table":"table-3"},"2684":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-153","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#worked-example","content":"| Step                                | Sample figure | Arithmetic |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------- |\n| Choose the **Live + Replay bundle** | 12            | 48 × 25%   |","table":"table-3"},"2685":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-154","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#worked-example","content":"| Step        | Sample figure | Arithmetic               |\n| ----------- | ------------- | ------------------------ |\n| Attend live | 36            | 48 × 75% paid attendance |","table":"table-3"},"2686":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-155","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#worked-example","content":"At these rates, 1,000 visitors fill the room with a little to spare. The bigger lever is checkout, not traffic. Raising checkout completion from 60% to 75% adds 12 paid seats from the same 1,000 visitors, while getting those 12 seats from traffic would take 250 more visitors."},"2687":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-156","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#seminar-sells-programme","content":"A real-estate investing trainer charges a small fee for a live seminar, then shows an offer for the full coaching programme. Ticket sales and in-room offer sales appear apart in **Revenue by Source**."},"2688":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-157","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#wellness-workshops","content":"A breathwork teacher sells a monthly live workshop with a **Live + Replay bundle**, so people in other time zones can buy the recording. **Hosts only** chat keeps personal questions private."},"2689":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-158","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#financial-education","content":"An investor-education firm runs a paid seminar with a disclaimer block on the registration page and a required consent box. Replays use **Specific date** so older material closes on schedule."},"2690":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-159","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#recruitment-nonprofit","content":"Hiring teams and charities use the same set-up for paid assessment sessions or ticketed donor briefings. **Show Attendees** can be switched off so guests don't see each other."},"2691":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-160","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"EasyWebinar takes payment through Stripe inside the registration step and can sell the replay as its own option. It then shows the workshop's revenue on the webinar itself. Buyers pay once, get their link at once, and you see the result in one place."},"2692":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-161","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"Paid webinar features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"2693":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-162","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"| Platform        | Ticket paid inside registration | Replay sold as its own option | Revenue total for the webinar |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                             | Yes                           | Yes                           |","table":"table-4"},"2694":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-163","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"| Platform | Ticket paid inside registration      | Replay sold as its own option             | Revenue total for the webinar         |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Zoom** | Yes (payment completes registration) | Partly (viewing included with the ticket) | Partly (order export for paid events) |","table":"table-4"},"2695":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-164","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Ticket paid inside registration           | Replay sold as its own option | Revenue total for the webinar           |\n| ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Partly (your own checkout, then the form) | Not in docs                   | Yes (registration revenue in analytics) |","table":"table-4"},"2696":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-165","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"| Platform      | Ticket paid inside registration       | Replay sold as its own option | Revenue total for the webinar       |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Yes (charge confirmed before sign-up) | Not in docs                   | Partly (paid amount per registrant) |","table":"table-4"},"2697":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-166","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"| Platform         | Ticket paid inside registration | Replay sold as its own option                | Revenue total for the webinar |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **WebinarNinja** | Yes (card charged on the form)  | Partly (registrations reopen for the replay) | Not in docs                   |","table":"table-4"},"2698":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-167","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"| Platform  | Ticket paid inside registration  | Replay sold as its own option | Revenue total for the webinar |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Partly (payment app plus Zapier) | Not in docs                   | Not in docs                   |","table":"table-4"},"2699":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-168","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"2700":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-169","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare-stronger","content":"**Buyers are registered the moment they pay.** EasyWebinar registers the buyer once Stripe payment goes through. WebinarJam's PayPal guide warns that people aren't registered until they complete the post-payment form. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam."},"2701":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-170","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare-stronger","content":"**The replay has its own price.** EasyWebinar's **Live + Replay bundle** sells the recording as a second option. Zoom's recording access comes as complimentary viewing included with the ticket. See EasyWebinar vs Zoom."},"2702":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-171","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare-stronger","content":"**Payment is built in.** EasyWebinar's checkout is part of the pricing step. Demio's help centre describes paid access through a payment app and a Zapier Zap. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"2703":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-172","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 4 November 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"2704":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-173","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#limits","content":"**Paid is chosen at creation.** A free webinar switched to paid keeps its free registration form, so create a new webinar with **Paid** selected."},"2705":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-174","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#limits","content":"**The webinar type is fixed.** Live, simulive and evergreen can't be swapped later. Clone the webinar to change it."},"2706":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-175","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#limits","content":"**Prices are set in US dollars.** Stripe may show buyers outside the US their local currency."},"2707":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-176","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#limits","content":"**Payment runs through Stripe only.** Connect a Stripe account on the pricing step or from **Integrations → Payment**."},"2708":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-177","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#limits","content":"**A live session runs at one fixed time.** Buyers in other regions need another session added with **Add Session**."},"2709":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-178","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#limits","content":"**An open replay page is public to anyone with the link.** Use an expiry if access should end."},"2710":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-179","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-charge","content":"Create a webinar, choose **Paid** on **Step 3 of 4 · Pricing**, set a pricing title and price, and connect Stripe. Buyers then pay at checkout when they click **Register Now** on your registration page."},"2711":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-180","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-replay","content":"Only if your rule says so. Turn on **Live + Replay bundle** to sell the recording as its own option, or enable the replay page for a limited time. Say which applies on your registration page."},"2712":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-181","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-webinar-vs-workshop","content":"A webinar is mostly a talk with questions. A workshop asks people to take part during the session, so chat, Q&A and polls do more of the work. Both are set up the same way in EasyWebinar."},"2713":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-182","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-money","content":"Payments go straight to your own Stripe account, and Stripe pays out to your bank on its usual schedule. EasyWebinar never holds your funds."},"2714":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-183","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-abandoned","content":"No. They appear under **Checkout abandoned** in the Revenue view and are not registered, so they don't receive a join link."},"2715":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-184","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-recorded","content":"Yes. Simulive and evergreen webinars both offer **Free** or **Paid** on their pricing step. Simulive plays the recording at set times, and evergreen lets each registrant pick a session."},"2716":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-185","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-change-price","content":"Yes. Use the pencil beside **Registration Pricing** on the webinar's Overview tab to edit the title and price."},"2717":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-186","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-private","content":"Set chat to **Hosts only**, so each attendee talks privately to your team, and set Q&A to **Private Q&A**. Turning off **Show Attendees** hides the attendee list as well."},"2718":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-187","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-disclaimer","content":"Yes. Add a text block to the registration page for the disclaimer, and turn on **GDPR Compliance** in the form to add a consent checkbox you word yourself and can make mandatory."},"2719":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-188","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-ends","content":"Attendees go wherever you set in **End of Session** on the Settings tab. Leave it empty and they stay on the finished webinar, so point it at your booking page or next offer."},"2720":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-189","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-sms","content":"Yes, with SMS (Beta), for buyers who gave a phone number. Add the **Phone** field to your registration form first, then set the SMS messages on the Notifications tab."},"2721":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-190","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-who-paid","content":"Open **Analytics → Revenue → Paid Webinar**. It lists every transaction with the buyer's name, email, session, date, amount and status, and you can search it or filter by status."},"2722":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-191","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-regulated","content":"You can add disclaimers and consent, keep chat private and set the replay to close. EasyWebinar holds a SOC 2 Type II report and follows GDPR-aligned data practices. Check your own sector's rules before you start."},"2723":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-192","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#faq-upsell","content":"Yes. Add an offer on the CTAs tab with a button that opens your own checkout or booking page. Offer sales show under **Paid Offer**, apart from ticket sales."},"2724":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-193","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops#further-reading","content":"Website Forms Usability: Top 10 Recommendations, Nielsen Norman Group, 2016: why each extra form field costs completions, and which fields to drop first."},"2725":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-seminars-workshops-194","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/paid-