ent":"Related"},"4252":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-65","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","content":"A webinar setup checklist is the list you work through before a live session so that the camera, the sound, the links and the timed pieces all work when people arrive. Most of what goes wrong on the day can be caught in a test run a day or two before, and the rest in the last half hour. This page gives you a fill-in checklist for both, says what each check catches, and shows where each one sits in EasyWebinar's live room, which lets you test privately before anything is broadcast."},"4253":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-66","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#at-a-glance","content":"| When          | What to check                                                            | Why it matters                                                              |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| A week before | Join links for co-hosts, reminder timing, the redirect after the session | A missing link or an empty redirect can't be fixed once people are watching |","table":"table-0"},"4254":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-67","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#at-a-glance","content":"| When            | What to check                                            | Why it matters                       |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| Two days before | A full test run with a colleague watching as an attendee | It shows you what attendees will see |","table":"table-0"},"4255":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-68","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#at-a-glance","content":"| When           | What to check                                                   | Why it matters                                           |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| The day before | Polls and offers switched on or off, slides readable on a phone | Attendees on phones can't zoom in, so small text is lost |","table":"table-0"},"4256":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-69","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#at-a-glance","content":"| When              | What to check                                        | Why it matters                                                   |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 30 minutes before | Camera, microphone and speakers, then the green room | You can't enter the room until it sees a camera and a microphone |","table":"table-0"},"4257":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-70","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#at-a-glance","content":"| When              | What to check                                         | Why it matters                                                             |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 10 minutes before | Co-hosts backstage, screen share tested, recording on | Nothing in the green room is broadcast, so this is your last private check |","table":"table-0"},"4258":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-71","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#at-a-glance","content":"| When       | What to check          | Why it matters                                                 |\n| ---------- | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| At Go Live | Offers and polls ready | The confirmation reminds you that everyone waiting is moved in |","table":"table-0"},"4259":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-72","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#at-a-glance","content":"If your webinar starts within the hour, skip to the day-of part of the checklist below and work down it."},"4260":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-73","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#where-it-fits","content":"Picture the hour before a live session. The host is sorting slides, a co-host is still looking for the join link, and nobody has checked that the room is recording."},"4261":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-74","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#fits-what-its-for","content":"A webinar setup checklist turns that hour into a fixed order of checks. It covers testing and set-up only, not what you will say. For planning the session itself, the webinar content planning checklist on the EasyWebinar blog covers topics, structure and slides."},"4262":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-75","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#fits-how-it-helps","content":"**Problems surface while they are private.** You find a muted microphone in the green room, not in the chat."},"4263":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-76","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#fits-how-it-helps","content":"**Each person knows their part.** Co-hosts join backstage at a time you set, with their own link."},"4264":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-77","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#fits-how-it-helps","content":"**The timed pieces fire.** Reminders, polls and offers are checked before they are needed."},"4265":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-78","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#fits-how-it-helps","content":"**The ending is planned.** Attendees are sent to a page you chose, and the recording is waiting in your library."},"4266":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-79","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#fits-without-it","content":"Without a fixed list, checks happen in whatever order you remember them. The ones you forget tend to be the ones you can't fix live: an empty redirect, a co-host without a link, or recording switched off. Those cost you the replay, the next step for attendees, or the first five minutes of the session."},"4267":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-80","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#fits-why","content":"Customer success teams run the same onboarding or release webinar again and again, often with a different presenter each time. A shared checklist means the session works the same way whoever runs it. It matters most on the first run with a new co-host, and when the team is presenting to its largest customers."},"4268":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-81","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A four-person customer success team at an accounting software company runs a live onboarding webinar for new customers every month. One manager hosts, and a product specialist joins as co-host to answer setup questions in the chat."},"4269":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-82","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#approach","content":"The usual way to prepare is a private video call the day before, with the presenters talking through their slides. That can catch a bad microphone. It probably won't catch what attendees see, or whether the reminders arrive. Nor will it show where people land when the session ends."},"4270":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-83","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#approach","content":"What changed is simple. The checks that matter most happen inside the webinar platform itself. So the best test is the real room, set up for the real session, before anyone is watching."},"4271":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-84","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#approach","content":"EasyWebinar builds that test into the way you enter a live session. It asks you to check your camera, microphone and speakers before you reach the green room. It then keeps you in a green room where nothing is broadcast. Co-hosts wait backstage until you bring them on. Polls and offers can be switched on and off without deleting them, and reminders can be timed relative to the start."},"4272":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-85","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#approach","content":"You can see the first part of this on the device check screen, shown in Set up and test in EasyWebinar, below. The button to enter stays greyed out until the room can see both a camera and a microphone. How that compares with other tools is covered in How EasyWebinar compares for webinar setup checklists, below."},"4273":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-86","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#how-setups-get-tested","content":"There are four common ways to test a webinar before going live. Each catches some problems and misses others, which is why the checklist uses more than one."},"4274":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-87","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#solo-device-check","content":"You open the room on your own and look at your camera, your microphone level and your speakers. This catches the most common failure, a device the browser can't use. In Chrome, for example, a site that isn't allowed your camera or microphone won't work for video calls, and on a work computer your network administrator may control those settings. It misses everything attendees see."},"4275":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-88","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#full-test-run","content":"You run the session end to end, with a colleague registered as an ordinary attendee on a second device. This catches registration, reminders, the attendee view, polls and the redirect at the end. It takes the most time, so do it a day or two before, not on the day."},"4276":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-89","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#test-sends","content":"You send each reminder or text message to yourself before any registrant gets it. This catches wrong times, broken links and messages that read badly on a phone. It misses whether the room itself works."},"4277":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-90","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#phone-check","content":"You open the attendee view on a phone, or in a narrow browser window. This catches slides and shared screens that are too small to read. It matters because attendees on phones, and in browser windows narrower than 768 pixels, can't zoom in on what you share."},"4278":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-91","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#confirmed-in-easywebinar","content":"EasyWebinar asks every presenter to check their camera, microphone and speakers before entering, and keeps the green room private. **Send Test SMS** (Beta) sends a text message to a number you choose, and WhatsApp (Beta) messages can be tested the same way. The full test run and the phone check are things you do yourself, with a colleague."},"4279":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-92","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#checklist","content":"Copy this checklist into your own document or print it, and fill in the last column as you go. It is a template from this guide; EasyWebinar doesn't generate it for you. Each row names the screen where the check happens."},"4280":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-93","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#checklist-week-before","content":"| Check                                                   | Where                      | Done |\n| ------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ---- |\n| Date, time and time zone confirmed with every presenter | The webinar's **Overview** | ☐    |","table":"table-1"},"4281":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-94","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#checklist-week-before","content":"| Check                                                      | Where                        | Done |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| Co-presenter and moderator join links sent to each co-host | **Overview**, then **Share** | ☐    |","table":"table-1"},"4282":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-95","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#checklist-week-before","content":"| Check                                                                  | Where             | Done |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---- |\n| Reminder timings set, for example a day, an hour and 15 minutes before | **Notifications** | ☐    |","table":"table-1"},"4283":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-96","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#checklist-week-before","content":"| Check                                                                   | Where                     | Done |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ---- |\n| Phone field on the registration form, if you send text reminders (Beta) | Registration page builder | ☐    |","table":"table-1"},"4284":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-97","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist#checklist-week-before","content":"| Check                                                          | Where                         | Done |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ---- |\n| **End of Session** and **Expired Session** redirects filled in | **Settings**, **General** tab | ☐    |","table":"table-1"},"4285":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/webinar-preparation-checklist-98","page_id":"/product-docs/use-case