ople-30","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"4433":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-no-show-list","content":"How do I get a list of everyone who didn't turn up?"},"4434":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-watch-percentage","content":"Can I see how much of the webinar someone watched?"},"4435":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-campaign","content":"How do I know which campaign a registrant came from?"},"4436":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-columns","content":"Can I choose which columns I see?"},"4437":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-export-filters","content":"Does Export include only the filtered people?"},"4438":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-lead-score","content":"What does lead score mean?"},"4439":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-all-webinars","content":"Can I see people from all my webinars at once?"},"4440":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-clicked-not-bought","content":"Can I find people who clicked my offer but didn't buy?"},"4441":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-phone-empty","content":"Why is the Phone column empty?"},"4442":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#faq-result-count","content":"How do I see how many people match my filters?"},"4443":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#related","content":"Related"},"4444":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","content":"**People** is a single table of everyone who registered for or attended any of your EasyWebinar webinars. Each row shows one person on one webinar, with what they did: their attendance status, how much of the live session and the replay they watched, whether they clicked your offer, and a lead score for how engaged they were. You can filter the table by webinar, dates, behaviour, campaign source, device or location, and export exactly the segment you need."},"4445":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                           |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Where to find it** | **People** in the sidebar |","table":"table-0"},"4446":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                        |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What it covers** | Every registrant and attendee across all your webinars |","table":"table-0"},"4447":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                           |\n| -------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **One row is** | One person on one webinar |","table":"table-0"},"4448":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Key columns** | **Status**, **Lead score**, **Watch percentage**, **Replay watch percentage**, **Offer clicked** |","table":"table-0"},"4449":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |             |\n| ------------------ | ----------- |\n| **Choose columns** | **Columns** |","table":"table-0"},"4450":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                                         |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Filter categories** | **Webinar**, **Dates**, **User**, **Behavior**, **Source & UTM**, **Device & Location** |","table":"table-0"},"4451":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#at-a-glance","content":"|            |                                        |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Export** | **Export** downloads the filtered list |","table":"table-0"},"4452":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                          |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Campaign data** | Needs **UTM Params** turned on in your registration form |","table":"table-0"},"4453":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#what-it-is","content":"A webinar's own **Analytics** tab gives you counts: how many registered, how many attended, how many missed. **People** gives you the names behind those counts, for every webinar in your account at once."},"4454":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#what-it-is","content":"That changes what you can do after a session. Instead of knowing that a large share of registrants missed the webinar, you can see who they are, narrow the list to one webinar, and export it for a replay email. Instead of knowing that some people clicked your offer, you can find the ones who watched most of the session, clicked, and still haven't bought."},"4455":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#what-its-for","content":"People is the follow-up list. It turns webinar behaviour into segments you can act on. Think of no-shows to send the replay to, or engaged viewers to invite to a call. It also shows which campaigns brought attendees rather than just sign-ups."},"4456":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#how-it-helps","content":"**It shows behaviour, not just registration.** **Watch percentage**, **Replay watch percentage** and **Offer clicked** separate interested people from casual sign-ups."},"4457":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#how-it-helps","content":"**It ranks engagement for you.** **Lead score** rates how engaged each person was, which makes a long list quick to sort."},"4458":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#how-it-helps","content":"**It ties campaigns to attendance.** With UTM capture on, **Source & UTM** shows which campaign produced people who actually watched."},"4459":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#how-it-helps","content":"**It exports segments, not everything.** **Export** downloads the filtered list, so the work the filters did comes with it."},"4460":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#without-it","content":"Without a behaviour-level list, every registrant gets the same follow-up. The person who watched to the end and clicked your offer gets the same email as someone who never turned up. The people closest to buying are treated like everyone else."},"4461":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#why-buyers-care","content":"The People view matters to whoever owns the follow-up after a webinar, whether that's sales, marketing or a solo host. It matters most in the first day or two after a session, when per-person engagement data decides who gets a call first."},"4462":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#approach","content":"Take a typical case. An independent insurance agency with a six-person sales team runs a fortnightly live webinar on choosing life cover for young families. About 180 people register through social ads and a partner newsletter. Each session ends with an offer to book a quote call."},"4463":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#approach","content":"A common workaround is to download the full registrant list after each session and split it between agents alphabetically. Every name then gets the same call, in the same order. Warm prospects may wait behind people who never turned up, and nobody can say which channel produced the viewers."},"4464":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#approach","content":"The session doesn't need to change. What changes is the order of the calls. Someone who watched most of the webinar and clicked the offer should hear from an agent first. The ad budget should follow the channel that brought them."},"4465":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#approach","content":"EasyWebinar handles this in the **People** view. The team filters **Behavior** for high watch time and offer clicks, then adds **Source & UTM** to see which campaign each person came from. **Lead score** sorts the result, and **Export** hands the filtered list to the agents."},"4466":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#approach","content":"The screenshot under Filter the list shows the six filter categories, from **Webinar** to **Device & Location**, with **Apply Filter** marked. How other platforms handle people lists, filters and exports is covered in How the People view compares, below."},"4467":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#open-people","content":"Click **People** in the sidebar. The table lists registrants and attendees across every webinar, and the result count below the table shows how many rows match."},"4468":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"Each row is one person on one webinar, with columns including:"},"4469":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column             | What it tells you |\n| ------------------ | ----------------- |\n| **Name** and email | Who they are      |","table":"table-1"},"4470":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column    | What it tells you                       |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **Phone** | Their phone number, if you collected it |","table":"table-1"},"4471":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column     | What it tells you                              |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Status** | Attendance status, such as Attended or No Show |","table":"table-1"},"4472":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column         | What it tells you                      |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Lead score** | How engaged they were, for example Hot |","table":"table-1"},"4473":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column                   | What it tells you                                             |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar** and **Type** | Which webinar, and whether it was live, simulive or evergreen |","table":"table-1"},"4474":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column                  | What it tells you               |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Session date & time** | The session they registered for |","table":"table-1"},"4475":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column                | What it tells you |\n| --------------------- | ----------------- |\n| **Attendee timezone** | Where they are    |","table":"table-1"},"4476":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column            | What it tells you   |\n| ----------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Registered on** | When they signed up |","table":"table-1"},"4477":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column               | What it tells you                         |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Watch percentage** | How much of the live session they watched |","table":"table-1"},"4478":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column                      | What it tells you                   |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Replay watch percentage** | How much of the replay they watched |","table":"table-1"},"4479":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column      | What it tells you |\n| ----------- | ----------------- |\n| **Country** | Their country     |","table":"table-1"},"4480":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column    | What it tells you            |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Polls** | How many polls they answered |","table":"table-1"},"4481":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"| Column            | What it tells you               |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Offer clicked** | Whether they clicked your offer |","table":"table-1"},"4482":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#read-the-table","content":"Use **Columns** to choose which of these appear. **Watch percentage** and **Offer clicked** are the two most worth sorting by: someone who watched most of the session and clicked your offer is a very different prospect from someone who left in the first few minutes."},"4483":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"Click **Add Filter**."},"4484":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"*1 Categories · 2 Refinements · 3 Apply Filter.*"},"4485":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"Pick a category on the left, refine it on the right, then click **Apply Filter**."},"4486":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"| Category    | Filter by                             |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar** | A specific webinar, or a webinar type |","table":"table-2"},"4487":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"| Category  | Filter by                          |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Dates** | When people registered or attended |","table":"table-2"},"4488":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"| Category | Filter by                |\n| -------- | ------------------------ |\n| **User** | Attributes of the person |","table":"table-2"},"4489":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"| Category     | Filter by                                              |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Behavior** | What they did: attendance, watch time and offer clicks |","table":"table-2"},"4490":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"| Category         | Filter by                                           |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Source & UTM** | The campaign that brought them, if you capture UTMs |","table":"table-2"},"4491":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"| Category              | Filter by                                         |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Device & Location** | What they watched on, and where they watched from |","table":"table-2"},"4492":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#filter-the-list","content":"**Clear all** resets every filter. The result count below the table shows how far a filter narrowed the list."},"4493":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#useful-combinations","content":"| You want                                        | Filter                                   |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Everyone to send the replay to, for one webinar | **Behavior** → no-show, plus **Webinar** |","table":"table-3"},"4494":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#useful-combinations","content":"| You want                         | Filter                                           |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| Interested people who didn't buy | **Behavior** → high watch time and offer clicked |","table":"table-3"},"4495":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#useful-combinations","content":"| You want                                                  | Filter           |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| Which campaign produced attendees, not only registrations | **Source & UTM** |","table":"table-3"},"4496":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#useful-combinations","content":"| You want                                                   | Filter                  |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| How your automated funnel compares with your live sessions | **Webinar** → Evergreen |","table":"table-3"},"4497":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#export","content":"Click **Export** to download the filtered list. Use it to take a segment into another tool or to hand a list to someone who doesn't work in EasyWebinar."},"4498":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#export","content":"Filter first, then export. Exporting everything and cutting it down in a spreadsheet repeats work the filters already do, and **Export** respects whatever filters are applied."},"4499":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#capture-utms","content":"**Source & UTM** only has something to filter if your registration form records it. To set that up:"},"4500":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#capture-utms","content":"Open the webinar's **Content** tab and edit the **Registration Page**."},"4501":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#capture-utms","content":"Select the form block and turn on **UTM Params**, so each registration records the campaign that brought it in."},"4502":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#capture-utms","content":"Tag the links in your ads, emails and posts as you normally would."},"4503":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#capture-utms","content":"Filter **People** by **Source & UTM** to see which campaign each registrant came from."},"4504":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#capture-utms","content":"Because People also holds attendance and watch time, this gives you campaign attribution against real viewing, not just clicks. UTM capture is easy to miss; without it, you'll know how many people registered but not which ad, email or post sent them. See Registration page builder."},"4505":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#lead-score","content":"**Lead score** is calculated from engagement: attendance, watch time and interaction. It rates how engaged someone was, for example **Hot**, so you can sort a long list and start with the most engaged people. It's a quick way to prioritise. For the detail, read it alongside **Status**, **Watch percentage**, **Polls** and **Offer clicked** on the same row."},"4506":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#with-analytics","content":"The **Analytics** tab on a single webinar shows the funnel and offer numbers; People shows the individuals across all webinars. Use Analytics to find where a webinar is leaking, then People to find who is in that gap. See Webinar analytics."},"4507":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#with-follow-ups","content":"If you only need to email no-shows or attendees of one webinar, **Webinar Follow-ups** on the **Notifications** tab can target those audiences directly, and **Attendee Action Follow-ups** send based on engagement and offer clicks. People is for when you want to see the list, combine conditions, or take it elsewhere."},"4508":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#with-crm","content":"A connected CRM can receive the same behaviour as tags: **Missed**, **Watched full**, **Clicked offer** and more. People complements that by letting you look back across webinars and export a segment on demand. See Connect a CRM and map your webinar data."},"4509":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#with-registration-fields","content":"The **Phone** column fills only if your form collects it. Add the **Phone** field, or your own fields, on the registration form block. See Custom fields."},"4510":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how different teams use the same table."},"4511":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team running paid campaigns turns on **UTM Params** for every webinar, then filters People by **Source & UTM** each month to compare which channels produce attendees with high **Watch percentage**, not just sign-ups."},"4512":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#course-creators","content":"A creator filters for high watch time plus **Offer clicked** after each evergreen session and exports the list for a personal follow-up, since those viewers were interested enough to click but didn't enrol. See Course creators."},"4513":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#customer-success","content":"A customer success team runs recurring onboarding webinars and filters **Behavior** for no-shows on the latest session, then sends that group the replay so new customers don't fall behind."},"4514":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#agencies","content":"An agency running webinars for a client filters by **Webinar**, exports the attendees with their **Lead score** and **Offer clicked** columns, and hands the file to the client's sales team, who don't use EasyWebinar."},"4515":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare","content":"EasyWebinar puts everyone from every webinar in one table, filters it by what people did and which campaign brought them, and exports exactly the filtered list. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"4516":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare","content":"People list features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"4517":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare","content":"| Platform        | One list across every webinar | Filter by watch time and offer clicks | Campaign source (UTM) per person | Export the filtered list |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                           | Yes                                   | Yes                              | Yes                      |","table":"table-4"},"4518":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare","content":"| Platform  | One list across every webinar         | Filter by watch time and offer clicks | Campaign source (UTM) per person    | Export the filtered list |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **Demio** | Partly (inside each event's activity) | Partly (attended or no-show)          | Yes (UTM data in registrant export) | Yes (CSV by email)       |","table":"table-4"},"4519":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare","content":"| Platform      | One list across every webinar | Filter by watch time and offer clicks | Campaign source (UTM) per person     | Export the filtered list |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------ |\n| **Livestorm** | Yes (People page export)      | Partly (filter by session)            | Partly (source, medium and campaign) | Yes (current view)       |","table":"table-4"},"4520":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare","content":"| Platform                       | One list across every webinar     | Filter by watch time and offer clicks | Campaign source (UTM) per person | Export the filtered list |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Yes (registrants from all events) | Partly (attended, replay or purchase) | Partly (through an API call)     | Yes                      |","table":"table-4"},"4521":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare","content":"| Platform     | One list across every webinar  | Filter by watch time and offer clicks | Campaign source (UTM) per person | Export the filtered list  |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Yes (with Universal Dashboard) | Not in docs                           | Yes (tracked per registrant)     | Yes (filtered date range) |","table":"table-4"},"4522":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"4523":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare-stronger","content":"**Filters on how people watched.** EasyWebinar's **Behavior** filter covers attendance, watch time and offer clicks. WebinarJam's registrant filter covers who attended, watched the replay or made a purchase. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"4524":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare-stronger","content":"**One table for every webinar.** **People** sits in the sidebar and spans all your webinars. Demio's People section sits under each event's activity. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"4525":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/analytics/people#compare-stronger","content":"**Every UTM value you capture.** **Source & UTM** 