streamed from YouTube or Twitch) |","table":"table-4"},"5022":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare","content":"| Platform       | Just-in-time sessions | Just-in-time, instant viewing and set times together | Hours kept free of just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product |\n| -------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarKit** | Yes (detail)          | Yes (detail)                                         | Not in docs                              | Yes (detail)                      |","table":"table-4"},"5023":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare","content":"| Platform  | Just-in-time sessions | Just-in-time, instant viewing and set times together | Hours kept free of just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product |\n| --------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Not in docs           | Not in docs                                          | Not in docs                              | Yes (detail)                      |","table":"table-4"},"5024":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare","content":"| Platform      | Just-in-time sessions | Just-in-time, instant viewing and set times together | Hours kept free of just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product |\n| ------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Not in docs           | Not in docs                                          | Not in docs                              | Yes (detail)                      |","table":"table-4"},"5025":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"5026":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"**A session minutes away.** EasyWebinar's **Just-in-time Registration** offers a session starting shortly after someone registers. Demio's help centre and product pages don't document a just-in-time option. Compare EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"5027":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"**Watch now, soon or at a set time.** EasyWebinar's **On Demand** starts the recording straight away, beside just-in-time and set times. StealthSeminar's instant choice, Watch Yesterday's Replay, plays the previous session. Compare EasyWebinar vs StealthSeminar."},"5028":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"**Quiet hours you choose.** **Exclude specific time** keeps chosen hours free of just-in-time sessions. WebinarKit's help centre covers just-in-time labels and spacing, with no hour exclusion documented. Compare EasyWebinar vs WebinarKit."},"5029":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"**Evergreen sessions that start soon.** EasyWebinar adds just-in-time to the evergreen schedule step. Livestorm's on-demand and automation pages don't document just-in-time sessions. Compare EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"5030":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"5031":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**Evergreen only.** Just-in-time is part of the evergreen schedule step. Live and simulive webinars use dated sessions in the webinar's timezone."},"5032":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**Fixed interval choices.** 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes."},"5033":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**Local time applies to just-in-time sessions only.** Other sessions on the same webinar use the webinar's timezone."},"5034":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**The schedule step's timezone message is broader than the behaviour.** Rely on the table above, not the in-app message."},"5035":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**The type is fixed.** To use just-in-time with a webinar that is currently live or simulive, clone it as Evergreen."},"5036":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-what-is-jit","content":"A session that starts a few minutes after someone registers, instead of at a fixed future time. In EasyWebinar it's an option on evergreen webinars."},"5037":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-how-often","content":"As often as you set with **Interval**: every 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes."},"5038":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-shortest","content":"Two minutes."},"5039":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-local-time","content":"Yes. Just-in-time sessions start shortly after each person registers, in their own local time."},"5040":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-recurring-timezone","content":"No. Recurring sessions run at the times you set, in the webinar's timezone."},"5041":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-exclude","content":"Yes. Use **Exclude specific time** to keep those hours clear."},"5042":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-with-on-demand","content":"Yes. Turn on **On Demand** as well; **Schedule Preferences** then reads **Display Just-in-time & Instant-replay**."},"5043":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-other-types","content":"No. It's an evergreen option. Clone the webinar as **Evergreen** to use it."},"5044":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-test","content":"Set the interval to 2 minutes, register on your own page, and watch for the session on the **Live** tab of the Sessions panel."},"5045":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-jit-name","content":"Yes. JIT is the common short name for **Just-in-time Registration**."},"5046":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Create an evergreen webinar: the full setup that just-in-time is one step of."},"5047":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"On Demand: the option for registrants who want to watch now rather than in a few minutes."},"5048":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Chat simulation: a chat for attendees who each arrive at a different moment."},"5049":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"The Overview tab: where the Live tab shows a just-in-time session on air."},"5050":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Clone a webinar: how a live or simulive webinar gets just-in-time sessions."},"5051":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Limits and defaults: the interval options and other evergreen settings in one place."},"5052":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"page","content":"Evergreen Webinar: Turn a Live Session Into One by Cloning It and Setting a Schedule","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Automated webinars"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergr