green","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-what-is-evergreen","content":"What is an evergreen webinar?"},"5096":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-live-to-automated","content":"Can I turn a live webinar into an automated one?"},"5097":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-change-type","content":"Can I change a webinar from live to evergreen directly?"},"5098":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-registrants","content":"Does cloning copy my registrants?"},"5099":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-original","content":"Does cloning change my original live webinar?"},"5100":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-what-copies","content":"What can the clone copy from my live webinar?"},"5101":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-find-recording","content":"Where do I find the recording of my live session?"},"5102":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-no-recording","content":"Why is there no recording of my live webinar?"},"5103":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-drawings","content":"Will the drawings from my live session appear in the evergreen version?"},"5104":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-trimmed","content":"Can I use a trimmed version of the recording instead?"},"5105":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-swap-recording","content":"Can I change the recording after the evergreen webinar is running?"},"5106":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-timezone","content":"Do attendees see session times in their own timezone?"},"5107":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-polls-offers","content":"Do polls and offers still work in the evergreen version?"},"5108":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-simulive-or-evergreen","content":"Should I clone as Simulive or Evergreen?"},"5109":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#further-reading","content":"Further reading"},"5110":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#related","content":"Related"},"5111":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","content":"An evergreen webinar keeps a session you have already delivered working for people who weren't there on the day. If your best live webinar only reached the people who turned up, EasyWebinar, a webinar platform for live and automated webinars, lets you clone it as an evergreen webinar. You keep the pages, polls, offers and emails you choose, play the recording of the live session, and let each registrant pick a time."},"5112":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                                                         |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What you do** | Clone the live webinar, choose **Evergreen** as the copy's type, and pick its recording |","table":"table-0"},"5113":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                               |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where it starts** | **My Webinars**, the **⋮** menu on the webinar's card, then **Clone Webinar** |","table":"table-0"},"5114":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                                                                           |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What can come across** | Registration pages, schedule, replay settings, embed widgets, polls, offers, email notifications and integration settings |","table":"table-0"},"5115":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                 |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What stays behind** | Registrants and attendees, which stay with the original webinar |","table":"table-0"},"5116":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                                |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **The video** | The recording of the live session, from the **Recordings** tab |","table":"table-0"},"5117":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How people watch** | Just-in-time sessions, on-demand viewing, set daily or weekly times, or any mix |","table":"table-0"},"5118":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                               |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **The original** | Untouched: cloning only creates a new webinar |","table":"table-0"},"5119":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-it-is","content":"You ran a live webinar last month, the pitch landed and people bought. Now new visitors arrive on your page every week, and the next live date is weeks away."},"5120":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-it-is","content":"An evergreen webinar runs continuously instead of on a fixed date. Someone arriving at your registration page picks a session that suits them, and the recording plays for them at that time. EasyWebinar fixes a webinar's type when you create it, so a live webinar never becomes evergreen in place. You make a copy instead: the clone is set to Evergreen, and it plays the recording of your live session."},"5121":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-you-see","content":"The **Clone Webinar** dialog opens from the webinar's card. Its **Cloning from** section shows the original's type, date and registration count. **Clone into** shows the type the copy will be, and **Choose webinar type** offers Live, Simulive or Evergreen."},"5122":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-you-see","content":"This is the one place where a live webinar becomes evergreen: choosing Evergreen here sets the new copy's type for good."},"5123":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-you-see","content":"The copy's name is pre-filled with the original's name and \"(Copy)\". Change it to something you will recognise in your list, such as the topic plus \"evergreen\"."},"5124":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-its-for","content":"It lets the live session you have already tested keep running for new registrants, without you presenting it again. You reuse the recording and the setup instead of rebuilding them."},"5125":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#how-it-helps","content":"**You skip the rebuild.** The clone can bring across your registration pages, polls, offers and email notifications in one step."},"5126":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#how-it-helps","content":"**The proven version runs.** The recording is the session that already worked, not a fresh take that might not."},"5127":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#how-it-helps","content":"**Registrants choose their time.** Just-in-time, on-demand and set times can all run at once."},"5128":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#how-it-helps","content":"**The live webinar stays as it was.** Its registrants, attendees and results are not touched."},"5129":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#how-it-helps","content":"**Your integrations come with it.** Integration settings are one of the items you can copy."},"5130":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#without-it","content":"Without an evergreen version, your best session is over once the live date passes. Every new visitor waits for the next date you can present, and many of them won't come back for it."},"5131":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#why-buyers-care","content":"This matters most to hosts who sell from a webinar and can't present every day. It usually comes up right after a live session that converted well. The host wants the same result next week without blocking the diary again."},"5132":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A course creator who teaches beginner woodworking runs a free live masterclass on building a first workbench. It ends with an offer for the paid course on her course platform. The session sells well, but she can only present once a month."},"5133":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#approach","content":"The usual workaround is to download the recording, create a new automated webinar and rebuild everything around it. That can mean recreating the registration page, re-entering polls and offers, rewriting the reminder emails and reconnecting her email tool. Each step takes time, and a missed detail can quietly break the funnel."},"5134":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#approach","content":"What changed is simple. The live webinar already holds every piece the automated one needs: the pages, the engagement, the emails, the connections and now a recording. Reusing those pieces is faster and safer than copying them out by hand, because the version that sold is the version that keeps running."},"5135":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#approach","content":"EasyWebinar handles this by cloning. She clones the live masterclass, picks **Evergreen** as the copy's type, ticks what to bring across and selects the session's recording. EasyWebinar then generates sessions from the schedule she sets, and the original live webinar is left as it was."},"5136":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#approach","content":"You can check the choice for yourself: the clone dialog lists eight items in three groups, with a **Select everything** option. How that choice sits against other platforms is covered in How EasyWebinar compares for evergreen webinars, below."},"5137":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#how-it-gets-done","content":"There are three common ways to get from a live session to an evergreen webinar. Each one catches different problems and misses others."},"5138":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#rebuild","content":"You create a new automated webinar and set up the pages, polls, offers and emails again. This lets you fix anything you disliked about the live version. It misses consistency: small differences creep in, and integration settings are easy to forget."},"5139":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#fresh-take","content":"You present the session again to an empty room and use that recording. This removes live mistakes, dated remarks and long waits at the start. It misses the energy and real audience questions that made the live version work, and the new take is untested."},"5140":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#reuse-by-cloning","content":"You copy the live webinar and play its recording. This keeps the exact session that converted and the setup around it. It can miss things that only made sense live, such as \"see you next Thursday\", references to today's date, or drawings you made on your slides."},"5141":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#confirmed-in-easywebinar","content":"EasyWebinar supports the third way directly. A webinar's type can only be changed by cloning it, and recordings of live sessions are captured automatically when **Auto Recording** is on. They appear on the **Recordings** tab of the video picker, so the copy can play them."},"5142":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#prepare-recording","content":"The recording is the whole evergreen webinar, so check it before you clone. Open the Library and go to the **Recordings** tab. Each recording is named after its webinar, with its duration and the date it was recorded."},"5143":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#check-recording-exists","content":"Recordings are captured when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room. If it was off, there is no recording to reuse, so turn it on for your next live run. The automatic recording page covers that setting."},"5144":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#drawings","content":"If you circled numbers or underlined points on your shared screen or slides, those marks are not in the recording. Drawings are removed when you stop sharing, so viewers of the evergreen version won't see them. Listen for lines like \"as I've circled here\" and plan to explain the point another way."},"5145":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#time-bound-lines","content":"A live session often mentions today's date, a deadline this week or a bonus for people \"on the call right now\". In an evergreen webinar those lines sound wrong to a viewer on another day. Note where they fall so you can decide whether the recording still works."},"5146":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#trim","content":"Live recordings often begin with minutes of waiting and small talk. If you edit the file outside EasyWebinar, you can cut out the beginning, middle, or end of a video in YouTube Studio without re-uploading it. YouTube's editor works on videos shorter than six hours. EasyWebinar can then play the video from YouTube, or you can upload your trimmed file with **Local import**."},"5147":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#measure","content":"Two measures tell you whether a reused live recording works as an evergreen webinar: how long people keep watching, and how many act on your offer."},"5148":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#measure","content":"**Retention through the recording.** YouTube's help describes retention well. It reports what share of viewers still watched after the first 30 seconds, and it treats a dip as the point where viewers abandoning or skipping shows. The weak spot is that a dip tells you where people left, not why. A dated remark or a missing drawing can cause one, and so can a slow section."},"5149":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#measure","content":"**Offer response.** For a session that sells, the number that matters is how many viewers see the offer and click it. Its weak spot is that a small evergreen audience gives jumpy percentages, so read it over several weeks."},"5150":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#measure","content":"In EasyWebinar, analytics work on an evergreen webinar as they do on every other type. Webinar analytics shows **Offers Performance**: offers, views, clicks and purchases, with a click rate. Low views-to-clicks means the offer itself isn't landing. Replay views are counted separately from live attendance, so the original live results stay readable."},"5151":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#manual-method","content":"If your platform can't copy a webinar, the job looks like this:"},"5152":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#manual-method","content":"Download the recording of the live session and trim the waiting time at the start."},"5153":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#manual-method","content":"Create a new automated webinar and upload the recording."},"5154":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#manual-method","content":"Rebuild the registration page, copying the text and images from the live version."},"5155":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#manual-method","content":"Re-enter every poll and offer, with the same wording and timing."},"5156":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#manual-method","content":"Rewrite each confirmation, reminder and follow-up email."},"5157":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#manual-method","content":"Reconnect your email or CRM tool and remap the fields."},"5158":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#manual-method","content":"Set the new schedule and test a full registration."},"5159":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#same-job-in-easywebinar","content":"In EasyWebinar, steps 3 to 6 become ticks in the clone dialog, and step 2 becomes a choice on the **Recordings** tab. You still check the recording and set the schedule yourself. The original live webinar keeps its own registrants and results."},"5160":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#worked-example","content":"This is an illustrative calculation with sample figures, not an EasyWebinar output. It counts the setup items the woodworking masterclass would need rebuilt by hand, then the share that cloning covers."},"5161":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#worked-example","content":"| Item in the live webinar | Count | Rebuilt by hand | Copied by the clone |\n| ------------------------ | ----- | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| Registration pages       | 2     | 2               | 2                   |","table":"table-1"},"5162":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#worked-example","content":"| Item in the live webinar | Count | Rebuilt by hand | Copied by the clone |\n| ------------------------ | ----- | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| Polls                    | 3     | 3               | 3                   |","table":"table-1"},"5163":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#worked-example","content":"| Item in the live webinar | Count | Rebuilt by hand | Copied by the clone |\n| ------------------------ | ----- | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| Offers                   | 1     | 1               | 1                   |","table":"table-1"},"5164":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#worked-example","content":"| Item in the live webinar | Count | Rebuilt by hand | Copied by the clone |\n| ------------------------ | ----- | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| Email notifications      | 6     | 6               | 6                   |","table":"table-1"},"5165":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#worked-example","content":"| Item in the live webinar | Count | Rebuilt by hand | Copied by the clone |\n| ------------------------ | ----- | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| Integration settings     | 1     | 1               | 1                   |","table":"table-1"},"5166":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#worked-example","content":"| Item in the live webinar         | Count | Rebuilt by hand | Copied by the clone |\n| -------------------------------- | ----- | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| Replay settings and embed widget | 2     | 2               | 2                   |","table":"table-1"},"5167":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#worked-example","content":"| Item in the live webinar | Count  | Rebuilt by hand | Copied by the clone |\n| ------------------------ | ------ | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Total**                | **15** | **15**          | **15**              |","table":"table-1"},"5168":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#worked-example","content":"All 15 items come across when every box is ticked, so 15 ÷ 15 = 100% of this setup is copied. What's left is the work no copy can do: checking the recording and setting the evergreen schedule. If she later sees 400 registrants, 240 viewers and 36 offer clicks, that is 240 ÷ 400 = 60% attendance and 36 ÷ 240 = 15% of viewers clicking."},"5169":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#set-up","content":"The steps below take a live webinar you have already run and create an evergreen copy of it. They take a few minutes once the recording is ready."},"5170":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-to-have-ready","content":"The live webinar on **My Webinars**, with the session already run."},"5171":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-to-have-ready","content":"Its recording on the **Recordings** tab, or another video you want to play instead."},"5172":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-to-have-ready","content":"A view of how often new registrants should be able to watch."},"5173":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#clone-as-evergreen","content":"On **My Webinars**, click the **⋮** on the live webinar's card and choose **Clone Webinar**."},"5174":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#clone-as-evergreen","content":"Under **Choose webinar type**, select **Evergreen**."},"5175":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#clone-as-evergreen","content":"Rename the copy so you can tell it apart from the original."},"5176":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#choose-what-to-copy","content":"Under **What would you like to copy?**, click **Select everything** to take the lot, or tick items one by one. The list has three groups."},"5177":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#choose-what-to-copy","content":"Leave ticked everything that already worked live, and untick only what you plan to change for the evergreen audience."},"5178":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#choose-what-to-copy","content":"| Group              | What's included                                                      |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar assets** | Registration pages, Webinar schedule, Replay settings, Embed widgets |","table":"table-2"},"5179":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#choose-what-to-copy","content":"| Group          | What's included                    |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Engagement** | Polls, Offers, Email notifications |","table":"table-2"},"5180":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#choose-what-to-copy","content":"| Group            | What's included      |\n| ---------------- | -------------------- |\n| **Integrations** | Integration settings |","table":"table-2"},"5181":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#choose-what-to-copy","content":"The bottom of the dialog confirms the new name and its type. Click **Clone Webinar** to create the copy."},"5182":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#choose-recording","content":"The copy needs a video, and the recording of the original live session is in your library. On the video step, filter the picker with **Recordings**, click the session, and continue."},"5183":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#choose-recording","content":"Filter to Recordings to find the live session by its webinar name and date, so the copy plays the version that worked."},"5184":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#choose-recording","content":"If you trimmed the recording outside EasyWebinar, click **Add Video**. **Local import** uploads your file and EasyWebinar hosts it. **Import from URL** plays a video on YouTube, Vimeo, Wistia or a direct MP4 link, and asks for its length. Video hosting covers both routes. You can swap the recording later from the **Webinar Video** panel on the Content tab, without disturbing the schedule or registrations."},"5185":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#set-schedule","content":"An evergreen webinar offers three ways to watch, and you can use any combination of them."},"5186":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#set-schedule","content":"Decide here how quickly a new registrant can watch the live session's recording, and on which days it runs."},"5187":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#set-schedule","content":"**Just-in-time Registration** offers a session starting shortly after someone registers. The just-in-time page explains the settings."},"5188":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#set-schedule","content":"**On Demand** lets registrants start watching straight away. Its button reads *Watch instant replay* unless you change it. On-demand viewing covers when to use it."},"5189":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#set-schedule","content":"**Recurring Schedule** runs the webinar **Daily** or **Weekly** at times you choose, and **Add Time** gives more than one slot a day."},"5190":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#set-schedule","content":"**Start Date** sets when the schedule begins, and **No end date** keeps it running. **Blackout Dates** stops it on particular days. Daily and weekly sessions run in the webinar's timezone, while just-in-time sessions start in each attendee's local time."},"5191":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#set-schedule","content":"This video shows how to set up a daily or weekly schedule for a webinar in EasyWebinar."},"5192":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#check-the-copy","content":"Open the new webinar's Overview. The **Sessions** panel should list sessions generated from your schedule. Then register yourself through the registration page and watch the opening minutes, the drawing moments and the offer."},"5193":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-doesnt-carry-over","content":"A clone is a new webinar, not a continuation of the old one, so a few things stay behind."},"5194":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-doesnt-carry-over","content":"**Registrants and attendees.** They stay with the original, and the copy starts at zero. Your evergreen reminder emails go only to people who register for the copy."},"5195":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-doesnt-carry-over","content":"**Drawings.** Drawings made on a shared screen or slides are not in the recording, so the evergreen version shows the share without them."},"5196":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#what-doesnt-carry-over","content":"**Anything you untick.** Items you leave out of the copy have to be set up again on the new webinar."},"5197":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#works-with","content":"**Polls and timed offers** come across with the clone when ticked, and work as they do everywhere else."},"5198":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#works-with","content":"**Chat Simulation (Beta)** can be turned on in the Engagement tab if you want the room to feel populated."},"5199":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#works-with","content":"**Replay pages** and **embed widgets** can be copied from the live webinar."},"5200":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#works-with","content":"**Your CRM or email tool** keeps receiving data when you copy the integration settings."},"5201":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#works-with","content":"**Simulive webinars** are the other option when you clone: they broadcast the recording at set times while you staff the chat live."},"5202":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#who-course-creators","content":"A course creator runs a live masterclass that sells her course, then clones it as evergreen so new followers can watch it any day. Her course sales funnel keeps working between launches."},"5203":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#who-coaches","content":"A business coach who fills discovery calls from a monthly live talk keeps the live talk for his existing audience. The evergreen copy takes new visitors from his website every day."},"5204":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#who-saas","content":"A product team records a well-received live demo, clones it as evergreen and offers just-in-time sessions to trial users. The team presents live only when the product changes."},"5205":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#who-agencies","content":"An agency runs a live session for a client's launch, then hands over an evergreen copy with the same pages, polls and integration settings. The client's leads keep flowing into the same tool."},"5206":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare","content":"EasyWebinar runs live and evergreen webinars in one product, and turns a live session into an evergreen one by cloning it with the items you choose. The recording of the live session is ready in the same library, so the evergreen copy plays the version that worked."},"5207":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-154","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare","content":"Evergreen webinar features for reusing a live session, from each platform's public documentation:"},"5208":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-155","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare","content":"| Platform        | Past live recording as the evergreen video | Choose what the copy includes | Live webinars in the same product | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                                        | Yes                           | Yes                               | Yes                                                  |","table":"table-3"},"5209":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-156","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare","content":"| Platform        | Past live recording as the evergreen video       | Choose what the copy includes | Live webinars in the same product               | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **EverWebinar** | Partly (needs an active WebinarJam subscription) | Not in docs                   | Partly (live runs in sister product WebinarJam) | Yes (just-in-time, instant replay and recurring)     |","table":"table-3"},"5210":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-157","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare","content":"| Platform  | Past live recording as the evergreen video   | Choose what the copy includes | Live webinars in the same product | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (new Automated Event from past sessions) | Partly (sessions not copied)  | Yes (Standard Events run live)    | Partly (recurring and on-demand only)                |","table":"table-3"},"5211":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-158","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare","content":"| Platform      | Past live recording as the evergreen video | Choose what the copy includes | Live webinars in the same product          | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Yes (recording reused for on-demand)       | Not in docs                   | Yes (recording starts with the live event) | Partly (on-demand blocks extra sessions)             |","table":"table-3"},"5212":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-159","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare","content":"| Platform           | Past live recording as the evergreen video | Choose what the copy includes     | Live webinars in the same product             | Just-in-time, on-demand and set times in one webinar |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **StealthSeminar** | Partly (manual upload to Library)          | Partly (duplicate is a full copy) | Partly (streamed from YouTube Live or Twitch) | Partly (replay is yesterday's session)               |","table":"table-3"},"5213":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-160","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"5214":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-161","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare-stronger","content":"**One product for live and evergreen.** EasyWebinar runs both types side by side, while EverWebinar's live webinars run in WebinarJam, a separate product. See EasyWebinar vs EverWebinar and WebinarJam."},"5215":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-162","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare-stronger","content":"**You choose what the copy brings.** EasyWebinar's clone lets you tick pages, schedule, polls, offers, emails and integrations, while a Demio duplicate copies no sessions. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"5216":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-163","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare-stronger","content":"**The live recording is already in your library.** EasyWebinar records live sessions for reuse when **Auto Recording** is on, while StealthSeminar says you must manually upload the recording. See EasyWebinar vs StealthSeminar."},"5217":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-164","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare-stronger","content":"**Every way to watch at once.** EasyWebinar runs just-in-time, on-demand and set times together, while Livestorm stops adding sessions once someone registers on-demand. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"5218":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-165","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 4 November 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"5219":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-166","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#limits","content":"**A webinar's type can't be changed in place.** The evergreen version is always a new webinar made by cloning."},"5220":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-167","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#limits","content":"**Registrants and attendees stay with the original.** The evergreen copy starts with no registrations."},"5221":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-168","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#limits","content":"**Drawings are not recorded.** Marks made on a shared screen or slides won't appear in the evergreen version."},"5222":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-169","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#limits","content":"**A recording exists only if Auto Recording was on.** Without it, you need another video for the copy."},"5223":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-170","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#limits","content":"**Daily and weekly sessions use the webinar's timezone.** Only just-in-time sessions start in each attendee's local time."},"5224":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-171","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-what-is-evergreen","content":"An evergreen webinar is a recorded webinar that runs continuously instead of on a fixed date. A visitor picks a session that suits them, and the recording plays for them at that time."},"5225":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-172","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-live-to-automated","content":"Yes. Clone the live webinar, choose Evergreen as the copy's type, and select the recording of the live session as its video. The original live webinar stays as it was."},"5226":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-173","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-change-type","content":"No. A webinar's type is fixed once it exists. Cloning is the supported way to change it, and it's how most people turn a successful live session into an evergreen webinar."},"5227":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-174","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-registrants","content":"No. Registrants and attendees stay with the original webinar, and the evergreen copy starts at zero. Only people who register for the copy receive its emails."},"5228":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-175","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-original","content":"No. Cloning only creates a new webinar. The original keeps its registrants, attendees, recording and results."},"5229":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-176","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-what-copies","content":"Registration pages, the webinar schedule, replay settings, embed widgets, polls, offers, email notifications and integration settings. Click Select everything or tick them one by one."},"5230":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-177","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-find-recording","content":"In the Library, on the Recordings tab, named after its webinar with its duration and date. It also appears on the Recordings tab of the video picker when you set up the copy."},"5231":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-178","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-no-recording","content":"Recordings are captured automatically only when Auto Recording is on in the live room. If it was off, upload your own video instead, and turn it on before your next live run."},"5232":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-179","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-drawings","content":"No. Drawings made on a shared screen or slides are removed when you stop sharing, and they are not in the recording. Explain those points in words, or re-record that part."},"5233":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-180","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-trimmed","content":"Yes. Upload the trimmed file with Local import and EasyWebinar hosts it, or import it from YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia. Then select it on the video step."},"5234":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-181","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-swap-recording","content":"Yes. Swap it from the Webinar Video panel on the Content tab. Your schedule and existing registrations are not affected."},"5235":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-182","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-timezone","content":"Only for just-in-time sessions, which start shortly after each person registers in their own local time. Daily and weekly sessions run at the times you set, in the webinar's timezone."},"5236":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-183","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-polls-offers","content":"Yes, if you leave them ticked when you clone. Chat, Q&A, polls, offers, emails and analytics work on evergreen webinars as they do on live ones."},"5237":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-184","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#faq-simulive-or-evergreen","content":"Choose Simulive to broadcast the recording at set times while you answer in the chat live. Choose Evergreen when each registrant should pick their own time and the webinar should run without you."},"5238":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-185","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#further-reading","content":"Measure key moments for audience retention (YouTube Help): how intros, dips and spikes show where viewers stay or leave a video."},"5239":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-186","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#further-reading","content":"Trim your videos (YouTube Help): how to cut the start, middle or end of a recording before you reuse it."},"5240":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen-187","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/live-to-evergreen#further-reading"