't my offer save?"},"6280":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-countdown","content":"Can an offer show a countdown?"},"6281":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-prepare","content":"Can I prepare an offer without showing it yet?"},"6282":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-show-live","content":"How do I show the offer during a live webinar?"},"6283":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-replay","content":"Will my offers show on the replay?"},"6284":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-results","content":"Where do I see how an offer performed?"},"6285":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-follow-up","content":"Can I follow up with people who clicked but didn't buy?"},"6286":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-ai","content":"Can AI write my offers?"},"6287":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Related"},"6288":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","content":"An offer in EasyWebinar is a card with a headline and a button that you show to attendees during a webinar. The button sends people wherever the next step is: a checkout, a booking page or a sales page. You build offers on the webinar's **CTAs** tab, with an optional price and an optional countdown, then push them to the room when you make your pitch. Afterwards, Analytics shows how many people saw, clicked and bought each offer, and what it earned."},"6289":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                                                |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **What it is** | A card with a headline, a sub headline and a button, shown in the webinar room |","table":"table-0"},"6290":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|                        |                                         |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you build it** | Webinar → **CTAs** tab, alongside polls |","table":"table-0"},"6291":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|            |                                   |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Styles** | **Text Offer** or **Image Offer** |","table":"table-0"},"6292":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|           |                                               |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Price** | Set an **Offer Price**, or switch **Free** on |","table":"table-0"},"6293":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Countdown** | Optional **Countdown timer** on the offer card |","table":"table-0"},"6294":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|              |                                                                          |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Required** | A **Button URL**; saving without one shows **\"Button link is required\"** |","table":"table-0"},"6295":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                                        |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Showing it** | **Offers** panel in the live room, where you push an offer to the room |","table":"table-0"},"6296":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                            |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **On the replay** | Carried over when the replay page uses **Webinar Replica** |","table":"table-0"},"6297":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                                   |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Written for you** | **Create with AI** generates offers from a positioning and category, for 1 credit |","table":"table-0"},"6298":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                                                               |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Results** | **Offers Performance**, **Views to Clicks**, **Clicks to Purchases** and **Revenue by Offer** |","table":"table-0"},"6299":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                                                                                    |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Follow-up** | **Attendee Action Follow-ups**, the **Paid Offer — Transaction Success** email and the **Clicked offer** CRM event |","table":"table-0"},"6300":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"The **CTAs** tab holds two kinds of call to action. A poll asks your audience something. An offer asks them to do something: buy, book, enrol, download."},"6301":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"Each offer has:"},"6302":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**The card attendees see**: a headline and sub headline, as a text offer or an image offer."},"6303":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**A button**, with its own size, icon, text, colours and the URL it opens."},"6304":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**An optional price**, or a **Free** setting."},"6305":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**An optional countdown**, shown on the card."},"6306":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**An internal title**, which only your team sees."},"6307":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"An offer is not the same as charging for the webinar itself. Paid registration sells access to the session before it starts; an offer sells something separate, during or after it. EasyWebinar reports the two separately."},"6308":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-its-for","content":"An offer turns your pitch into something attendees can act on. It puts one button on screen at the moment you ask, pointing at the exact next step. Nobody has to remember a web address or hunt for it later."},"6309":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#how-it-helps","content":"**Action is one click away.** Attendees click while their interest is high, without leaving the room to look for a link."},"6310":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#how-it-helps","content":"**The pitch keeps working on the replay.** With a **Webinar Replica** replay, the same offer appears on the recording."},"6311":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#how-it-helps","content":"**Recorded sessions still sell.** On simulive and evergreen webinars the card carries the pitch, and a countdown can carry the deadline."},"6312":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#how-it-helps","content":"**You can see where it loses people.** Separate counts for views, clicks and purchases show whether to fix the offer or the checkout."},"6313":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#without-it","content":"Without an offer card, the call to action is only what the presenter says. People who arrive late miss it, and anyone watching a recording hears it once and moves on. Interest goes unrecorded, so you can't tell who came close to buying."},"6314":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#why-buyers-care","content":"Offers matter most to teams whose webinars have to pay for themselves, such as course creators, coaches, training companies and product teams. They matter most in launch weeks and on automated webinars, where the card does the selling while nobody is presenting."},"6315":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A software-training company with four instructors runs a monthly live webinar on passing a cloud architect exam. About 250 IT professionals attend. The session ends by selling a certification bundle of three practice courses and an exam voucher."},"6316":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#approach","content":"A common approach is for the instructor to read out a checkout link near the end and paste it into chat. In practice, that link tends to scroll away within a minute, and people who joined late may never see it. The company may also struggle to tell whether weak sales came from the bundle or from the checkout."},"6317":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#approach","content":"The buying decision hasn't changed, but the moment it happens matters more. Attendees decide while the instructor is still talking, so the next step needs to sit on screen right then. It also helps to count each step between seeing the bundle and paying for it."},"6318":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#approach","content":"EasyWebinar handles this with an offer card built on the webinar's **CTAs** tab. The company writes a headline for the bundle, sets its **Offer Price** and switches on **Countdown timer**. The instructor pushes the card from the room's **Offers** panel during the pitch. Afterwards, **Offers Performance** shows the bundle's views, clicks and purchases."},"6319":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#approach","content":"The offer editor screenshot under Create an offer shows **Countdown timer**, **Offer Price** and the **Button** settings side by side. How other platforms handle offer countdowns and offer reporting is covered in How offers compare, below."},"6320":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"Open your webinar and click **CTAs**."},"6321":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"*1 All · Polls · Offers · 2 Search · 3 The list · 4 Row actions.*"},"6322":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"|     | Control                  | What it does                                           |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | **All · Polls · Offers** | Filters the list. Choose **Offers** to see only offers |","table":"table-1"},"6323":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"|     | Control    | What it does        |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------------- |\n| 2   | **Search** | Finds a CTA by name |","table":"table-1"},"6324":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"|     | Control      | What it does                                |\n| --- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **The list** | Type, title, price and actions for each CTA |","table":"table-1"},"6325":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"|     | Control         | What it does                   |\n| --- | --------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 4   | **Row actions** | Toggle on or off, edit, delete |","table":"table-1"},"6326":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"A webinar with no polls or offers yet shows **\"No CTAs found\"**."},"6327":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"On the **CTAs** tab, open an existing offer."},"6328":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"To add a new one, click **+** at the bottom of the offer list on the left."},"6329":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Choose the **Offer Style**: **Text Offer** or **Image Offer**."},"6330":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Decide whether to switch on **Countdown timer**."},"6331":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Set an **Offer Price**, or switch **Free** on."},"6332":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Give the offer an internal **Title**, then write the **Headline** and **Sub Headline**."},"6333":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Set up the **Button**: size, icon, text and **Button URL**."},"6334":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Choose the button colour and button text colour."},"6335":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Check the preview in the centre of the editor, which shows the offer as attendees will see it and updates as you type."},"6336":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Set **Published**, then save."},"6337":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"*1 Offer Style · 2 Countdown timer · 3 Offer Price · 4 Title, Headline, Sub Headline · 5 Button · 6 Colours.*"},"6338":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting         | What it does                      |\n| --- | --------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Offer Style** | **Text Offer** or **Image Offer** |","table":"table-2"},"6339":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting             | What it does                       |\n| --- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Countdown timer** | Adds a countdown to the offer card |","table":"table-2"},"6340":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting         | What it does                   |\n| --- | --------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 3   | **Offer Price** | A price, or switch **Free** on |","table":"table-2"},"6341":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting                           | What it does                                                                 |\n| --- | --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Title, Headline, Sub Headline** | The title is internal; the headline and sub headline are what attendees read |","table":"table-2"},"6342":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting    | What it does                          |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Button** | Size, icon, text and the URL it opens |","table":"table-2"},"6343":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting     | What it does                  |\n| --- | ----------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 6   | **Colours** | Button and button text colour |","table":"table-2"},"6344":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#write-the-card","content":"The headline and sub headline do the selling, so give each a job:"},"6345":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#write-the-card","content":"**Headline**: what the attendee gets, in their terms."},"6346":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#write-the-card","content":"**Sub headline**: the detail that removes doubt, such as what's included, who it's for or when it closes."},"6347":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#write-the-card","content":"**Title**: a name your team will recognise in the CTAs list, since attendees never see it."},"6348":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#button","content":"**Button URL** is where attendees land when they click: your checkout, booking page or sales page. Write the button **Text** to match what happens next. \"Download Free Toolkit\" tells people what they'll get; \"Click here\" tells them nothing."},"6349":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#button","content":"Saving an offer without a button URL shows **\"Button link is required\"**, and that applies to paid offers too. If any field is invalid when you save, the editor shows **\"Please fix the highlighted fields before saving.\"**"},"6350":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#add-a-countdown","content":"Switch on **Countdown timer** to put a countdown on the offer card. It's a single toggle, set on each offer separately. Use it when the offer really does close or change at a set time, and say in the sub headline what ends."},"6351":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#hold-an-offer","content":"You can build offers well before the webinar and keep them out of sight:"},"6352":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#hold-an-offer","content":"Switch off the toggle on the offer's row in the **CTAs** list, or"},"6353":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#hold-an-offer","content":"Turn the editor's **Published** switch off."},"6354":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#hold-an-offer","content":"Nothing is deleted. Switch it back on when you want it live."},"6355":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"**Create with AI** builds a webinar from a description, and offers are one of its five outputs. Script, Landing pages and Emails are selected by default; click the **Offers** chip to include offers."},"6356":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"At the offers step, start with positioning."},"6357":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"| Approach       | What it does                        |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Soft Pitch** | Education-focused, offer at the end |","table":"table-3"},"6358":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"| Approach              | What it does                                      |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Balanced Approach** | Value plus a clear offer throughout, strong close |","table":"table-3"},"6359":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"| Approach         | What it does                                 |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Direct Pitch** | Offer-focused, repeated CTAs, strong urgency |","table":"table-3"},"6360":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"Then describe what you're selling and where the button should send people. Pick a category (online course, coaching programme, membership, digital product or service package) and click **Generate Offers**. You get complete offers, each with a title, headline, sub-headline, button text and link. Tick the offers you want to keep, then click **Save and continue**. The offers step costs 1 credit."},"6361":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"Generated offers appear on the CTAs tab and are edited like any other. Read the copy before you publish, particularly anything about price and what's included."},"6362":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#show-in-room","content":"In the live room, the side rail has an **Offers** panel. Open it and push the offer to the room when you reach your pitch. When you click **Go Live**, the confirmation reminds you that offers and polls should be ready, so check them in the green room before you start."},"6363":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#show-in-room","content":"Live, simulive and evergreen webinars all use the same offers; only the delivery differs."},"6364":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#end-of-session-redirect","content":"The webinar's **Settings** tab has an **End of Session** URL, which is empty by default. Point it at your offer or booking page so attendees aren't left sitting on a finished webinar. **Expired Session** does the same for anyone arriving at a link that has expired."},"6365":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"The replay page has two looks, set on the **Replay** tab:"},"6366":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"| Option              | What happens to your offers                                                                                                       |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar Replica** | A duplicate of your live webinar, with the same video, offers, polls and chat replay, so the replay sells the way the session did |","table":"table-4"},"6367":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"| Option           | What happens to your offers                                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Custom Build** | A page you design yourself, with its own layout, CTAs and branding, for when the replay needs a different pitch |","table":"table-4"},"6368":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"Two more replay settings support an offer:"},"6369":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"**How long the replay stays up**: **Always Available**, **Expire after days** or **Specific date**. A replay that closes gives the offer a matching deadline."},"6370":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"**After the replay ends**, under Redirects, sends viewers on to your offer or booking page once the recording finishes."},"6371":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"Open the webinar's **Analytics** tab. Further down the **Overview**:"},"6372":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| Panel                  | What it shows                                          |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Offers Performance** | Offers, views, clicks and purchases, with a click rate |","table":"table-5"},"6373":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| Panel                                           | What it shows                 |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Views to Clicks** and **Clicks to Purchases** | Where your offer loses people |","table":"table-5"},"6374":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| Panel                | What it shows                                        |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Revenue by Offer** | Total revenue and payment count, with a details link |","table":"table-5"},"6375":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"The two ratios point at different fixes:"},"6376":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| If this is low      | What it means                  | Where to look                                           |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Views to Clicks** | The offer itself isn't landing | The headline, the sub headline, the timing of the pitch |","table":"table-6"},"6377":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| If this is low          | What it means                                       | Where to look                                                        |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Clicks to Purchases** | The offer works but the checkout or pricing doesn't | The checkout page, the price, how well the card matches the checkout |","table":"table-6"},"6378":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"The **Revenue** view splits earnings under **Revenue by Source**, separating paid registrations from offers sold in the room. Offer sales show under **Paid Offer**."},"6379":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"The date range at the top of Analytics applies to everything on the page, so widen it if an offer looks emptier than expected."},"6380":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-emails","content":"Two email groups on the **Notifications** tab relate to offers:"},"6381":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-emails","content":"**Attendee Action Follow-ups** send based on what someone did, including whether they clicked an offer. They let you treat someone who clicked and didn't buy differently from someone who left after five minutes."},"6382":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-emails","content":"**Paid Offer — Transaction Success** is sent after a successful purchase, as a receipt-style confirmation."},"6383":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-crm","content":"A connected CRM can act on the **Clicked offer** event, which fires when someone clicks your offer. A sensible mapping is a `webinar-hot` tag plus a notification to sales."},"6384":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-people-view","content":"**People** has an **Offer clicked** column, and the **Behavior** filter can combine high watch time with offer clicks to find people who were interested and didn't buy. **Export** the filtered list to work with it elsewhere."},"6385":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-paid-webinars","content":"A webinar can charge for registration and still sell offers inside. Registration payments are reported under **Paid Webinar** and offer sales under **Paid Offer**."},"6386":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-cloning","content":"When you clone a webinar, offers are in the **Engagement** group of the copy dialog, with polls and email notifications. To try a new offer on a webinar that's already running, clone it and change the copy."},"6387":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, showing how offers fit different selling webinars."},"6388":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#course-creators","content":"An evergreen webinar teaches one core idea and closes with an enrolment offer pointing at the course checkout on the creator's course platform. A countdown marks a bonus window, and a **Webinar Replica** replay keeps the offer working for people who watch later."},"6389":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#coaches","content":"A live masterclass ends with a free offer whose button opens a booking page for a call. **Attendee Action Follow-ups** reach people who clicked but didn't book."},"6390":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#product-teams","content":"A recorded demo carries an offer for a trial, with the button pointing at the sign-up page. The team watches **Views to Clicks** across sessions to judge whether the demo builds enough interest."},"6391":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#agencies","content":"An agency building a client's webinar uses **Create with AI** with **Balanced Approach** to draft offers, edits them into the client's voice, and maps **Clicked offer** to a tag in the client's CRM."},"6392":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare","content":"EasyWebinar puts a countdown on the offer card itself and reports views, clicks and purchases for every offer. The same offers run on live, simulive and evergreen webinars in one product. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"6393":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare","content":"Offer features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"6394":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-154","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare","content":"| Platform        | Countdown on the offer card | Views, clicks and purchases per offer | Same offers on live and automated webinars |\n| --------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                         | Yes                                   | Yes                                        |","table":"table-7"},"6395":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-155","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Countdown on the offer card | Views, clicks and purchases per offer | Same offers on live and automated webinars |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Yes (Apply urgency)         | Partly (purchases via tracking codes) | Partly (two separate products)             |","table":"table-7"},"6396":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-156","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare","content":"| Platform  | Countdown on the offer card | Views, clicks and purchases per offer | Same offers on live and automated webinars |\n| --------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Demio** | Not in docs                 | Partly (click counts only)            | Yes (detail)                               |","table":"table-7"},"6397":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-157","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare","content":"| Platform     | Countdown on the offer card   | Views, clicks and purchases per offer     | Same offers on live and automated webinars |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **eWebinar** | Partly (shown in one example) | Partly (one conversion event per webinar) | Partly (recorded webinars only)            |","table":"table-7"},"6398":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-158","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare","content":"| Platform   | Countdown on the offer card | Views, clicks and purchases per offer | Same offers on live and automated webinars |\n| ---------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Kajabi** | Not in docs                 | Not in docs                           | Partly (webinar runs on another host)      |","table":"table-7"},"6399":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-159","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"6400":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-160","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare-stronger","content":"**A deadline on the card itself.** EasyWebinar's **Countdown timer** is one toggle on each offer. Demio's help centre documents no countdown setting for its Featured Action call to action. More detail in EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"6401":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-161","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare-stronger","content":"**Clicks and purchases in one report.** **Offers Performance** lists views, clicks and purchases for each offer. WebinarJam records sales through two tracking codes that you place on your own pages. More detail in EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"6402":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-162","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare-stronger","content":"**Every offer measured.** EasyWebinar reports each offer separately under **Revenue by Offer**. eWebinar's help centre says only one conversion event can be tracked per eWebinar. More detail in EasyWebinar vs eWebinar."},"6403":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-163","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare-stronger","content":"**The offer inside the webinar room.** EasyWebinar pushes the card to attendees from the room's **Offers** panel. Kajabi's webinar funnel can run on any webinar host, such as Zoom, linked into the funnel. More detail in EasyWebinar vs Kajabi."},"6404":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-164","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"6405":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-165","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**A button URL is required on every offer**, paid offers included."},"6406":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-166","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**The title is internal.** Attendees see the headline and sub headline."},"6407":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-167","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**The countdown is per offer.** Polls have no countdown setting."},"6408":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-168","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**Two switches control visibility**: the toggle in the CTAs list and **Published** in the editor."},"6409":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-169","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**Replays carry offers only with Webinar Replica.** A Custom Build replay page has its own CTAs."},"6410":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-170","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**Offer revenue and registration revenue are reported separately**, under **Paid Offer** and **Paid Webinar**."},"6411":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-171","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**AI offers use credits**: 1 credit for the offers step."},"6412":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-172","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-add-offer","content":"Open the **CTAs** tab, open any offer, and click **+** at the bottom of the list on the left."},"6413":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-173","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-poll-vs-offer","content":"A poll asks a question. An offer sells something, with a headline, a button and an optional price."},"6414":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-174","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-image-offer","content":"Yes. Choose **Image Offer** under **Offer Style**."},"6415":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-175","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-free-offer","content":"No. Switch **Free** on under **Offer Price**, for example for a download or a booking link."},"6416":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-176","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-wont-save","content":"If the button has no URL, the editor shows **\"Button link is required\"**. Any other invalid field shows **\"Please fix the highlighted fields before saving.\"**"},"6417":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-177","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-countdown","content":"Yes. Turn on the **Countdown timer** toggle when you edit the offer."},"6418":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-178","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-prepare","content":"Yes. Turn its toggle off in the list, or set **Published** to off in the editor."},"6419":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-179","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-show-live","content":"Open **Offers** on the side rail of the live room and push it to the room."},"6420":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-180","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-replay","content":"Yes, if the replay page is set to **Webinar Replica**."},"6421":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-181","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-results","content":"On the **Analytics** Overview. **Offers Performance** gives views, clicks and purchases with a click rate, and **Revenue by Offer** gives total revenue and payment count."},"6422":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-182","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-follow-up","content":"Yes. Use **Attendee Action Follow-ups**, tag them with the **Clicked offer** event in your CRM, or filter **People** by offer clicks and export the list."},"6423":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-183","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-ai","content":"Yes. In **Create with AI**, include the **Offers** chip, choose a positioning and category, and click **Generate Offers**."},"6424":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-184","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Countdown timers: the deadline you can put on any offer card."},"6425":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-185","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Polls: the other kind of CTA, often asked just before the pitch."},"6426":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-186","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Paid webinars: charging for registration, reported apart from offer sales."},"6427":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-187","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Replay pages: keep offers selling on the recording with **Webinar Replica**."},"6428":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-188","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Webinar analytics: views, clicks, purchases and revenue for each offer."},"6429":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-189","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Connect a CRM and map your webinar data: tag the people who clicked an offer."},"6430":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-190","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Course creators: an enrolment offer from build to follow-up."},"6431":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","typ