ed result:** a new, independent webinar of the type you picked, carrying the settings and assets you selected, with no registrants, and the original webinar exactly as it was."},"6479":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|           |                                                                 |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where** | **My Webinars** → **⋮** on a webinar's card → **Clone Webinar** |","table":"table-0"},"6480":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Type of the copy** | **Live**, **Simulive** or **Evergreen**; it doesn't have to match the original |","table":"table-0"},"6481":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                          |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Default name** | The original's name followed by \"(Copy)\" |","table":"table-0"},"6482":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|   