-webinar#open-clone-dialog","content":"Click **⋮** on its card."},"6492":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#open-clone-dialog","content":"Choose **Clone Webinar**."},"6493":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"The top of the dialog sets out what you're copying from and what you're creating."},"6494":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"*1 Cloning from · 2 Clone into · 3 Choose Webinar Type.*"},"6495":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"|     | Section          | What it shows                                                         |\n| --- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Cloning from** | The original webinar, with its type, date and number of registrations |","table":"table-1"},"6496":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"|     | Section        | What it shows                    |\n| --- | -------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Clone into** | The type the new webinar will be |","table":"table-1"},"6497":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"|     | Section                 | What it shows                |\n| --- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Choose Webinar Type** | The three types to pick from |","table":"table-1"},"6498":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"Pick the type for the copy:"},"6499":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"| Choose           | The copy becomes                   |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Live Webinar** | A webinar you present in real time |","table":"table-2"},"6500":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"| Choose               | The copy becomes                                |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Simulive Webinar** | A recording broadcast at the times you schedule |","table":"table-2"},"6501":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"| Choose                | The copy becomes                                                |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Evergreen Webinar** | A recording on a continuous schedule that registrants pick from |","table":"table-2"},"6502":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"Choosing a different type from the original is allowed and is the main reason people clone. A live original can become simulive or evergreen, and an automated one can become live."},"6503":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#name-copy","content":"**New Webinar Name** starts as the original's name with \"(Copy)\" on the end. Replace it with something you'll recognise in your webinar list, especially if both versions will run side by side."},"6504":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"Under **What would you like to copy?**, tick **Select everything** to bring the lot, or choose item by item."},"6505":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"| Group              | Items you can copy                                                      |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar assets** | Registration pages · Webinar schedule · Replay settings · Embed widgets |","table":"table-3"},"6506":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"| Group          | Items you can copy                   |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Engagement** | Polls · Offers · Email notifications |","table":"table-3"},"6507":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"| Group            | Items you can copy   |\n| ---------------- | -------------------- |\n| **Integrations** | Integration settings |","table":"table-3"},"6508":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"The panel at the bottom of the dialog repeats the new webinar's name and type before you commit. Read it once: it's the last chance to catch a wrong type, which can't be changed afterwards."},"6509":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#create-copy","content":"Click **Clone Webinar**. The new webinar is created with the items you ticked, and the original stays exactly as it was."},"6510":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"A copy that keeps the original's type is ready to edit straight away. A copy that moves from live to simulive or evergreen needs one more thing: a recording to play."},"6511":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"Open the new webinar and go to its **Content** tab."},"6512":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"In the **Webinar Video** panel, choose the video. The recording of the original live session is in your library under **Recordings**, named after its webinar, with its duration and recording date."},"6513":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"Open the **Overview** tab and check **Scheduling Options**. The options menu on that panel changes the schedule for the whole webinar. For what an evergreen schedule offers, see Create an evergreen webinar; for simulive, see Create a simulive webinar."},"6514":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"Live recordings reach the Library when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room's recording settings. If it was off for the original session, there will be no recording of it to use."},"6515":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#verify","content":"**In My Webinars**, the copy appears with the new name and its type badge, and the count on the matching type tab goes up."},"6516":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#verify","content":"**On the copy's Overview tab**, **Registrants** starts at zero."},"6517":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#verify","content":"**On the original**, registrants, sessions and settings are unchanged."},"6518":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#verify","content":"**On the copy's tabs**, the items you ticked are present: pages on **Content**, polls and offers on **CTAs**, emails on **Notifications**, and connections on **Integrations**."},"6519":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-it-is","content":"Cloning copies a webinar's setup into a new, separate webinar. The copy can be edited on its own from then on; changes to one don't flow to the other. It covers the setup, not the history: registrants and attendees stay with the original, so the copy is a fresh webinar rather than a continuation."},"6520":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-its-for","content":"Cloning has three everyday uses:"},"6521":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-its-for","content":"**Changing the type.** The type can't be edited on an existing webinar, so a copy of the right type is how you move between live, simulive and evergreen."},"6522":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-its-for","content":"**Reusing a webinar that works.** Pages, emails, polls and offers come across, so a new event doesn't start from blank."},"6523":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-its-for","content":"**Testing a change safely.** Try a different registration page or offer on a copy, leaving the webinar that's already running alone."},"6524":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It saves the rebuild.** Everything you've already written and designed can come with the copy."},"6525":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It's selective.** You choose which assets come across, item by item."},"6526":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It protects what's live.** The original isn't touched, so a working webinar keeps working while you experiment."},"6527":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It starts the copy clean.** No registrants come across, so the new webinar's numbers are its own."},"6528":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#without-it","content":"Without cloning, a new format means building the second version by hand. You recreate the registration page, rewrite the emails, re-enter polls and offers and reconnect integrations. Each step is a chance to introduce a difference you didn't intend."},"6529":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#why-buyers-care","content":"Teams that run webinars as a programme reuse what works. Copying a proven webinar, or moving it from live to automated, without a rebuild is what makes that practical."},"6530":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A fitness coach who works alone runs a free live kick-off for her 30-day kettlebell challenge each month. About 120 people register, and each kick-off ends with an offer to join her paid coaching group."},"6531":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#approach","content":"A common approach is to rebuild the webinar every month, or to keep reusing one webinar and clear it out. Rebuilding can eat an evening of copying pages, emails and the offer by hand. Reusing one webinar tends to mix last month's sign-ups into this month's numbers."},"6532":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#approach","content":"The kick-off is the same each month apart from the date. She also wants a version that runs without her, for people who find her between challenges. Both needs call for copying the setup rather than redoing it."},"6533":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#approach","content":"EasyWebinar handles both with **Clone Webinar**. For each monthly kick-off, the coach clones the webinar as **Live Webinar** and leaves **Registration pages**, **Offers** and **Email notifications** ticked. For the in-between version, she clones it as **Evergreen Webinar** and picks her strongest kick-off recording on the copy's **Content** tab."},"6534":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#approach","content":"Each copy starts with no registrants, so every month's figures belong to that month, and the original stays untouched. The full list of items sits under **What would you like to copy?** in the dialog. How this compares with other platforms is covered in How cloning compares, below."},"6535":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-webinar-types","content":"Each type delivers content differently, but pages, emails, polls, offers and analytics are shared across all three. That's why a clone can carry those assets into a different type."},"6536":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-library","content":"Simulive and evergreen copies play a video from the Library. Recordings of webinars you've already run appear under **Recordings** automatically when auto recording was on, ready to pick on the copy's **Content** tab. See The Library."},"6537":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-registration","content":"Ticking **Registration pages** and **Embed widgets** brings the original's pages and embed widgets across to the copy. Review them on the copy before promoting it, since the copy may now be a different type with a different schedule. See Registration page builder and Registration embeds."},"6538":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-ctas-and-emails","content":"**Polls** and **Offers** copy to the new webinar's **CTAs** tab, and **Email notifications** copy to its **Notifications** tab, if you leave them ticked. See Polls and Reminder emails."},"6539":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-integrations","content":"**Integration settings** carries the original's integration setup to the copy. Check the connections on the copy's **Integrations** tab before it goes live. See Connect a CRM and map your webinar data."},"6540":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-replays","content":"**Replay settings** brings the replay configuration from the original's **Replay** tab. See Replay pages."},"6541":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-archiving","content":"There is no Delete for webinars. If you don't need a copy, choose **Archive** from its card menu and it moves to the **Archived** tab."},"6542":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how cloning is used."},"6543":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#course-creators","content":"A creator runs a teaching webinar live a few times with recording on, then clones it as **Evergreen**, selects the recording of the strongest session on the copy, and sets an evergreen schedule. The live original stays as it was. See Selling online courses with webinars."},"6544":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team clones last quarter's webinar for a new topic. The registration page layout, reminder emails and integration settings come across, and the team rewrites the content rather than rebuilding the structure."},"6545":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#agencies","content":"An agency keeps a webinar it has refined over several events and clones it as the starting point for each new one, unticking anything that should be set up fresh."},"6546":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#customer-success","content":"A customer success team that presents onboarding live clones the webinar as **Simulive** and chooses the live recording, so the session can run on a schedule while the team covers the chat."},"6547":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare","content":"EasyWebinar lets you choose, item by item, what comes across to the copy. The webinar schedule can come with it, and so can the integration settings. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"6548":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare","content":"Cloning features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"6549":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform        | Choose items to copy | Schedule comes with the copy | Integration settings copied |\n| --------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                  | Yes                          | Yes                         |","table":"table-4"},"6550":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform  | Choose items to copy          | Schedule comes with the copy | Integration settings copied |\n| --------- | ----------------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Copies all Customize settings | Sessions not copied          | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-4"},"6551":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform           | Choose items to copy | Schedule comes with the copy | Integration settings copied |\n| ------------------ | -------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **StealthSeminar** | Full copy only       | Yes (full copy)              | Yes (plugin setup)          |","table":"table-4"},"6552":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform     | Choose items to copy | Schedule comes with the copy | Integration settings copied |\n| ------------ | -------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Copies everything    | Yes (everything copied)      | Yes (detail)                |","table":"table-4"},"6553":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform      | Choose items to copy | Schedule comes with the copy | Integration settings copied |\n| ------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Keeps event settings | Not in docs                  | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-4"},"6554":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform         | Choose items to copy | Schedule comes with the copy | Integration settings copied |\n| ---------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **WebinarNinja** | Not in docs          | Yes (then edit the dates)    | Not in docs                 |","table":"table-4"},"6555":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"6556":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**You pick what comes across.** EasyWebinar lists eight items under **What would you like to copy?**, each one optional. StealthSeminar's help centre says its duplicate is a full copy of the original event. See EasyWebinar vs Stealth Seminar."},"6557":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**The schedule can travel with it.** Ticking **Webinar schedule** in EasyWebinar brings the sessions to the copy. Demio says none of the sessions are copied, which leaves a blank schedule. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"6558":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**Integrations come along on request.** EasyWebinar has an **Integration settings** item in the clone dialog. Livestorm's public docs show no copying of integrations. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"6559":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**Less to redo after cloning.** EasyWebinar can copy pages, polls, offers and emails in one pass. WebinarNinja's guide has you clone, then update the title, date and time. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarNinja."},"6560":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"6561":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**There is no in-place conversion.** The type of an existing webinar can't be changed; only a copy can have a different type."},"6562":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**Registrants and attendees stay with the original.** A copy starts with no registrations."},"6563":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**The copy's type is fixed once created.** Check the summary at the bottom of the dialog before you click **Clone Webinar**."},"6564":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**A recorded copy needs a video.** Simulive and evergreen webinars play a recording, chosen on the **Content** tab."},"6565":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**Recordings exist only if auto recording was on.** A live session run with recording off leaves nothing in **Library → Recordings**."},"6566":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**Copies are archived, not deleted.**"},"6567":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-change-type","content":"Clone it and choose the new type in the dialog. There's no way to convert a webinar in place."},"6568":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-live-to-evergreen","content":"Yes. Clone it with **Evergreen** as the type, then select the live session's recording on the copy's **Content** tab."},"6569":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-registrants","content":"No. The copy starts with no registrations."},"6570":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-original","content":"No. Cloning only creates something new."},"6571":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-selective","content":"Yes. Untick **Email notifications** under **What would you like to copy?**"},"6572":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-polls-offers","content":"Yes, if **Polls** and **Offers** are ticked."},"6573":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-name","content":"It starts with the original's name plus \"(Copy)\". You can change it in the dialog."},"6574":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-remove-copy","content":"Archive it from its card menu. Webinars are archived rather than deleted."},"6575":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-recording","content":"In **Library → Recordings**, if **Auto Recording** was on during the session."},"6576":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-test-changes","content":"Yes. Make your changes on a copy so the webinar that's already working stays untouched."},"6577":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-start