-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#open-create-dialog","content":"Choose **Create Manually**."},"6657":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#open-create-dialog","content":"*Two ways to create a webinar. Create with AI generates your pages, emails, offers and polls; Create Manually opens the four-step builder.*"},"6658":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#name-and-type","content":"The builder opens on **Step 1 of 4: Build**."},"6659":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#name-and-type","content":"In **Webinar Name**, type the title attendees will see."},"6660":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Under **Webinar Type**, choose a card. **Live Webinar** is selected by default."},"6661":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Optionally add **Tags**: type one and press Enter, or click a suggested tag (**Business**, **Education**, **Webinar**, **Sales**, **Coaching**)."},"6662"