s at the time you set, in this timezone."},"6668":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Under **Available Sessions**, set the date and time."},"6669":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Optional: click **Add Session** to offer the same webinar at more than one date or time."},"6670":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Under **Schedule Preferences**, choose how many upcoming sessions a registrant can pick from."},"6671":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Click **Continue to Pricing**."},"6672":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#set-schedule","content":"*1 Frequency · 2 Timezone · 3 Session date and time · 4 Add Session · 5 Schedule Preferences · 6 Continue.*"},"6673":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#timezone","content":"A live webinar runs at one fixed time for everyone, in the timezone you set. Your registration page shows that time with its timezone. Choose the timezone you will broadcast in."},"6674":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#timezone","content":"Only just-in-time sessions on evergreen webinars follow each attendee's own local time. Live and scheduled sessions always run in the webinar's timezone."},"6675":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#past-dates","content":"You can't schedule a session in the past. Earlier dates are greyed out in the picker."},"6676":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"Choosing **Weekly** turns the single session into a recurring schedule and adds four controls:"},"6677":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"| Control          | What it does                                  |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Days of week** | Which days the webinar runs, Monday to Sunday |","table":"table-2"},"6678":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"| Control                                    | What it does                                                                                      |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Start Date** and **End Date (Optional)** | When the recurrence begins and ends. Leave the end date as **No end date** to run it indefinitely |","table":"table-2"},"6679":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"| Control                           | What it does                          |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Session Time** and **Add Time** | Run it more than once on the same day |","table":"table-2"},"6680":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"| Control            | What it does                                                             |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Blackout Dates** | Stop the webinar running on specific dates, such as holidays or time off |","table":"table-2"},"6681":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#blackout-dates","content":"A weekly webinar runs until you stop it. Use **Blackout Dates** to skip individual days without ending the series, or set an end date to stop it."},"6682":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#schedule-preferences","content":"By default registrants see **only the next available session**. Change **Schedule Preferences** to let them choose from more upcoming sessions."},"6683":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#pricing","content":"On **Step 3 of 4: Pricing**, choose one:"},"6684":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#pricing","content":"**Free** (selected by default): attendees register without paying."},"6685":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#pricing","content":"**Paid**: attendees pay to register. Requires a connected Stripe account."},"6686":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#pricing","content":"Click **Continue to Registration Template**."},"6687":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"Selecting **Paid** shows:"},"6688":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"**Pricing Title** and an optional **Description**, shown to attendees at checkout"},"6689":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"**Live webinar price**, the amount each registrant pays"},"6690":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"**Live + Replay bundle**, to sell access to the webinar and its recording together"},"6691":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"Attendees pay through a Stripe checkout, and the money goes straight to your Stripe account. If no account is connected, a **Payments · Action required** panel offers **Connect with Stripe**. You can switch back to **Free** any time before creating the webinar."},"6692":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"Once people pay, the webinar's **Analytics** tab shows what you've earned under **Revenue**, with a list of every transaction and its status."},"6693":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"On **Step 4 of 4: Registration Template**:"},"6694":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"Filter by category: **All Templates**, **Agency**, **Coach**, **Education**, **Health & Wellness**, **Lead Magnet**, **Marketing**, or **My Templates** for ones you have saved."},"6695":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"Click a template. **Default Register Page** is the simplest one-column option; **Build Your Own** starts from a blank page."},"6696":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"Click **Create Webinar**."},"6697":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"*1 Category filters · 2 Template cards · 3 Create button.*"},"6698":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"You can skip this step. The button reads **Skip & Create Webinar** until you select a template, and you can choose one later."},"6699":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"The webinar is created and opens in the **registration page builder**, with your schedule applied and a live countdown to the session."},"6700":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"The default form collects **Full name** and **Email**, both required. Use **Add Custom Field** to collect more on the form."},"6701":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"Use the desktop and mobile toggle to check both layouts."},"6702":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"Creating the webinar does not publish it. Your registration page goes live only when you click **Publish**. Use **Preview** to check it and **Save** to keep a draft."},"6703":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#what-it-is","content":"A live webinar is a session you present in real time. Attendees join at the scheduled moment, and chat and questions happen as they happen. Live is one of three webinar types; simulive and evergreen play a recording instead. The schedule you set here decides when registrants can attend, and the registration page is where they sign up for it."},"6704":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#what-its-for","content":"A live webinar suits sessions where your presence is the point: a launch, a workshop or a class with real questions. Creating it fixes the date, time and timezone that people sign up for."},"6705":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**Many sittings, one page.** **Add Session**, **Daily** and **Weekly** keep repeat sessions under a single registration page."},"6706":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**Holidays stay free.** **Blackout Dates** skip chosen days without ending a weekly run."},"6707":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**Payment at sign-up.** With **Paid** selected, people complete a Stripe checkout before they are registered."},"6708":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**No accidental launch.** The registration page stays private until you click **Publish**."},"6709":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#without-it","content":"Without a scheduled live session, your audience has no fixed moment to turn up. Promotion has no date to point at, so interest fades before anyone joins. You also lose the chance to answer questions while people are still deciding."},"6710":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#why-buyers-care","content":"It matters most to trainers, educators and sales teams whose value comes from talking with people in real time. The key moment is the week before a session, when people decide whether to register and keep the date free."},"6711":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A real-estate training company with three instructors runs a live exam review for about 80 trainee agents. It meets on Tuesday and Thursday evenings for the eight weeks before each licensing exam, and it pauses on public holidays."},"6712":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#approach","content":"A common approach is to set up a separate event for every evening, which can mean sixteen events per course. Each one may need its own sign-up link, so trainees often juggle a list of links. When a holiday moves a class, someone usually has to rebuild that night by hand."},"6713":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#approach","content":"The review is the same course with the same instructors every evening. What changes is only the calendar. So one webinar with a repeating schedule fits the course far better than sixteen separate ones, as long as the gaps can be marked."},"6714":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#approach","content":"EasyWebinar handles this as a single live webinar. The team picks **Weekly**, ticks Tuesday and Thursday, and sets the course dates as the **Start Date** and **End Date (Optional)**. Holidays go in as **Blackout Dates**, and every trainee signs up on the same registration page."},"6715":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#approach","content":"The weekly controls are easy to spot. With **Weekly** selected, the schedule step shows **Days of week**, **Session Time** with **Add Time**, and **Blackout Dates**. How this scheduling stacks up against other live webinar tools is covered in How live webinars compare, below."},"6716":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#with-registration-page","content":"The webinar opens straight into the registration page builder with your schedule applied. Edit the page, add form fields and publish it there. The registration embeds put the same form on your own site."},"6717":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#with-reminders","content":"Reminder timing is relative to the webinar, not a fixed clock time, so it follows a recurring schedule. Set reminders on the **Notifications** tab; see reminder emails for each session."},"6718":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#with-overview","content":"After the webinar exists, its **Overview** tab holds the schedule. The options menu on **Scheduling Options** changes the whole schedule, and the menu on a session row acts on one sitting. Click **Share** for the **Registration Page Link** you promote, or use the sharing links guide."},"6719":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#with-cloning","content":"The type is fixed once the webinar exists. To reuse a live webinar as simulive or evergreen, clone it and choose the new type on the copy."},"6720":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#with-engagement","content":"Live chat, polls and questions from attendees are set up on the webinar's tabs after you create it, ready for the session itself."},"6721":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how live scheduling fits different teams."},"6722":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#training-providers","content":"A training provider runs the same class on set weekdays through a term. A **Weekly** schedule with an end date covers the term, and **Blackout Dates** cover the breaks."},"6723":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team presents a quarterly product briefing at one fixed time. It offers a second sitting with **Add Session** for prospects in other regions."},"6724":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#consultants","content":"A consultant charges for a live masterclass by choosing **Paid** on the pricing step. Buyers complete a Stripe checkout before their registration goes through."},"6725":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#coaches","content":"A coach holds free weekly office hours with **No end date**. Registrants see only the next session unless the coach changes **Schedule Preferences**."},"6726":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare","content":"EasyWebinar builds live, simulive and evergreen webinars from one create dialog. A live webinar can repeat on a **Weekly** schedule and charge at sign-up through a Stripe checkout. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"6727":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare","content":"Live webinar set-up, from each platform's public documentation:"},"6728":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform        | Live and recorded webinars in one product | Weekly recurring live sessions | Paid registration with built-in checkout |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                                       | Yes                            | Yes                                      |","table":"table-3"},"6729":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform  | Live and recorded webinars in one product | Weekly recurring live sessions | Paid registration with built-in checkout |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (detail)                              | Yes (detail)                   | Via Zapier                               |","table":"table-3"},"6730":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform      | Live and recorded webinars in one product | Weekly recurring live sessions | Paid registration with built-in checkout |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Yes (detail)                              | Partly (one session per click) | Via another app                          |","table":"table-3"},"6731":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform       | Live and recorded webinars in one product | Weekly recurring live sessions | Paid registration with built-in checkout |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam** | Separate product (EverWebinar)            | Yes (detail)                   | Third-party checkout                     |","table":"table-3"},"6732":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare","content":"| Platform       | Live and recorded webinars in one product | Weekly recurring live sessions | Paid registration with built-in checkout |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarKit** | Partly (depends on plan)                  | Yes (detail)                   | Yes (through Whop)                       |","table":"table-3"},"6733":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"6734":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**Charging is part of the builder.** Choosing **Paid** in EasyWebinar sends registrants to a Stripe checkout. Demio's help centre says it has no native paid webinar feature and points to Zapier. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"6735":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**A whole term in one schedule.** EasyWebinar's **Weekly** option sets days, an end date and blackout days at once. In Livestorm, each **Add session** click adds one session a week later. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"6736":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**Live and recorded in one account.** EasyWebinar offers **Live Webinar**, **Simulive Webinar** and **Evergreen Webinar** in the same dialog. WebinarJam runs recorded webinars in its sister product, EverWebinar. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"6737":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"**No plan gate on the type.** Every EasyWebinar plan includes this builder. WebinarKit's help centre says live and automated creation depend on your plan. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarKit."},"6738":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-154","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"6739":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-155","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**The type is fixed.** Clone the webinar and choose another type on the copy."},"6740":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-156","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**Choose Paid when you create the webinar.** If you switch an existing free webinar to paid, its registration page keeps the free form."},"6741":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-157","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**You can't schedule a session in the past.**"},"6742":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-158","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**Registrant numbers depend on your plan.** Attendee and registration limits differ between EasyWebinar's plans; the features on this page are available on all plans."},"6743":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-159","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits-and-variations","content":"**A live webinar runs at one fixed time** in the timezone you set."},"6744":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-160","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits-and-variations","content":"**A weekly webinar runs until you stop it**, unless you set an end date."},"6745":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-161","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits-and-variations","content":"**Registrants see the next session only** unless you change the schedule preference."},"6746":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-162","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-multiple-times","content":"Yes. Click **Add Session** to add dates and times, or switch the frequency to **Daily** or **Weekly**."},"6747":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-163","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-change-type","content":"No. Clone the webinar and choose the type you want on the copy. This is also how you turn a live webinar into an evergreen one."},"6748":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-164","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-owner","content":"No. Any team member can create and schedule webinars."},"6749":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-165","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-live-immediately","content":"No. It becomes public only when you click **Publish**."},"6750":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-166","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-types","content":"Live broadcasts in real time. Simulive plays pre-recorded content at scheduled times, with attendees registering for specific dates. Evergreen makes pre-recorded content available 24/7, with viewers watching on their own schedule."},"6751":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-167","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-holiday","content":"Use **Blackout Dates** on the schedule step to list the dates the webinar should skip."},"6752":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-168","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-timezone","content":"The one you set for the webinar. A live session runs at one fixed time for everyone, and the registration page shows that time with its timezone."},"6753":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-169","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-past","content":"No. Past dates are disabled in the date picker."},"6754":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-170","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-template","content":"No. The button reads **Skip & Create Webinar** when nothing is selected, and you can choose a template later."},"6755":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-171","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-charge","content":"Choose **Paid** on the pricing step and connect a Stripe account. You can also sell a **Live + Replay bundle** that includes the recording."},"6756":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-172","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#related","content":"Pages for what comes after the webinar exists."},"6757":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-173","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#next-steps","content":"Run a live webinar: what to do in the room when your scheduled session starts."},"6758":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-174","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#next-steps","content":"The webinar Overview tab: change the schedule for the whole webinar, or act on a single session, after it exists."},"6759":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-175","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#next-steps","content":"Offers and the countdown timer: put a call to action in front of the room while you present."},"6760":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-176","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#next-steps","content":"Connect a CRM and map your webinar data: send registrants into your CRM as they sign up."},"6761":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/creat