ntent":"Create and schedule a live webinar: set a one-time or recurring schedule and choose free or paid registration."},"7175":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#next-steps","content":"Offers and the countdown timer: build the offers you sell during the webinar, with an optional countdown."},"7176":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars#next-steps","content":"Charge for webinar registration: take payment through Stripe when people register."},"7177":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"page","content":"The green room and backstage","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","The live room"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room"},"7178":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","content":"How EasyWebinar's green room lets you prepare a live webinar with nothing broadcast, and how backstage holds co-presenters and moderators until you bring them on stage."},"7179":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"7180":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#what-it-is","content":"What the green room is"},"7181":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-3","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#why-it-matters","content":"Why