een room"},"7206":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-28","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"7207":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-29","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"7208":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-30","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-broadcast","content":"Does anything I do in the green room get broadcast?"},"7209":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-cohosts","content":"Where do my co-hosts appear when they join?"},"7210":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-guest-speaker","content":"How do I invite a guest speaker?"},"7211":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-account-needed","content":"Does a guest presenter need an EasyWebinar account?"},"7212":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-team-vs-presenter","content":"What's the difference between a team member and a presenter?"},"7213":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-invite-from-room","content":"Can I invite people from inside the room?"},"7214":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-move-back","content":"Can I take someone off the stage?"},"7215":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-exit","content":"Can I leave the green room without going live?"},"7216":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-easycast","content":"Should I set up EasyCast in the green room?"},"7217":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-waiting-area","content":"Is the green room the same as the waiting area?"},"7218":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"Related"},"7219":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","content":"The green room is the private state of the EasyWebinar live room before a broadcast starts. You and your team can test cameras, microphones and screen sharing and arrange the stage, while the header reads **Not Live** and nothing reaches attendees. Backstage is the waiting area inside the room: co-presenters and moderators arrive there, off stage, and appear to the audience only when you move them on."},"7220":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                | Green room                                          | Backstage                                         |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it is** | The room before **Go Live**, with nothing broadcast | A holding area for presenters who aren't on stage |","table":"table-0"},"7221":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                  | Green room                                           | Backstage                                                       |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who is there** | You and anyone who has joined to present or moderate | Co-hosts and moderators who have joined but aren't on stage yet |","table":"table-0"},"7222":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                        | Green room                | Backstage                           |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **What attendees see** | Nothing until you go live | Nothing of people waiting backstage |","table":"table-0"},"7223":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                       | Green room                                                                    | Backstage                                                 |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How you get there** | **Enter Room** on the webinar's **Overview**, then **Continue to Green Room** | Joining presenters and moderators land here automatically |","table":"table-0"},"7224":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                   | Green room                                     | Backstage                                                        |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How you leave** | **Go Live** to start broadcasting, or **Exit** | You move a person to the stage, and back again when they're done |","table":"table-0"},"7225":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                             | Green room                                        | Backstage                                |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Where it sits on screen** | The whole room, with the status badge at top left | The **Backstage** panel on the left edge |","table":"table-0"},"7226":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#what-it-is","content":"When you enter the room for a live webinar, you don't go straight on air. You land in the green room: the full webinar room with every control working, but in a **Not Live** state. Your camera preview, the stage layout, the side rail and the EasyCast controls are all there, so you prepare in the same room your attendees will see once you start."},"7227":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#what-it-is","content":"**Backstage** is the part of the room for people who are present but not presenting yet. Anyone joining as a co-host or moderator arrives backstage rather than on stage. From there you move them onto the stage when it's their turn, and back off when they've finished. This works the same before and after you go live."},"7228":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#what-it-is","content":"The two together are what EasyWebinar's glossary calls the green room: a presenter backstage before the broadcast starts."},"7229":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#what-its-for","content":"The green room separates getting ready from being seen. Live presenting has a few things that can go wrong in the first minute, such as a muted microphone or the wrong window shared. The green room lets you find them while nobody is watching."},"7230":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#how-it-helps","content":"**Mistakes stay private.** Audio checks and false starts happen before the broadcast, not at the top of the recording."},"7231":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#how-it-helps","content":"**Guests arrive quietly.** A co-host can join early, sort out their audio and wait backstage without being shown."},"7232":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#how-it-helps","content":"**The stage changes on your cue.** You decide when each person appears, so handovers between speakers look planned."},"7233":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#how-it-helps","content":"**The start is deliberate.** The broadcast begins only when you click **Go Live** and confirm."},"7234":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#without-it","content":"Without a staging area, the first minutes of a webinar become the rehearsal. Attendees who arrived on time watch presenters ask whether they can be heard. The recording behind your replay page then opens with the same fumbling."},"7235":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#why-buyers-care","content":"It matters most to teams that run live webinars with several speakers, such as panels, interviews and demos with a moderator. Those sessions depend on guests joining without interrupting, and on handovers that look rehearsed."},"7236":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#approach","content":"Take a typical case. An employment law firm runs a quarterly live panel for HR directors on new workplace rules. Two partners host, and two guest speakers join from outside the firm. Around 180 people attend, and the session is recorded for clients who miss it."},"7237":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#approach","content":"A common approach is to send every speaker the same link and start at the advertised time. In practice, the first minutes tend to go on sound checks and guests asking whether they can be heard. Those minutes also open the recording that clients watch later."},"7238":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#approach","content":"The panel itself doesn't need to change. What matters is where the speakers wait and when the audience starts watching. If the checks happen out of view, the session can open on the first question instead of a sound test."},"7239":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#approach","content":"EasyWebinar handles this with the green room and backstage. The partners click **Enter Room** and land in the room in a **Not Live** state. Each guest joins with the **Co-presenter Join Link**, waits backstage, and moves to the stage when their topic comes up. The broadcast starts only when a partner clicks **Go Live**."},"7240":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#approach","content":"The screenshot under Read the room shows the **Not Live** status, the **Backstage** panel and **Go Live** in one view. How other platforms handle a pre-show room for speakers is covered in How the green room compares, below."},"7241":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"Before the session, decide who will present and who will moderate. You have two routes."},"7242":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"**From the Overview tab.** The **Team & Moderators** panel lists the presenters and moderators who can run this webinar. A new webinar shows \"No presenters or moderators added yet.\" Use **Add presenter** for someone who appears on camera and presents, or **Invite** to send an invitation to join the webinar team."},"7243":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"**With a join link.** Click **Share** on the webinar and copy the link for the role:"},"7244":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"| Link                       | Who it's for                           |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Co-presenter Join Link** | A presenter, so they can join the room |","table":"table-1"},"7245":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"| Link                                  | Who it's for                              |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Moderator Join Link for Live room** | A moderator, to handle chat and questions |","table":"table-1"},"7246":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"A presenter or moderator joining by link doesn't need an EasyWebinar account. Treat both links as private: anyone holding one can join your room in that role. The registration, attendee and replay links are the ones meant for your audience."},"7247":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#enter-the-green-room","content":"On the webinar's **Overview**, click **Enter Room**."},"7248":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#enter-the-green-room","content":"Choose your **camera, microphone and speakers**."},"7249":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#enter-the-green-room","content":"Click **Continue to Green Room**."},"7250":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#enter-the-green-room","content":"The button stays greyed out until the room can see a camera and a microphone. If you see **\"Not able to access selected media device\"**, see Camera not detected."},"7251":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"*1 Status · 2 Settings, Reactions, EasyCast and Full Screen · 3 Camera, Mic and Share · 4 Go Live and Exit · 5 Backstage · 6 Side rail · 7 Layout.*"},"7252":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area       | What to check here                        |\n| --- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Status** | **Not Live**, and whether recording is on |","table":"table-2"},"7253":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area                                              | What to check here            |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Settings · Reactions · EasyCast · Full Screen** | Room setup and multistreaming |","table":"table-2"},"7254":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area                     | What to check here                            |\n| --- | ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Camera · Mic · Share** | Your own devices and a test of screen sharing |","table":"table-2"},"7255":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area               | What to check here                     |\n| --- | ------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Go Live · Exit** | Start the broadcast, or leave the room |","table":"table-2"},"7256":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area          | What to check here           |\n| --- | ------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Backstage** | Presenters waiting off stage |","table":"table-2"},"7257":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area          | What to check here                                                                  |\n| --- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 6   | **Side rail** | **Chat**, **People**, **Offers**, **Polls**, **Design**, **Question** and **Theme** |","table":"table-2"},"7258":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area       | What to check here                   |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 7   | **Layout** | How presenters are arranged on stage |","table":"table-2"},"7259":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"As co-hosts and moderators join, they appear backstage. Expand the **Backstage** panel on the left edge of the room to see who's waiting. To see everyone at once, open **People** on the side rail."},"7260":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"|     | Area              | What it shows                                            |\n| --- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Invite People** | Join links for presenters and moderators, ready to share |","table":"table-3"},"7261":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"|     | Area           | What it shows                                              |\n| --- | -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Presenters** | Everyone who can appear on stage, with the **Host** marked |","table":"table-3"},"7262":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"|     | Area          | What it shows     |\n| --- | ------------- | ----------------- |\n| 3   | **Attendees** | Everyone watching |","table":"table-3"},"7263":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"**Move someone to the stage** when it's their turn to speak."},"7264":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"**Move them back** when they're done."},"7265":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"If a guest hasn't received their link, **Invite People** gives you the presenter and moderator links from inside the room."},"7266":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"Use the time before going live to:"},"7267":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Test Share** with the window or screen you'll actually present."},"7268":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Confirm recording.** **Auto Recording Enabled** in the header means the session will be recorded; **Settings → Recording Settings** changes it."},"7269":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Set the look.** Backgrounds, blur, frame overlays and layout are on **Design**. Changes apply immediately, so set them here rather than mid-broadcast."},"7270":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Switch on any EasyCast destinations.** Click **EasyCast** in the top bar and turn **Stream** on for each channel this session should reach."},"7271":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Decide on camera and mic.** You can switch **Camera** and **Mic** off in the green room and still go live, for a session built on slides or video."},"7272":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#leave-the-green-room","content":"Click **Go Live** when everyone is ready. The confirmation reminds you that anyone in the waiting area will be moved in automatically, and that offers and polls should already exist. Confirm, and the header changes from **Not Live** to **LIVE** with a timer."},"7273":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#leave-the-green-room","content":"To leave without broadcasting, click **Exit**. For what happens once you're live, see Run a live webinar."},"7274":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#with-team-members","content":"A team member is someone with their own EasyWebinar login, created under **Settings → Team** as an **Admin** or **User**. A presenter or moderator is someone running a specific webinar. Add a person to your team when they work in EasyWebinar regularly; send a join link when they're a guest on one session. Sharing one login between hosts means only one of you can be in the live room as a host. See Team members."},"7275":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#with-share-links","content":"The **Share** dialog on the webinar holds seven links, including the presenter and moderator ones above. **Shorten URL's** gives you shorter versions. See Sharing links."},"7276":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#with-easycast","content":"EasyCast destinations are switched on in the green room, before you go live. Once the broadcast starts, a platform icon for each destination appears in the top bar. Connections are made once, under **Integrations → EasyCast** in the sidebar, and work across every webinar."},"7277":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#with-room-design","content":"The **Design** panel sets the background, a frame overlay and the stage layout. Layout matters most when several presenters are on stage or someone is sharing a screen."},"7278":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the green room and backstage fit different webinars."},"7279":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team runs a panel with two guest speakers from partner companies. Each guest gets the **Co-presenter Join Link**, joins fifteen minutes early, and checks their audio backstage. The host introduces the topic alone, then moves each guest onto the stage in turn."},"7280":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#customer-success","content":"A customer success manager presents a customer training session while a colleague joins with the **Moderator Join Link for Live room** to handle questions. The moderator never needs to appear on stage, so they stay off it for the whole session."},"7281":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#coaches","content":"A coach runs an interview-style masterclass with a guest expert who has no EasyWebinar account. The guest joins by link, waits backstage during the coach's opening, and comes on stage for the interview segment."},"7282":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#product-teams","content":"A product team rehearses a product launch demo in the green room: they test the screen share of the product, pick a layout that gives the demo most of the stage, and switch on a LinkedIn Organisation destination in EasyCast before going live."},"7283":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare","content":"EasyWebinar gives you a private green room before the broadcast and a backstage where guests wait, both before and during the session. From the same room you can switch on several streaming destinations at once. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"7284":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare","content":"Green room features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"7285":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare","content":"| Platform        | Private room before going live | Backstage before and during the session | Stream to several platforms at once |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                            | Yes                                     | Yes                                 |","table":"table-4"},"7286":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare","content":"| Platform | Private room before going live | Backstage before and during the session | Stream to several platforms at once |\n| -------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Zoom** | Yes (Backstage)                | Yes (detail)                            | Not in docs                         |","table":"table-4"},"7287":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare","content":"| Platform | Private room before going live | Backstage before and during the session | Stream to several platforms at once |\n| -------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **ON24** | Yes (presenters backstage)     | Partly (before the start)               | Not in docs                         |","table":"table-4"},"7288":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare","content":"| Platform  | Private room before going live | Backstage before and during the session | Stream to several platforms at once |\n| --------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Not in docs                    | Not in docs                             | Yes (detail)                        |","table":"table-4"},"7289":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Private room before going live | Backstage before and during the session | Stream to several platforms at once     |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Not in docs                    | Not in docs                             | Partly (one service chosen per webinar) |","table":"table-4"},"7290":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"7291":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare-stronger","content":"**Guests held backstage during the session too.** In EasyWebinar, co-hosts and moderators land backstage and move to the stage and back as needed. ON24's guide describes presenters talking backstage before the webinar starts. More detail in EasyWebinar vs ON24."},"7292":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare-stronger","content":"**A rehearsal room inside the webinar.** EasyWebinar's green room is the full webinar room in a **Not Live** state. Demio's help centre describes a waiting room for attendees, with no presenter green room documented. More detail in EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"7293":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare-stronger","content":"**Several streams from one room.** EasyCast broadcasts to YouTube, LinkedIn or a custom RTMP destination at the same time, switched on in the green room. Zoom's help centre covers livestreaming webinars to YouTube, with no multi-destination streaming documented. More detail in EasyWebinar vs Zoom."},"7294":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare-stronger","content":"**Checks before the broadcast starts.** EasyWebinar keeps you in **Not Live** until you click **Go Live** and confirm. WebinarJam's help centre doesn't document a green room or backstage for presenters. More detail in EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"7295":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"7296":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**A camera and microphone are needed to get past the device check,** even if you switch them off in the green room."},"7297":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**The green room broadcasts nothing.** The header reads **Not Live** until you go live."},"7298":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Co-hosts and moderators arrive backstage,** never straight onto the stage."},"7299":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Presenter and moderator links grant that role** to whoever holds them. Keep them private."},"7300":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Joining by link needs no account,** but a person with a team login can also join as a presenter."},"7301":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Design changes apply as you make them.** Anything you change after going live is visible."},"7302":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Only one event can be live at a time.** If another webinar is live, **Enter Room** shows \"You can only have one event live at a time.\""},"7303":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-broadcast","content":"No. The header reads **Not Live**, and nothing is sent to attendees until you click **Go Live** and confirm."},"7304":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-cohosts","content":"Backstage. Expand the **Backstage** panel on the left edge to see them, and move them to the stage when you want them seen."},"7305":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-guest-speaker","content":"Send them the **Co-presenter Join Link** from the **Share** dialog, or add them under **Team & Moderators** on the Overview tab."},"7306":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-account-needed","content":"No. Presenters and moderators can join with their link without an account."},"7307":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-team-vs-presenter","content":"A team member has their own login to your EasyWebinar account. A presenter or moderator is running a specific webinar, and may be a guest with only a join link."},"7308":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-invite-from-room","content":"Yes. **Invite People** at the top of the **People** panel shares the presenter and moderator join links."},"7309":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-move-back","content":"Yes. Move them back off the stage when they've finished, and they return to backstage."},"7310":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-exit","content":"Yes. Click **Exit**."},"7311":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-easycast","content":"Yes. Switch **Stream** on for each destination before you click **Go Live**."},"7312":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-waiting-area","content":"No. The green room is for you and your presenters. The waiting area is where attendees wait before the session, and they're moved into the webinar automatically when you go live."},"7313":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"Create and schedule a live webinar: the session has to exist and be scheduled before you can enter its green room."},"7314":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"The Overview tab: where **Enter Room** opens the green room for a session."},"7315":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"Live chat settings: decide how chat behaves before your moderator joins backstage."},"7316":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"Set up Q&A: set up the question queue a moderator will work through."},"7317":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"page","content":"Run a live webinar","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","The live room"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar"},"7318":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","content":"Enter the EasyWebinar webinar room, prepare in the green room, go live, present with chat, polls, offers and Q&A, then end the session and find your recording."},"7319":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"7320":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-liv