                      |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Not the same as** | Instant replay (**On Demand**), an evergreen schedule setting |","table":"table-0"},"8092":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#what-it-is","content":"The **Replay** tab holds everything about the page people use to catch up on a past session. It has five parts:"},"8093":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#what-it-is","content":"|     | Section             | What it does                    |\n| --- | ------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Replay Settings** | Turns the replay page on or off |","table":"table-1"},"8094":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#what-it-is","content":"|     | Section              | What it does                                |\n| --- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Replay Page Link** | The URL you send people, with Copy and Open |","table":"table-1"},"8095":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#what-it-is","content":"|     | Section          | What it does                         |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 3   | **Availability** | How long the replay stays accessible |","table":"table-1"},"8096":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#what-it-is","content":"|     | Section       | What it does                                 |\n| --- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Redirects** | Where viewers go when the recording finishes |","table":"table-1"},"8097":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#what-it-is","content":"|     | Section        | What it does                    |\n| --- | -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Experience** | What the replay page looks like |","table":"table-1"},"8098":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#what-it-is","content":"The replay page is also the fifth of the five webinar pages on the **Content** tab, after the registration page, thank-you page, waiting area and webinar page. The Replay tab decides how the page behaves; the Content tab is where you can style it in the page builder."},"8099":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#what-its-for","content":"A replay gives everyone who registered a second chance at the session. It serves people who couldn't make the live time, people who left early and people who want to watch again. For a webinar that ends in an offer, it also extends the window to act on the offer."},"8100":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#how-it-helps","content":"**It reaches the larger audience.** **Missed**, people who registered and never showed up, is the group most worth emailing."},"8101":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#how-it-helps","content":"**It can keep selling.** With **Webinar Replica**, the replay carries the same offers and polls as the live session."},"8102":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#how-it-helps","content":"**It can carry a deadline.** **Expire after days** or **Specific date** give the replay a closing point."},"8103":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#how-it-helps","content":"**It hands viewers a next step.** **After the replay ends** sends them to an offer or a booking page."},"8104":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#without-it","content":"Without a replay page, the session is over for everyone who wasn't there. No-shows get a follow-up with nothing to watch. An offer made live never reaches a second audience. EasyWebinar's guidance is to leave live recording on because the replay is usually watched by more people than the live session."},"8105":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#why-buyers-care","content":"Replays matter most to anyone running webinars to generate leads or sales, because the replay decides how much one session produces. They matter in the days after each session, when the people who missed it decide whether to catch up."},"8106":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A personal-finance educator runs a free live class on clearing credit card debt, on the first Thursday of each month at 19:30. About 250 people register, many of them parents and shift workers. The class ends with an offer to join an eight-week budgeting programme."},"8107":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#approach","content":"A common workaround is to upload the recording to a video site and email the link the next morning. That probably reaches some of the people who missed the evening. Yet the offer and the polls tend to stay behind in the live room, so the recording teaches without selling. Viewers may also keep watching for months, long after enrolment has closed."},"8108":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#approach","content":"The class itself doesn't need to change. The people who missed it need the same session, with the same offer, and a clear point where the chance ends. The replay should finish where the live class finished: on the next step."},"8109":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#approach","content":"EasyWebinar handles this on the webinar's **Replay** tab. The educator switches on **Enable replay page** and keeps **Webinar Replica**, so the offer and polls play as they did live. **Expire after days** gives the replay a closing point, and **After the replay ends** sends viewers to the programme's enrolment page. A **Webinar Follow-up** to no-shows carries the link."},"8110":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#approach","content":"The screenshot under Set up a replay page shows **Availability** beside **Redirects** and **Experience** on one tab. How other platforms handle replay deadlines, offers and page design is covered in How replay pages compare, below."},"8111":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#set-it-up","content":"Open your webinar and click the **Replay** tab."},"8112":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#set-it-up","content":"Switch on **Enable replay page**. The page then reads *Replay page is live, anyone with the link can watch*."},"8113":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#set-it-up","content":"Under **Availability**, choose how long the replay stays open."},"8114":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#set-it-up","content":"Under **Redirects**, set **After the replay ends** if you want viewers sent somewhere when the recording finishes."},"8115":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#set-it-up","content":"Under **Experience**, choose **Webinar Replica** or **Custom Build**."},"8116":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#set-it-up","content":"Copy the **Replay Page Link** with **Copy**, or check the page with **Open**."},"8117":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#set-it-up","content":"*1 Replay Settings · 2 Replay Page Link · 3 Availability · 4 Redirects · 5 Experience. The replay link is blurred because it contains the account's own subdomain.*"},"8118":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#set-it-up","content":"While **Enable replay page** is on, anyone with the link can watch. Treat the **Replay Page Link** as something that can be shared beyond the people you send it to."},"8119":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#availability","content":"| Option               | What happens                                | When it suits                                                   |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Always Available** | No expiry. The replay stays up indefinitely | Training, onboarding and evergreen content that keeps its value |","table":"table-2"},"8120":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#availability","content":"| Option                | What happens                                             | When it suits                                                 |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Expire after days** | The replay closes a set number of days after the session | A rolling deadline, for example a few days after each session |","table":"table-2"},"8121":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#availability","content":"| Option            | What happens                                    | When it suits                                 |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Specific date** | The replay closes at a date and time you choose | A fixed deadline, such as the end of a launch |","table":"table-2"},"8122":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#availability","content":"A deadline creates urgency, which is why most offers sit behind one. If your offers or follow-up emails mention when the replay closes, make sure they match the option you chose here."},"8123":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#redirects","content":"**After the replay ends**, under **Redirects**, sends viewers on as soon as the recording finishes playing. Point it at your offer, a booking page, or the next step you want people to take. Without it, viewers aren't sent anywhere when the recording ends."},"8124":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#experience","content":"| Option              | What viewers get                                                                | When to choose it                                                           |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar Replica** | A duplicate of your live webinar: the same video, offers, polls and chat replay | The quicker choice; keeps offers and polls working exactly as they did live |","table":"table-3"},"8125":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#experience","content":"| Option           | What viewers get                                                   | When to choose it                                             |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Custom Build** | A page you design yourself, with its own layout, CTAs and branding | When the replay needs a different pitch from the live session |","table":"table-3"},"8126":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#style-replay-page","content":"On the **Content** tab, click **Edit** on the **Replay Page** card."},"8127":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#style-replay-page","content":"Select blocks to change them, use the device toggle to check the mobile layout, and click **Preview** to see the real page."},"8128":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#style-replay-page","content":"Click **Save** to keep a draft and **Publish** to make it public. Each page has its own **Publish** button."},"8129":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#style-replay-page","content":"If you only have time to style two of the five pages, EasyWebinar's guidance is to make them the registration page and the replay page: one carries your signups, the other carries the long tail of views."},"8130":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#replay-vs-instant-replay","content":"The two are easy to confuse, and they answer different needs."},"8131":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#replay-vs-instant-replay","content":"|                | Replay                                               | Instant replay (**On Demand**)                                                            |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it is** | The recording of a session that has already happened | An evergreen setting that lets someone watch immediately instead of waiting for a session |","table":"table-4"},"8132":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#replay-vs-instant-replay","content":"|                      | Replay             | Instant replay (**On Demand**)   |\n| -------------------- | ------------------ | -------------------------------- |\n| **Where you set it** | The **Replay** tab | The evergreen webinar's schedule |","table":"table-4"},"8133":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#replay-vs-instant-replay","content":"|                    | Replay                         | Instant replay (**On Demand**) |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------ |\n| **Which webinars** | Every webinar has a Replay tab | Evergreen webinars             |","table":"table-4"},"8134":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#replay-vs-instant-replay","content":"|                  | Replay                                           | Instant replay (**On Demand**)                    |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | People who missed a session and want to catch up | People who want to watch the moment they register |","table":"table-4"},"8135":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#replay-vs-instant-replay","content":"|                    | Replay         | Instant replay (**On Demand**)                             |\n| ------------------ | -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Button wording** | Not applicable | **Instant replay text**, *Watch instant replay* by default |","table":"table-4"},"8136":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#replay-vs-instant-replay","content":"If you want people to watch the moment they register, you want **On Demand** on an evergreen webinar. If you want people who missed a session to catch up, you want the replay page. See On Demand."},"8137":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-offers","content":"Offers and polls carry over to the replay when the replay uses **Webinar Replica**. If an offer's headline or countdown talks about a deadline, check it still makes sense to someone watching later, and use **Preview** on the replay page to see what viewers get. See Offers and Polls."},"8138":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-recording","content":"On a live webinar, the room header shows **Auto Recording Enabled** when recording is on, and recorded sessions land in **Library → Recordings**. Recording can be changed in the room under **Settings → Recording Settings**. See Run a live webinar and The Library."},"8139":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-follow-ups","content":"Replay emails are set up on the **Notifications** tab, not on the Replay tab. Add a **Webinar Follow-up** after the session, set its audience (everyone who registered, only attendees, or only no-shows) and include the replay link. No-shows are usually the biggest group, and the replay link is what they want. See Reminder emails for the rest of the email sequence."},"8140":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-sharing","content":"The replay link also appears in the webinar's **Share** dialog as **Attendee Replay link**, alongside the registration and attendee join links meant for your audience. See Sharing links."},"8141":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-paid-webinars","content":"A paid webinar can sell a **Live + Replay bundle**, a second option that includes the replay recording with its own price. If you sell replay access, set the replay's **Availability** to match what the bundle promises. See Paid webinars."},"8142":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-analytics","content":"| Where                              | What it shows about the replay   |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Analytics** → **Replay Watched** | People who watched the recording |","table":"table-5"},"8143":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-analytics","content":"| Where                              | What it shows about the replay                                                        |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Analytics** → **Total Attended** | Unique people, live or replay, split into **Live only**, **Replay only** and **Both** |","table":"table-5"},"8144":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-analytics","content":"| Where                             | What it shows about the replay     |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Overview** → **Total Attended** | Live attendees plus replay viewers |","table":"table-5"},"8145":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-analytics","content":"| Where                                    | What it shows about the replay             |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **People** → **Replay watch percentage** | How much of the replay each person watched |","table":"table-5"},"8146":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-analytics","content":"Replay views are counted separately from live attendance, and someone who did both shows under **Both**. See Webinar analytics and People."},"8147":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-crm","content":"A connected CRM can act on replay behaviour with the **Watched replay** and **Didn't watch replay** events, and receive each contact's **Webinar Replay Link** or **Webinar Replay Short Link** in a custom field. See Connect a CRM and map your webinar data."},"8148":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-tracking","content":"On the webinar's **Settings** tab, the **Tracking Code** sub-tab lets you add scripts to each of the five pages, including the **Replay Page**, so your analytics or ad platform can count people who watched afterwards."},"8149":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#with-cloning","content":"**Replay settings** are one of the webinar assets you can bring across when cloning a webinar. See Clone a webinar."},"8150":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the replay page fits different kinds of webinar."},"8151":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#course-creators","content":"After a live launch webinar, a creator sets the replay to **Expire after days**, keeps **Webinar Replica** so the enrolment offer stays on the page, and points **After the replay ends** at the course checkout. A follow-up to no-shows carries the replay link. See selling online courses with webinars."},"8152":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team runs a live panel, then uses **Custom Build** to give the replay its own layout and a call to action aimed at people who weren't in the room. **Replay Watched** in Analytics shows how much of the audience came through the replay."},"8153":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#customer-success","content":"A customer success team records an onboarding session and leaves the replay on **Always Available**, so new customers can watch it whenever they join. The **Replay Page Link** goes into the team's welcome material."},"8154":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#coaches","content":"A coach runs a free masterclass and closes the replay on a **Specific date** that matches the deadline on their offer. The **Watched replay** event in their CRM tags people who caught up, so the follow-up matches what each person saw."},"8155":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare","content":"EasyWebinar lets the replay close after a set number of days or on a date, repeat the live offers and polls, run as a separately designed page, and report replay viewers apart from live attendees. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"8156":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare","content":"Replay features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"8157":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare","content":"| Platform        | Replay closes after set days or on a date | Replay repeats the live offers and polls | Replay page designed separately | Replay viewers counted apart from live |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                                       | Yes                                      | Yes                             | Yes                                    |","table":"table-6"},"8158":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare","content":"| Platform  | Replay closes after set days or on a date | Replay repeats the live offers and polls | Replay page designed separately | Replay viewers counted apart from live |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Not in docs                               | Partly (one call to action)              | Yes (Replay Page Editor)        | Yes (unique and total views)           |","table":"table-6"},"8159":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Replay closes after set days or on a date | Replay repeats the live offers and polls | Replay page designed separately   | Replay viewers counted apart from live |\n| ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Partly (hours after the session)          | Yes (Replica replay)                     | Partly (custom video or redirect) | Yes (detail)                           |","table":"table-6"},"8160":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare","content":"| Platform     | Replay closes after set days or on a date | Replay repeats the live offers and polls | Replay page designed separately | Replay viewers counted apart from live |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Partly (days after the session)           | Yes (video with its interactions)        | Not in docs                     | Partly (replay as a session type)      |","table":"table-6"},"8161":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare","content":"| Platform      | Replay closes after set days or on a date | Replay repeats the live offers and polls | Replay page designed separately | Replay viewers counted apart from live |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Not in docs                               | Not in docs                              | Not in docs                     | Yes (number of replay viewers)         |","table":"table-6"},"8162":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"8163":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare-stronger","content":"**A deadline in days or on a date.** EasyWebinar offers **Expire after days** and **Specific date**. WebinarJam's help centre sets replay access as a number of hours after the live session. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"8164":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare-stronger","content":"**The whole offer, not one button.** **Webinar Replica** repeats the live video, offers, polls and chat replay. Demio's replay page carries a single Call-to-Action window. See EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"8165":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare-stronger","content":"**A replay page with its own pitch.** **Custom Build** gives the replay its own layout, CTAs and branding. eWebinar's help centre doesn't describe designing a separate replay page. See EasyWebinar vs eWebinar."},"8166":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare-stronger","content":"**A closing point you control.** EasyWebinar's **Availability** setting closes the replay when you choose. Livestorm's help centre doesn't document a replay expiry setting. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"8167":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"8168":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#limits","content":"**The link is public while the page is enabled.** Anyone with the **Replay Page Link** can watch."},"8169":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#limits","content":"**Instant replay is set elsewhere.** **On Demand** belongs to an evergreen webinar's schedule, not to the Replay tab."},"8170":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#limits","content":"**Viewers go nowhere at the end** unless you set **After the replay ends**."},"8171":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#limits","content":"**Offers and polls carry over only with Webinar Replica.** A **Custom Build** page has its own layout and CTAs."},"8172":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#limits","content":"**Replay emails live on the Notifications tab**, as follow-ups that include the replay link."},"8173":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#limits","content":"**Changes to the page design need publishing.** Each of the five pages has its own **Publish** button."},"8174":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-give-replay","content":"Switch on **Enable replay page** and send the **Replay Page Link**. It's also in the **Share** dialog as **Attendee Replay link**."},"8175":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-expire","content":"Yes. Choose **Expire after days** for a rolling deadline, or **Specific date** for a fixed one."},"8176":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-always-available","content":"Yes. **Always Available** has no expiry, which suits training, onboarding and evergreen content."},"8177":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-offers","content":"Yes, with **Webinar Replica**: the replay shows the same video, offers, polls and chat replay."},"8178":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-redirect","content":"Nowhere, unless you set **After the replay ends** under **Redirects**."},"8179":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-custom-build","content":"Yes. Choose **Custom Build** to design a page with its own layout, CTAs and branding."},"8180":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-instant-replay","content":"A replay is the recording of a past session. Instant replay, or **On Demand**, is an evergreen option that lets someone watch straight away without waiting for a session."},"8181":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-private","content":"No. While the replay page is enabled, anyone with the link can watch."},"8182":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-replay-email","content":"Add a **Webinar Follow-up** on the **Notifications** tab, set its audience to no-shows, and include the replay link."},"8183":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#faq-replay-views","content":"**Replay Watched** in the webinar's Analytics, and **Replay watch percentage** per person in **People**."},"8184":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#related","content":"On Demand: instant replay on evergreen webinars, which is often confused with the replay page."},"8185":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#related","content":"The Library: where the recordings your replay pages play are kept."},"8186":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#related","content":"Reminder emails: the rest of the email sequence around your replay follow-up."},"8187":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#related","content":"Offers: the offers that carry onto a Webinar Replica replay."},"8188":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#related","content":"Webinar analytics: Replay Watched and the Live only, Replay only and Both split."},"8189":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#related","content":"Paid webinars: sell replay access with a Live + Replay bundle."},"8190":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-154","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#related","content":"Clone a webinar: bring your replay settings to a new webinar."},"8191":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","type":"page","content":"Video hosting","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Videos, recordings and replays"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting"},"8192":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","content":"Host a webinar video on EasyWebinar with Local import, or play one from YouTube, Vimeo, Wistia or a direct MP4 link, with the formats, size limit, storage rules and duration setting for each route."},"8193":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"8194":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#what-it-is","content":"What video hosting is"},"8195":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-3","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#why-it-matters","conten