demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","content":"**On Demand** is an evergreen schedule setting that lets a registrant start watching your webinar straight away, with no session to wait for. EasyWebinar also calls it **instant replay**: registrants click a button, labelled *Watch instant replay* unless you change it, and the recording starts. It is a different thing from the replay page on the **Replay** tab, which shows the recording of a session that has already happened."},"8674":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Lets registrants watch immediately instead of waiting for a session |","table":"table-0"},"8675":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                |\n| --------------- | -------------- |\n| **Also called** | Instant replay |","table":"table-0"},"8676":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                           |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Where it's set** | The schedule step of an evergreen webinar |","table":"table-0"},"8677":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |           |\n| ----------------- | --------- |\n| **Webinar types** | Evergreen |","table":"table-0"},"8678":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                  |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Button wording** | **Instant replay text**; reads *Watch instant replay* by default |","table":"table-0"},"8679":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                              |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Combines with** | **Just-in-time Registration** and **Recurring Schedule** on the same webinar |","table":"table-0"},"8680":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                       |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Not the same as** | The replay page on the **Replay** tab |","table":"table-0"},"8681":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#what-it-is","content":"An evergreen webinar can offer three ways to watch. On Demand is the one with no wait at all: the registrant doesn't pick a session time, they start the recording when they're ready."},"8682":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#what-it-is","content":"| Option        | When the registrant watches |\n| ------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **On Demand** | Immediately                 |","table":"table-1"},"8683":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#what-it-is","content":"| Option                        | When the registrant watches                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Just-in-time Registration** | In a session starting a few minutes after they register |","table":"table-1"},"8684":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#what-it-is","content":"| Option                 | When the registrant watches   |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Recurring Schedule** | At a set daily or weekly time |","table":"table-1"},"8685":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#what-it-is","content":"Any combination can be switched on, and the registration page lists each enabled option as a choice."},"8686":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#on-demand-vs-replay","content":"The names overlap, so the two are easy to mix up."},"8687":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#on-demand-vs-replay","content":"|                   | On Demand (instant replay)                                       | Replay page                                          |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it plays** | The evergreen webinar's recording, whenever a registrant chooses | The recording of a session that has already happened |","table":"table-2"},"8688":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#on-demand-vs-replay","content":"|                  | On Demand (instant replay)                                  | Replay page                                      |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Who it's for** | People who want to watch now rather than wait for a session | People who missed a session and want to catch up |","table":"table-2"},"8689":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#on-demand-vs-replay","content":"|                      | On Demand (instant replay)                | Replay page                     |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Where you set it** | The schedule step of an evergreen webinar | The **Replay** tab of a webinar |","table":"table-2"},"8690":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#on-demand-vs-replay","content":"|                        | On Demand (instant replay)                 | Replay page                                                                           |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What you configure** | On or off, and the **Instant replay text** | Whether the page is on, how long it stays available, redirects and how the page looks |","table":"table-2"},"8691":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#on-demand-vs-replay","content":"A simple rule: if you want people to watch the moment they register, use On Demand on an evergreen webinar. If you want people who missed a session to catch up, use the replay page."},"8692":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#what-its-for","content":"On Demand is for evergreen webinars where the content is the point, not the occasion. Think of training, product explainers and onboarding material. People want to get through these on their own timetable."},"8693":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#how-it-helps","content":"**No waiting at all.** A registrant who is ready now can watch now."},"8694":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#how-it-helps","content":"**It suits people short on time.** Someone with twenty free minutes between meetings doesn't have to fit a session around them."},"8695":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#how-it-helps","content":"**It sits alongside scheduled options.** Registrants who'd rather turn up for a session can still pick a just-in-time or recurring one."},"8696":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#how-it-helps","content":"**The button speaks your language.** **Instant replay text** lets you word the button to match your page."},"8697":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#without-it","content":"Without On Demand, every registrant has to wait for a session, even if only for a few minutes. Some content is meant to be watched the moment people find it. For that content, any wait is a chance for them to leave and not return."},"8698":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#why-buyers-care","content":"On Demand matters to teams using evergreen webinars for education and onboarding. It matters most when the audience is busy and the content is the reason they came. Those registrants get immediate access from the same page, recording and webinar setup."},"8699":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#approach","content":"Take a typical case. An HR software vendor sells leave and payroll tools to companies with 50 to 200 staff. Its marketing team of three records a 15-minute explainer on a change to holiday pay rules and links it from a monthly newsletter. The aim is to get HR managers to book a product demo afterwards."},"8700":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#approach","content":"A common approach is to run the explainer at set times, two or three a week. HR managers tend to read newsletters between interviews and payroll deadlines, though. A Thursday afternoon slot may not fit, and some may decide the topic can wait. For them, the newsletter click is probably wasted."},"8701":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#approach","content":"The explainer has no live element that needs everyone together. Its value is the content, so the timing matters only to the reader. When a manager has fifteen spare minutes now, that is the moment to watch."},"8702":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#approach","content":"EasyWebinar handles this on the schedule step of an evergreen webinar. The team switches on **On Demand**, and the registration page offers an instant start beside any other options. They change **Instant replay text** to wording such as \"Start the explainer now\". A **Recurring Schedule** can stay on for managers who prefer to book a time."},"8703":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#approach","content":"The screenshot under Set it up shows the **Instant replay text** field, which reads *Watch instant replay* until you change it. How other platforms offer viewing straight after registration is covered in How On Demand compares, below."},"8704":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#set-up-new","content":"On **My Webinars**, click **Create a Webinar**, then **Create Manually**."},"8705":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#set-up-new","content":"Name the webinar, choose **Evergreen Webinar**, and click **Continue to Schedule**."},"8706":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#set-up-new","content":"Switch on **On Demand**."},"8707":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#set-up-new","content":"In **Instant replay text**, keep *Watch instant replay* or type your own wording."},"8708":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#set-up-new","content":"Set any other options you want alongside it: **Just-in-time Registration**, **Recurring Schedule**, **Availability** and **Schedule Preferences**."},"8709":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#set-up-new","content":"Click **Continue to Pricing** and complete the remaining steps."},"8710":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#set-up-new","content":"*1 Just-in-time Registration · 2 On Demand · 3 Recurring Schedule · 4 Availability · 5 Schedule Preferences.*"},"8711":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#set-up-new","content":"Pricing, video selection and templates are covered in Create an evergreen webinar."},"8712":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#set-up-existing","content":"On the webinar's **Overview** tab, the options menu on the **Scheduling Options** panel changes the schedule for the whole webinar. The same panel shows the frequency, start date, timezone and the preference you chose."},"8713":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#settings","content":"| Setting       | What it controls                                     |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **On Demand** | Whether registrants can start watching straight away |","table":"table-3"},"8714":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#settings","content":"| Setting                 | What it controls                                                               |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Instant replay text** | The wording on the button registrants click; *Watch instant replay* by default |","table":"table-3"},"8715":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#settings","content":"| Setting                  | What it controls                                                                                           |\n| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Schedule Preferences** | The choices registrants see; with just-in-time also on, it reads **Display Just-in-time & Instant-replay** |","table":"table-3"},"8716":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#button-wording","content":"The default *Watch instant replay* works, but the word \"replay\" can suggest a recording of something people missed. If your page sells the webinar as fresh content, wording that says what happens next, such as starting the training now, can read more naturally. Whatever you choose, keep it short enough to fit a button."},"8717":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#when-to-use","content":"The deciding question is whether the webinar is valued for its content or for the occasion."},"8718":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#when-to-use","content":"| Use On Demand when                                  | Leave it off when                                                        |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| The content matters more than the sense of an event | You want the scheduled session to feel like something people turn up for |","table":"table-4"},"8719":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#when-to-use","content":"With On Demand off, registrants still have just-in-time or recurring sessions if you've enabled them."},"8720":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#with-just-in-time","content":"Just-in-time offers a session a few minutes away, in each attendee's local time. With both on, registrants choose between watching now and joining a session shortly. Just-in-time webinars covers the interval and timezone rules."},"8721":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#with-recurring","content":"A daily or weekly schedule can run alongside On Demand for registrants who want to book a time. Recurring sessions run in the webinar's timezone."},"8722":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#with-replay-page","content":"The **Replay** tab controls a separate page for people who missed a session, with availability options of **Always Available**, **Expire after days** or **Specific date**, and an **Experience** of **Webinar Replica** or **Custom Build**. Those settings belong to the replay page, not to On Demand."},"8723":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#with-engagement","content":"Chat, Q&A, polls, offers, emails and analytics work on evergreen webinars as they do everywhere else. Where viewers watch at different times, Chat Simulation on the **Engagement** tab keeps the chat from looking empty."},"8724":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#with-notifications","content":"Confirmation, reminder and follow-up emails are set on the **Notifications** tab. Replay emails are set up there too, not on the **Replay** tab. The confirmation email is the first one registrants receive."},"8725":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#with-plan-usage","content":"People watching evergreen sessions count towards the **Automated attendees** meter on the **Plan** tab."},"8726":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the setting is used."},"8727":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#customer-success","content":"A customer success team runs its product onboarding as an evergreen webinar with On Demand on. New customers register and start the walkthrough immediately, and the button reads *Start onboarding* instead of the default."},"8728":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#saas-teams","content":"A product team offers a recorded feature walkthrough with On Demand alongside just-in-time. Evaluators in a hurry watch straight away; others join a session a few minutes later."},"8729":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#course-creators","content":"A creator offers a free training lesson on demand, so new subscribers can start it the moment they sign up. On a separate sales webinar, the creator leaves On Demand off so the session feels like an event people turn up for. This is one pattern in selling online courses with webinars."},"8730":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#coaches","content":"A consultant puts an explainer webinar on demand for prospects to watch before a first call, so the call can start from where the webinar left off."},"8731":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare","content":"EasyWebinar's On Demand puts a watch-now button on the same registration page as just-in-time sessions and set daily or weekly times. You also choose the button's wording with **Instant replay text**, and you run live webinars in the same product. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"8732":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare","content":"Instant viewing, from each platform's public documentation:"},"8733":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare","content":"| Platform        | Watch straight after registering | Instant viewing beside set daily or weekly times | Instant viewing beside just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                              | Yes                                              | Yes                                          | Yes                               |","table":"table-5"},"8734":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare","content":"| Platform     | Watch straight after registering | Instant viewing beside set daily or weekly times | Instant viewing beside just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Yes (detail)                     | Yes (detail)                                     | Yes (detail)                                 | Pre-recorded only                 |","table":"table-5"},"8735":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Watch straight after registering | Instant viewing beside set daily or weekly times | Instant viewing beside just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product    |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Yes (detail)                     | Yes                                              | Yes (detail)                                 | Partly (separate WebinarJam product) |","table":"table-5"},"8736":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare","content":"| Platform  | Watch straight after registering | Instant viewing beside set daily or weekly times | Instant viewing beside just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (detail)                     | Yes (detail)                                     | Not in docs                                  | Yes (detail)                      |","table":"table-5"},"8737":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare","content":"| Platform      | Watch straight after registering | Instant viewing beside set daily or weekly times | Instant viewing beside just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Yes                              | Partly (no sessions after on-demand registrants) | Not in docs                                  | Yes                               |","table":"table-5"},"8738":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare","content":"| Platform           | Watch straight after registering  | Instant viewing beside set daily or weekly times | Instant viewing beside just-in-time sessions | Live webinars in the same product        |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **StealthSeminar** | Yes (Dedicated Replay event type) | Partly (replay is yesterday's session)           | Partly (replay is yesterday's session)       | Partly (streamed from YouTube or Twitch) |","table":"table-5"},"8739":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"8740":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare-stronger","content":"**Instant viewing that keeps your schedule.** EasyWebinar runs **On Demand** beside a daily or weekly **Recurring Schedule** on one webinar. Livestorm's help centre says that once an on-demand registrant exists, you can't add more sessions. Compare EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"8741":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare-stronger","content":"**Now or in a few minutes.** EasyWebinar offers **On Demand** and **Just-in-time Registration** on the same registration page. Demio documents on-demand sessions for automated events, with no just-in-time option. Compare EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"8742":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare-stronger","content":"**The full webinar, inside the same event.** EasyWebinar's **On Demand** plays the webinar's own recording from the evergreen schedule. StealthSeminar's in-event choice, Watch Yesterday's Replay, plays the previous session, and fully on-demand viewing is its own event type. Compare EasyWebinar vs StealthSeminar."},"8743":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare-stronger","content":"**Live sessions in the same account.** EasyWebinar runs live, simulive and evergreen webinars, with **On Demand** on the evergreen ones. eWebinar describes its webinars as running without anyone having to be there live. Compare EasyWebinar vs eWebinar."},"8744":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"8745":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#limits","content":"**Evergreen only.** On Demand is set on the evergreen schedule step. Live and simulive webinars don't have it."},"8746":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#limits","content":"**It isn't the replay page.** Replay availability, deadlines, redirects and the replay page's look are set on the **Replay** tab for the replay page."},"8747":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#limits","content":"**The recording is the webinar's.** An evergreen webinar plays the recording chosen on its video step; change it from the **Webinar Video** panel on the **Content** tab."},"8748":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#limits","content":"**The type is fixed.** To offer On Demand for a live or simulive webinar, clone it as Evergreen."},"8749":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#faq-what-it-does","content":"It lets someone watch immediately, with no session to wait for."},"8750":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#faq-instant-replay","content":"Yes. They're two names for the same evergreen setting."},"8751":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#faq-vs-replay","content":"A replay is the recording of a past session, on the **Replay** tab. Instant replay, or On Demand, lets someone watch an evergreen webinar straight away without waiting for a session."},"8752":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#faq-button-text","content":"Yes. Edit **Instant replay text** on the schedule step. It reads *Watch instant replay* by default."},"8753":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#faq-together","content":"Yes. Turn on **Just-in-time Registration**, **Recurring Schedule** or both alongside it, and the registration page offers each as a choice."},"8754":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#faq-where","content":"On the schedule step when you set up an evergreen webinar, not on the **Replay** tab."},"8755":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#faq-other-types","content":"No. It's an evergreen setting. Clone the webinar as **Evergreen** to use it."},"8756":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#faq-catch-up","content":"No. Use the replay page on the **Replay** tab for that."},"8757":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#faq-always-on","content":"Not necessarily. Turn it on when the content matters more than the event feeling, and leave it off when you want a scheduled session people turn up for."},"8758":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#related","content":"Just-in-time webinars: the option for registrants happy to wait a few minutes for a session."},"8759":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#related","content":"Create an evergreen webinar: the schedule step where On Demand is switched on."},"8760":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#related","content":"Replay pages: the separate page for people who missed a session."},"8761":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/on-demand#related","content":"Chat simulation: a chat for registrants who start watching at different times."},"8762":{"id":"/produ