gn a registrant came from?"},"8799":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-utm-empty","content":"Why is my Source & UTM filter empty?"},"8800":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-phone-crm","content":"Can I send the phone number to my CRM?"},"8801":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-no-sms","content":"Why can't I send text reminders?"},"8802":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-export","content":"Can I export what people entered?"},"8803":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-publish","content":"Do I need to publish after changing the form?"},"8804":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#related","content":"Related"},"8805":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","content":"An EasyWebinar registration form starts with two required fields, **Full name** and **Email**. Select the form block in the page builder and you can add a **Phone** field, add your own custom fields, turn on a **GDPR Compliance** consent checkbox, and turn on **UTM Params** so each registration records the campaign that brought it in. What you collect then shows up in the **People** view and can be mapped into a connected CRM."},"8806":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                   |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you set it** | Webinar → **Content** → **Edit** on **Registration Page** → select the form block |","table":"table-0"},"8807":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                            |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Default fields** | **Full name** and **Email**, both required |","table":"table-0"},"8808":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                         |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Extra fields** | A **Phone** field, and your own custom fields with **Add Custom Field** |","table":"table-0"},"8809":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                                                      |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Consent** | **GDPR Compliance** adds a consent checkbox you word yourself and can make mandatory |","table":"table-0"},"8810":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                              |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Campaign capture** | **UTM Params** records the campaign behind each registration |","table":"table-0"},"8811":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|            |                                   |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Button** | The submit button can be restyled |","table":"table-0"},"8812":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where the data shows** | **People** view (including the **Phone** column and the **Source & UTM** filter), **Export**, and CRM custom-field mapping |","table":"table-0"},"8813":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                            |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar types** | Live, simulive and evergreen; the form block is on every registration page |","table":"table-0"},"8814":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"The registration form is a block on the registration page, like the countdown or a heading. Its settings decide what a person is asked when they sign up. Out of the box it asks for a name and an email address, both required."},"8815":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"The form block's settings add four things on top of that:"},"8816":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"| Option    | What it adds         |\n| --------- | -------------------- |\n| **Phone** | A phone number field |","table":"table-1"},"8817":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"| Option            | What it adds                                     |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Custom fields** | Your own questions, for anything you need to ask |","table":"table-1"},"8818":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"| Option              | What it adds                                                                          |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **GDPR Compliance** | A consent checkbox, with wording you write and an option to make ticking it mandatory |","table":"table-1"},"8819":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"| Option         | What it adds                                                                        |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **UTM Params** | Campaign capture: each registration records which tagged link brought the person in |","table":"table-1"},"8820":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"You can also restyle the form's submit button from the same place."},"8821":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-its-for","content":"Custom fields let the registration form collect what your follow-up actually needs. That might be a phone number for text reminders or a question about who is attending. It might also be consent, or the campaign each person came from."},"8822":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It makes text reminders possible.** SMS and WhatsApp reminders (both in Beta) go to the number someone gave you, so they depend on the **Phone** field."},"8823":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It tells you who registered, not just how many.** A custom question gives you context before the session starts."},"8824":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It puts consent on the form.** **GDPR Compliance** adds the checkbox with your own wording, so you don't need a separate consent step."},"8825":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It shows which campaign worked.** With **UTM Params** on, you can filter registrants by **Source & UTM** in the People view."},"8826":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It feeds your CRM.** The phone number can be mapped into a CRM field of your choice."},"8827":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#without-it","content":"With only name and email, you know how many people registered but little else. You can't text anyone, and you can't tell which ad, email or post sent them. The registration count goes up, and the reason why is lost."},"8828":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#why-buyers-care","content":"For teams that run webinars to generate leads or sell, the registration form is where first-party data starts. It matters most to whoever follows up, in the first days after a session. That's when a role, a phone number or a campaign tag decides who hears from you first."},"8829":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A five-person cybersecurity consultancy runs a quarterly live briefing on ransomware readiness for IT managers at mid-sized firms. It wants each registrant's role and company size, so its two consultants follow up with the right people. It also needs consent before any marketing email goes out."},"8830":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#approach","content":"A common route is to collect the extra details in a separate form tool, then match those answers to the webinar's registrant list by hand. That can work for a small list. But the matching probably eats an afternoon each quarter, and consent records can end up split across two systems."},"8831":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#approach","content":"The person signing up is the person answering the questions. So it makes sense to ask everything in one form, at the moment they register. Then the answers, the consent and the campaign all stay on the same record."},"8832":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#approach","content":"EasyWebinar puts those options on the registration form block itself. EasyWebinar lets you add custom fields and a **Phone** field, turn on **GDPR Compliance** with your own wording, and turn on **UTM Params**. What people enter then shows up in the **People** view, ready to filter and export."},"8833":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#approach","content":"Select the form block in the page builder and look at the settings panel. **GDPR Compliance** and **UTM Params** sit there alongside the fields themselves. How that setup sits against other platforms is covered in How custom fields compare, below."},"8834":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Open your webinar and click the **Content** tab."},"8835":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Click **Edit** on the **Registration Page** card. The page opens in the builder."},"8836":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Click the form block on the canvas. An orange toolbar appears above it, and the settings panel on the right fills with the form's options across **Settings** and **Advanced** tabs."},"8837":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Add the **Phone** field if you'll want to text people or keep their number."},"8838":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Click **Add Custom Field** for each extra question you want to ask."},"8839":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Turn on **GDPR Compliance** if you ask for marketing consent. Write the consent wording, and choose whether ticking it is mandatory."},"8840":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Turn on **UTM Params** to record the campaign behind each registration."},"8841":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Restyle the submit button if it needs to match your page."},"8842":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Use the device toggle to check the form on mobile, then **Preview**, **Save** and **Publish**."},"8843":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"*The default form, with **Full name** and **Email**, as it appears when a new webinar opens in the builder.*"},"8844":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Form changes reach visitors only once the page is published. **Save** keeps a draft; **Publish** makes it public."},"8845":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"**UTM Params** is a switch on the form block. Once it's on, each registration records the campaign that brought it in."},"8846":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"Turn on **UTM Params** on the form block and publish the page."},"8847":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"Tag the links you share as you normally would, in ads, emails and posts."},"8848":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"Open **People** in the sidebar, click **Add Filter**, and choose **Source & UTM** to see which campaign each registrant came from."},"8849":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"*1 Categories · 2 Refinements · 3 Apply Filter.*"},"8850":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"Because People also shows who attended, this gives you campaign attribution against real attendance, not just clicks. If you also use ad pixels, they tell your ad platform what happened; UTM capture shows the same story inside EasyWebinar."},"8851":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#gdpr-consent","content":"Turning on **GDPR Compliance** on the form block adds a consent checkbox to your form."},"8852":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#gdpr-consent","content":"**Write the wording yourself.** Say what the person is agreeing to, in your own words."},"8853":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#gdpr-consent","content":"**Make it mandatory if you need to.** You can require the box to be ticked before someone can register."},"8854":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#gdpr-consent","content":"The checkbox is a form option. What it asks for, and how you use the data afterwards, is yours to decide."},"8855":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"**People** in the sidebar lists every registrant and attendee across all your webinars, one row per person per webinar. Columns include **Name** and email, **Phone** (if you collected it), the webinar and its type, the session, and when they registered. Use **Columns** to choose what appears."},"8856":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"| To find                  | Use                                                               |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Who came from a campaign | **Add Filter** → **Source & UTM** (needs UTM capture on the form) |","table":"table-2"},"8857":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"| To find                     | Use                          |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Registrants for one webinar | **Add Filter** → **Webinar** |","table":"table-2"},"8858":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"| To find                       | Use                           |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| A list to work with elsewhere | Filter first, then **Export** |","table":"table-2"},"8859":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"**Export** downloads the filtered list."},"8860":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"A connected CRM or email tool has a **Custom fields** tab that sends webinar details into your CRM's own fields. The data it lists is:"},"8861":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data      | What it's for                        |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Webinar Title** | Which webinar this contact came from |","table":"table-3"},"8862":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data          | What it's for                     |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar Join Link** | The attendee's personal join link |","table":"table-3"},"8863":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data                | What it's for       |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Webinar Join Short Link** | A shortened version |","table":"table-3"},"8864":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data            | What it's for     |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------- |\n| **Webinar Replay Link** | Their replay link |","table":"table-3"},"8865":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data                  | What it's for       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Webinar Replay Short Link** | A shortened version |","table":"table-3"},"8866":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data     | What it's for             |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Phone Number** | Their phone, if collected |","table":"table-3"},"8867":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"Pick the matching CRM field beside each item. The field must already exist in your CRM; after creating one there, click **Refresh**. Integrations are set per webinar."},"8868":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-text-reminders","content":"SMS and WhatsApp notifications, both in Beta, are set on the **Notifications** tab and go to the phone number from your registration form. Without the **Phone** field on the form, there's nobody to message. Reminder emails cover the email side."},"8869":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#with-page-builder","content":"The form is one block on the registration page. Everything else on the page, from the template to the countdown and page-wide settings, is covered in Registration page builder."},"8870":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#with-tracking","content":"UTM capture and ad pixels answer different questions. Pixels go in **Tracking Code** on the webinar's **Settings** tab and report to your ad platform. **UTM Params** keeps the campaign with the registrant inside EasyWebinar."},"8871":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#with-analytics","content":"The webinar's **Analytics** tab counts visitors and registrations. The People view's **Source & UTM** filter shows which campaign produced attendees, not just registrations."},"8872":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#with-cloning","content":"Cloning a webinar can copy its registration pages, so a form you've set up once can carry into the copy."},"8873":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the form options fit different kinds of webinar."},"8874":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#course-creators","content":"A course creator adds a custom field asking for the student's current level, so the pitch at the end can speak to beginners and advanced students differently. **UTM Params** shows which posts and emails filled the session."},"8875":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team runs paid ads to a webinar. It turns on **UTM Params**, tags each ad, and filters **People** by **Source & UTM** after the session to compare campaigns by who actually attended. The phone number is mapped into the CRM so sales has it."},"8876":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#coaches","content":"A coach adds the **Phone** field so the final reminder can go by text (Beta), and turns on **GDPR Compliance** with a mandatory checkbox agreeing to follow-up emails."},"8877":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#agencies","content":"An agency running webinars for clients sets the consent wording to each client's own policy and exports the filtered registrant list for the client after each session."},"8878":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#compare","content":"EasyWebinar keeps your own questions, a consent checkbox and campaign capture together on one form block. Its **Phone** field also feeds SMS reminders (Beta), sent from an EasyWebinar number. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"8879":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#compare","content":"Registration form features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"8880":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#compare","content":"| Platform        | Your own questions on the form | Consent checkbox on the form | Campaign (UTM) capture per registrant | SMS reminders to the form's phone number (Beta) |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                            | Yes                          | Yes                                   | Yes                                             |","table":"table-4"},"8881":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#compare","content":"| Platform  | Your own questions on the form | Consent checkbox on the form            | Campaign (UTM) capture per registrant | SMS reminders to the form's phone number (Beta) |\n| --------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (detail)                   | Partly (account setting adds a default) | Yes (detail)                          | Partly (through a Zapier workaround)            |","table":"table-4"},"8882":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#compare","content":"| Platform       | Your own questions on the form | Consent checkbox on the form   | Campaign (UTM) capture per registrant | SMS reminders to the form's phone number (Beta) |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam** | Yes (detail)                   | Yes (terms agreement checkbox) | Yes (detail)                          | Partly (needs your own Twilio account)          |","table":"table-4"},"8883":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#compare","content":"| Platform     | Your own questions on the form | Consent checkbox on the form | Campaign (UTM) capture per registrant | SMS reminders to the form's phone number (Beta) |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Yes (detail)                   | Yes (detail)                 | Partly (captured through widgets)     | Partly (through a Twilio integration)           |","table":"table-4"},"8884":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#compare","content":"| Platform      | Your own questions on the form | Consent checkbox on the form | Campaign (UTM) capture per registrant | SMS reminders to the form's phone number (Beta) |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Yes (detail)                   | Yes (custom consents)        | Yes (detail)                          | Not in docs                                     |","table":"table-4"},"8885":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#compare","content":"| Platform           | Your own questions on the form | Consent checkbox on the form       | Campaign (UTM) capture per registrant | SMS reminders to the form's phone number (Beta) |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **StealthSeminar** | Yes (detail)                   | Partly (one setting for all forms) | Yes (detail)                          | Yes (detail)                                    |","table":"table-4"},"8886":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fi