eta) come from an EasyWebinar number, while WebinarJam asks you to connect your own Twilio account. Read EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam."},"8891":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"8892":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#limits","content":"**Full name and Email come first, both required.** Phone, custom fields, consent and UTM capture are options you add."},"8893":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#limits","content":"**UTM filtering needs UTM capture.** The **Source & UTM** filter depends on **UTM Params** being on in your registration form."},"8894":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#limits","content":"**CRM fields must exist first.** Create the field in your CRM, then click **Refresh** before mapping."},"8895":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#limits","content":"**Text reminders depend on the Phone field.** SMS and WhatsApp are in Beta."},"8896":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/