aq-template-per-page","content":"Can I use a different template on each page?"},"9081":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-skip-template","content":"Do I have to pick a template when I create the webinar?"},"9082":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-blank-page","content":"How do I start from a blank page?"},"9083":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-mobile","content":"How do I see what the page looks like on a phone?"},"9084":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-pixels","content":"Can I add my Facebook Pixel or Google Analytics?"},"9085":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-open-graph","content":"Can I control how the page looks when shared?"},"9086":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-ai-pages","content":"Can AI write my registration page?"},"9087":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-translate","content":"Will EasyWebinar translate my page?"},"9088":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-own-domain","content":"Can my registration page run on my own domain?"},"9089":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#related","content":"Related"},"9090":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","content":"The registration page is the page people see before they sign up, and the link you promote. EasyWebinar builds it in a drag-and-drop page builder that already carries your webinar's date, time and timezone, with a countdown and a name-and-email form in place. You choose a template, edit blocks on a canvas, check the mobile layout, and click **Publish** to make the page public. The same builder edits the webinar's other four pages."},"9091":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                                                      |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you edit it** | Webinar → **Content** → **Edit** on **Registration Page**. A new webinar also opens straight into it |","table":"table-0"},"9092":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                       |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Starting point** | A template chosen at creation, or **Build Your Own** for a blank page |","table":"table-0"},"9093":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                                                                                                                  |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Template categories** | **All Templates**, **Agency**, **Coach**, **Education**, **Health & Wellness**, **Lead Magnet**, **Marketing**, **My Templates** |","table":"table-0"},"9094":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                                                                               |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Already on the page** | The webinar date, time and timezone, a countdown, and a form with **Full name** and **Email** |","table":"table-0"},"9095":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#at-a-glance","content":"|                        |                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Page-wide settings** | **Page Background**, **Typography**, **Tracking Code**, **SEO Options**, **Social Sharing (Open Graph)**, **Custom CSS** |","table":"table-0"},"9096":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Device check** | A device toggle switches the canvas between desktop and mobile |","table":"table-0"},"9097":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                           |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Going public** | **Save** keeps a draft; **Publish** makes the page public |","table":"table-0"},"9098":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                                                               |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **AI option** | **Create with AI** writes the registration, thank-you and waiting-area pages from your script |","table":"table-0"},"9099":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#what-it-is","content":"Every webinar has five pages that its audience moves through: **Registration Page**, **Thank you Page**, **Waiting Area**, **Webinar Page** and **Replay Page**. All five open in the same builder, and all five already know when your webinar runs."},"9100":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#what-it-is","content":"The registration page matters most because it carries your signups. It's built from **blocks**, such as the date and countdown block and the form block, plus whatever else the template includes. You select a block on the canvas to change it, add new blocks underneath, and set page-wide options such as fonts, background and tracking from the top bar."},"9101":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#what-it-is","content":"Each page has a working default, so you don't have to design any of them. If you only have time for two, make them the registration page and the replay page."},"9102":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#what-its-for","content":"The registration page turns interest into a registrant. It says what the webinar is and when it runs, then asks for the details you need. After that, it hands each person on to the thank-you page."},"9103":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#how-it-helps","content":"**It starts filled in.** The schedule and countdown are applied when the webinar is created, so the page works before you touch it."},"9104":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#how-it-helps","content":"**You edit what you see.** Changes happen on the canvas, with a settings panel for the block you select."},"9105":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#how-it-helps","content":"**You can check the phone layout.** The device toggle shows the mobile version without leaving the builder."},"9106":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#how-it-helps","content":"**It can carry your tracking.** Pixels and analytics scripts go on the page from the builder's settings."},"9107":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#how-it-helps","content":"**Drafts stay private.** **Save** keeps your work, and visitors see nothing new until you **Publish**."},"9108":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#without-it","content":"Without a registration page, people have nowhere to sign up. Your posts and emails create interest, but that interest never becomes a name on your list. You also lose the first number in your funnel: how many people saw the invitation and said yes."},"9109":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#why-buyers-care","content":"The registration page decides how much of your promotion becomes an audience. It matters most to whoever pays for the traffic, in the weeks before a session. That's when a page that matches your brand and shows which campaign drove each signup earns its keep."},"9110":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A wedding photography educator runs a free live workshop on posing couples each month, with one assistant helping her. Each workshop feeds a small paid mentoring group, and her goal is about 150 signups from Instagram and her email list."},"9111":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#approach","content":"A common route is to design the page in a separate landing page tool, then connect its form to the webinar platform. Each month, someone retypes the new date on the page. That can work. But each handoff is a place where a form breaks or an old date slips out. The cost likely shows up only as fewer signups."},"9112":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#approach","content":"The page and the webinar describe the same event. So it makes sense for the page to read the schedule from the webinar, not from a copy someone keeps in step. When the date lives in one place, the page and the session can't disagree."},"9113":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#approach","content":"EasyWebinar builds the registration page inside the webinar itself. EasyWebinar fills in the date, time, timezone and a countdown when the webinar is created. It also puts a name and email form in place. EasyWebinar keeps templates you've saved under **My Templates**, so each month's workshop can start from her own styled design."},"9114":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#approach","content":"Open the template step of the create flow. Next to **Education**, **Coach** and the other categories, the filter row includes **My Templates**. How that setup sits against other platforms is covered in How the registration page builder compares, below."},"9115":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#choose-a-template","content":"You pick the registration page's look on **Step 4 of 4 — Registration Template** when you create a webinar manually."},"9116":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#choose-a-template","content":"*1 Category filters · 2 Template cards · 3 The create button.*"},"9117":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#choose-a-template","content":"Filter by category: **All Templates**, **Agency**, **Coach**, **Education**, **Health & Wellness**, **Lead Magnet** or **Marketing**. **My Templates** holds templates you've saved yourself."},"9118":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#choose-a-template","content":"Click a template. **Default Register Page** is the simplest one-column option; **Build Your Own** starts from a blank page."},"9119":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#choose-a-template","content":"Click **Create Webinar**."},"9120":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#choose-a-template","content":"You can skip this step: until you select a template, the button reads **Skip & Create Webinar**, and you can choose a template later."},"9121":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#choose-a-template","content":"On a paid webinar, the template you pick includes the price automatically."},"9122":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#change-template","content":"Inside the builder, **Templates** in the top bar swaps the design for a different one. Templates are chosen per page, so each of the five pages can use a different one. Changing a template replaces that page's layout, so settle on one before you do detailed editing."},"9123":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#open-the-builder","content":"When you create a webinar, it opens straight into the registration page builder with your schedule applied and a live countdown to the session. To come back later:"},"9124":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#open-the-builder","content":"Open your webinar and click the **Content** tab."},"9125":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#open-the-builder","content":"Click **Edit** on the **Registration Page** card."},"9126":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#open-the-builder","content":"*1 Registration Page · 2 Thank you Page · 3 Waiting Area · 4 Webinar Page · 5 Replay Page.*"},"9127":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#builder-controls","content":"|     | Control           | What it does                                             |\n| --- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Page switcher** | Moves between all five pages without leaving the builder |","table":"table-1"},"9128":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#builder-controls","content":"|     | Control       | What it does                              |\n| --- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Templates** | Swaps the design for a different template |","table":"table-1"},"9129":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#builder-controls","content":"|     | Control           | What it does                                   |\n| --- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Device toggle** | Switches the canvas between desktop and mobile |","table":"table-1"},"9130":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#builder-controls","content":"|     | Control                | What it does                                                   |\n| --- | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Settings · Preview** | Settings for the whole page; **Preview** opens it in a new tab |","table":"table-1"},"9131":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#builder-controls","content":"|     | Control            | What it does                                        |\n| --- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Save · Publish** | **Save** keeps a draft, **Publish** makes it public |","table":"table-1"},"9132":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#builder-controls","content":"|     | Control           | What it does                                    |\n| --- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 6   | **Block toolbar** | Move up, move down, settings, duplicate, delete |","table":"table-1"},"9133":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#builder-controls","content":"|     | Control            | What it does                               |\n| --- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 7   | **Settings panel** | Everything about the block you've selected |","table":"table-1"},"9134":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#edit-blocks","content":"Click any block on the canvas. An orange toolbar appears above it, and the right-hand panel fills with that block's settings."},"9135":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#edit-blocks","content":"Change what you need across the panel's **Settings** and **Advanced** tabs."},"9136":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#edit-blocks","content":"Use the toolbar to move the block up or down, duplicate it or delete it."},"9137":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#edit-blocks","content":"To add a block, use the orange **+** below an existing block. The new one goes underneath."},"9138":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#countdown-block","content":"New registration pages show the date, time and timezone with a countdown to the session. Selecting that block gives you its visibility (including a **Desktop Only** option), its margins and width, and the fonts, sizes and alignment for the date, time and timezone."},"9139":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#form-block","content":"The form starts with **Full name** and **Email**, both required. Selecting the form block lets you add a **Phone** field and your own custom fields, turn on **GDPR Compliance** and **UTM Params**, and restyle the submit button. Each of these is covered under Custom fields, consent and UTM capture below."},"9140":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#page-settings","content":"**Settings** in the builder's top bar applies to the whole page rather than one block."},"9141":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#page-settings","content":"| Setting             | What it covers                                        |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Page Background** | Background colour or image, and how it fills the page |","table":"table-2"},"9142":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#page-settings","content":"| Setting        | What it covers           |\n| -------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **Typography** | The page's default fonts |","table":"table-2"},"9143":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#page-settings","content":"| Setting           | What it covers                                                    |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Tracking Code** | Scripts you want running on the page, like analytics or ad pixels |","table":"table-2"},"9144":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#page-settings","content":"| Setting         | What it covers                                |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **SEO Options** | The title and description search engines show |","table":"table-2"},"9145":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#page-settings","content":"| Setting                         | What it covers                                  |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Social Sharing (Open Graph)** | How the page looks when someone shares the link |","table":"table-2"},"9146":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#page-settings","content":"| Setting        | What it covers                                          |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Custom CSS** | Your own styling, for anything the controls don't reach |","table":"table-2"},"9147":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#page-settings","content":"The tracking, SEO, social and CSS areas also appear on the webinar's **Settings** tab, where they cover every page at once. Set them there to cover the whole webinar, or here for one page."},"9148":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#publish","content":"Use the device toggle to check the mobile layout. Most of your registrations will come from phones."},"9149":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#publish","content":"Click **Preview** to open the real page in a new tab."},"9150":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#publish","content":"Click **Save** to keep your work as a draft."},"9151":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#publish","content":"Click **Publish** to make it public."},"9152":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#publish","content":"Your registration link doesn't work until the page is published. Creating the webinar doesn't make it public either. Each of the five pages has its own **Publish** button."},"9153":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#ai-written-pages","content":"**Create with AI** can build your pages as part of a full webinar. After it writes the script, the pages step asks you to choose **AI picks for you**, which auto-selects a template, or **Choose manually** to browse."},"9154":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#ai-written-pages","content":"The AI then writes your registration page, thank-you page and waiting area, using the script as source material: headline, what you'll learn, instructor bio and the rest. The pages open in an editor with **Edit**, **Preview**, **SEO** and **Scripts** tabs, and a desktop and mobile view. Treat the output as a strong first draft; afterwards, pages open in the normal builder."},"9155":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#ai-written-pages","content":"|                               |                                      |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Credits for landing pages** | 10, out of about 23 for a full build |","table":"table-3"},"9156":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#ai-written-pages","content":"|                          |                                                               |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Generate only pages?** | Possible: turn off the chips you don't want before generating |","table":"table-3"},"9157":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#ai-written-pages","content":"|                       |                                                              |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Before publishing** | Read the copy, especially around pricing and what's included |","table":"table-3"},"9158":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#paid-registration-pages","content":"When you choose **Paid** at creation, the registration page shows the price above the form. The price option (pricing title, description and price) is selected by default, and **Register Now** takes the attendee to checkout instead of registering them straight away."},"9159":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#paid-registration-pages","content":"*1 Price option · 2 Register Now.*"},"9160":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#paid-registration-pages","content":"The price block is added only when **Paid** is chosen at creation. A free webinar converted to paid afterwards keeps the free form, so choose **Paid** at creation if you want to charge."},"9161":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#with-custom-fields","content":"The form block is where you collect more than name and email."},"9162":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#with-embeds","content":"The **Registration Widget** on the Content tab gives you embed code to put the form on your own page instead of sending people to the EasyWebinar page."},"9163":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#with-share-links","content":"The **Registration Page Link** in the Share dialog is the published page's address, and the **Registration Page** button on the webinar header opens the live page."},"9164":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#with-tracking","content":"On the webinar's **Settings → Tracking Code** sub-tab, you pick a page and paste code into **Header Code**, **Body Code** or **Footer Code**. Tracking code is set per page. The registration page tells your ad platform who was interested; the thank-you page, which only loads after someone registers, is the reliable conversion signal."},"9165":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#with-domain","content":"Your registration page lives on your subdomain, ending in `.easywebinar.live`, set in your profile. The **C-Name** add-on, with a CNAME record at your DNS provider, puts the pages on your own domain. The **White Label** add-on removes EasyWebinar branding. Changing your subdomain changes your existing links, so set it before you promote anything."},"9166":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#with-language","content":"**Webinar Language**, **Date Display Language**, **Date Format** and **Time Format** on the webinar's **Settings** tab control how the webinar reads to attendees. Set them before you promote, so the registration page and emails match. EasyWebinar doesn't translate your own copy; the page says whatever you wrote."},"9167":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#with-analytics","content":"On the **Analytics** tab, **Visitors** counts unique IPs on your landing page and **Registered** counts unique sign-ups. A low **Visitors to Registered** rate points at the page itself: the headline, the form, the promise."},"9168":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#with-cloning","content":"**Clone Webinar** can copy registration pages into a new webinar. To try a different registration page on a webinar that's already running, clone it and change the copy."},"9169":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the builder fits different kinds of webinar."},"9170":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#course-creators","content":"A course creator starts from an **Education** template and saves their styled version to **My Templates**, so every launch looks consistent. They add a field asking for the student's current level and turn on UTM capture to see which posts drive signups."},"9171":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#agencies","content":"An agency builds registration pages for several clients. It works from the **Agency** or **Marketing** templates, applies each client's fonts and background in **Settings**, and pastes the client's pixel into **Tracking Code** so the client's ad account sees the traffic."},"9172":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#saas-teams","content":"A product team runs a recurring demo webinar. It lets **Create with AI** draft the registration page from the demo script, edits the headline and bio, and checks the page on mobile before publishing."},"9173":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#small-businesses","content":"A solo operator picks **Default Register Page**, changes the headline and background, and publishes. Every page has a working default, so the thank-you and replay pages can wait."},"9174":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"EasyWebinar's builder starts you from a ready-made template, can have AI write the page copy from your script, and puts a countdown on the registration page itself. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"9175":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"Registration page features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"9176":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"| Platform        | Ready-made page templates | AI writes the page copy | Countdown on the registration page |\n| --------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                       | Yes                     | Yes                                |","table":"table-4"},"9177":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"| Platform  | Ready-made page templates                | AI writes the page copy | Countdown on the registration page |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (Accent, Gradient, Background Image) | Not in docs             | Yes (top of the form)              |","table":"table-4"},"9178":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"| Platform       | Ready-made page templates | AI writes the page copy | Countdown on the registration page    |\n| -------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam** | Yes                       | Not in docs             | Partly (on a separate countdown page) |","table":"table-4"},"9179":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"| Platform     | Ready-made page templates | AI writes the page copy | Countdown on the registration page |\n| ------------ | ------------------------- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **eWebinar** | Yes (detail)              | Yes (detail)            | Partly (widgets on your own page)  |","table":"table-4"},"9180":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"| Platform      | Ready-made page templates           | AI writes the page copy | Countdown on the registration page      |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Partly (Detailed and Light layouts) | Not in docs             | Partly (waiting page, before the event) |","table":"table-4"},"9181":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"| Platform           | Ready-made page templates | AI writes the page copy | Countdown on the registration page |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **StealthSeminar** | Yes (detail)              | Not in docs             | Partly (as an embeddable widget)   |","table":"table-4"},"9182":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"| Platform       | Ready-made page templates | AI writes the page copy | Countdown on the registration page |\n| -------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarKit** | Yes (detail)              | Yes (detail)            | Partly (thank-you page embeds)     |","table":"table-4"},"9183":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"9184":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare-stronger","content":"**The countdown sits on the page you promote.** EasyWebinar adds it to every new registration page, while WebinarJam shows its start countdown on a separate holding page. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam."},"9185":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare-stronger","content":"**AI drafts the whole set of pages.** **Create with AI** writes the registration, thank-you and waiting-area pages from your script, while Demio's public docs describe no AI page writing. Compare EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"9186":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare-stronger","content":"**Templates come sorted by business type.** EasyWebinar sorts templates by business type, while Livestorm applies one set of design settings to its Detailed and Light pages. More in EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"9187":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare-stronger","content":"**The countdown is native, not a widget.** EasyWebinar builds it into the page, while eWebinar delivers its countdown through widgets on your own landing page. Read EasyWebinar vs eWebinar."},"9188":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"9189":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#limits","content":"**Publishing is per page.** Each of the five pages has its own **Publish** button, and the registration link only works once its page is published."},"9190":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#limits","content":"**Templates are per page, and switching replaces the layout.** Choose before detailed editing."},"9191":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#limits","content":"**Page settings in the builder apply to one page.** The same areas on the webinar's **Settings** tab cover every page, and nothing there applies until you click **Save Changes**."},"9192":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#limits","content":"**The price block is added at creation.** Converting a free webinar to paid later doesn't add it."},"9193":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#limits","content":"**AI-written copy needs a read.** Check pricing and what's included before publishing."},"9194":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-154","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#limits","content":"**Your subdomain is in every link.** Changing it later breaks links you've already shared."},"9195":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-155","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-link-not-working","content":"The page needs to be published. Open it in the builder and click **Publish**. Saving alone isn't enough."},"9196":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-156","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-all-five-pages","content":"No. Every page works out of the box. Most people only style the registration page."},"9197":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-157","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-template-per-page","content":"Yes, templates are chosen per page. Changing one replaces that page's layout."},"9198":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-158","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-skip-template","content":"No. The button reads **Skip & Create Webinar** when nothing is selected, and you can choose later."},"9199":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-159","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-blank-page","content":"Choose **Build Your Own** on the template step."},"9200":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-160","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-mobile","content":"Use the device toggle (the phone icon in the middle of the top bar), then **Preview** to see the real page."},"9201":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-161","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-pixels","content":"Yes. Use **Tracking Code** in the builder's **Settings** for this page, or the **Tracking Code** sub-tab on the webinar's **Settings** tab."},"9202":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-162","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-open-graph","content":"Yes, with **Social Sharing (Open Graph)** in the page settings."},"9203":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-163","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-ai-pages","content":"Yes. **Create with AI** writes the registration, thank-you and waiting-area pages from your script. Landing pages use 10 credits."},"9204":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder-164","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-page-builder#faq-translate","content":"No. **Webinar Language** changes the interface language attendees see; your own copy stays as you wrote it."},"9205":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registr