],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                  |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Top actions** | **Registration Page**, **Share**, **Enter Room** |","table":"table-0"},"9575":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |                                                                     |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Stats shown** | **Registrants**, **Live Attended**, **Total Attended**, **Revenue** |","table":"table-0"},"9576":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#at-a-glance","content":"|            |                                                                                       |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Panels** | **Scheduling Options**, **Sessions**, **Registration Pricing**, **Team & Moderators** |","table":"table-0"},"9577":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                        |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Session tabs** | **Upcoming**, **Past**, **Cancelled**; evergreen webinars add **Live** |","table":"table-0"},"9578":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#at-a-glance","content":"|                               |                                                                                     |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Other tabs on the webinar** | Content, CTAs, Engagement, Notifications, Integrations, Analytics, Replay, Settings |","table":"table-0"},"9579":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#before-you-begin","content":"**Create the webinar first.** The Overview tab belongs to a webinar that already exists. Start from Create and schedule a live webinar, Create a simulive webinar or Create an evergreen webinar."},"9580":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#before-you-begin","content":"**Expect zeros on a new webinar.** The four stats stay at zero until registrations start."},"9581":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#before-you-begin","content":"**To charge for registration, have Stripe ready.** Converting a webinar to paid needs a connected Stripe account. Read the warning about converting in Step 4 below before you use it."},"9582":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#before-you-begin","content":"**To go live, have a camera and microphone.** **Enter Room** checks both before letting you in."},"9583":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"Click **My Webinars** in the sidebar."},"9584":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"Click the webinar you want. It opens on **Overview**."},"9585":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"If you built the webinar with **Create with AI**, the flow ends here too: it drops you on the finished webinar's Overview, and the webinar carries an **AI** badge in My Webinars. From then on it behaves like one you built by hand."},"9586":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"*1 The nine tabs · 2 Top actions · 3 Live stats · 4 Scheduling Options · 5 Sessions · 6 Registration Pricing · 7 Team & Moderators.*"},"9587":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"|     | Area              | What it does                                                                                                                                         |\n| --- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **The nine tabs** | Overview, Content, CTAs, Engagement, Notifications, Integrations, Analytics, Replay and Settings. Every setting on a webinar sits behind one of them |","table":"table-1"},"9588":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"|     | Area            | What it does                                                                                                          |\n| --- | --------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Top actions** | **Registration Page** opens the live page, **Share** lists every link, **Enter Room** takes you into the webinar room |","table":"table-1"},"9589":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"|     | Area           | What it does                                                                        |\n| --- | -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Live stats** | Registrants, Live Attended, Total Attended and Revenue, updated as the webinar runs |","table":"table-1"},"9590":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"|     | Area                   | What it does                                                                       |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Scheduling Options** | Frequency, start date, timezone, and how many sessions registrants can choose from |","table":"table-1"},"9591":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"|     | Area         | What it does                                                         |\n| --- | ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Sessions** | Each sitting of the webinar, split into Upcoming, Past and Cancelled |","table":"table-1"},"9592":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"|     | Area                     | What it does                                                     |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 6   | **Registration Pricing** | Free or Paid, with a **Convert to paid** button on free webinars |","table":"table-1"},"9593":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#open-overview","content":"|     | Area                  | What it does                                          |\n| --- | --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 7   | **Team & Moderators** | The presenters and moderators who can run the session |","table":"table-1"},"9594":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"The stat cards across the top tell you, at a glance, whether people are signing up and turning up."},"9595":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"| Stat            | What it counts                                                                                      |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Registrants** | People who completed the registration form. On a paid webinar, everyone who has registered and paid |","table":"table-2"},"9596":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"| Stat              | What it counts                     |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Live Attended** | People who joined the live session |","table":"table-2"},"9597":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"| Stat               | What it counts                                                                               |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Total Attended** | Live attendees plus replay viewers, so it is always the larger of the two attendance numbers |","table":"table-2"},"9598":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"| Stat        | What it counts                   |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Revenue** | Money taken through this webinar |","table":"table-2"},"9599":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"These are headline numbers. For the full picture, open the **Analytics** tab: it adds **Visitors**, **Replay Watched** and **Missed**, and splits **Total Attended** into **Live only**, **Replay only** and **Both**."},"9600":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"**Scheduling Options** summarises when the webinar runs:"},"9601":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"| Line          | What it shows                                                                    |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Frequency** | The schedule frequency (**Specific Date**, **Daily** or **Weekly**) and its time |","table":"table-3"},"9602":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"| Line           | What it shows            |\n| -------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **Start Date** | When the schedule begins |","table":"table-3"},"9603":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"| Line         | What it shows                |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| **Timezone** | The timezone sessions run in |","table":"table-3"},"9604":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"| Line            | What it shows                                                                                                    |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Preferences** | How many upcoming sessions a registrant can pick from. The default is to display only the next available session |","table":"table-3"},"9605":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"To change the date, time or recurrence, open the options menu on the **Scheduling Options** panel. A change made here applies to the whole webinar, not to one sitting."},"9606":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#evergreen-scheduling","content":"On an evergreen webinar with just-in-time switched on, the timezone line reads **Attendee's local timezone**. That's because a just-in-time session starts shortly after each person registers, in their own local time."},"9607":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#evergreen-scheduling","content":"*1 Scheduling Options · 2 Sessions, generated from the schedule.*"},"9608":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"The **Sessions** panel lists every sitting of the webinar under its own tab:"},"9609":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"| Tab          | What it holds                      |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Upcoming** | Sessions scheduled and not yet run |","table":"table-4"},"9610":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"| Tab      | What it holds              |\n| -------- | -------------------------- |\n| **Past** | Sessions already broadcast |","table":"table-4"},"9611":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"| Tab           | What it holds                                      |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Cancelled** | Sessions that were called off, kept for the record |","table":"table-4"},"9612":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"| Tab      | What it holds                                      |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Live** | Evergreen webinars only: sessions currently on air |","table":"table-4"},"9613":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"Each row shows the date, time, timezone and registration count for that sitting. A one-time webinar has a single upcoming session. A daily or weekly webinar fills the list from its recurrence, and a daily evergreen schedule generates a long run of upcoming sessions without you adding any."},"9614":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"To act on one sitting without touching the rest, use the options menu on that session's row. To change every sitting at once, go back to **Scheduling Options**."},"9615":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"**Registration Pricing** shows whether the webinar is **Free** or **Paid**."},"9616":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"**On a free webinar** the panel reads **This webinar is free — attendees register without payment**, with a **Convert to paid** button."},"9617":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"**On a paid webinar** the panel shows your pricing title and price, and the pencil edits them. A **Payment Gateway** panel shows the connected Stripe account, and **Manage** opens your payment settings."},"9618":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"*1 Registrants · 2 Revenue · 3 Registration Pricing · 4 Payment Gateway.*"},"9619":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"Converting needs a connected Stripe account. But when a free webinar is converted to paid after creation, its registration page keeps the free form, so people can still register without paying. If you want to charge, create a new webinar and choose **Paid** on the pricing step."},"9620":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-and-moderators","content":"**Team & Moderators** shows everyone who can run this webinar. On a new webinar it reads \"No presenters or moderators added yet.\""},"9621":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-and-moderators","content":"**Add presenter** adds someone who appears on camera and presents."},"9622":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-and-moderators","content":"**Invite** sends an invitation to join the webinar team."},"9623":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-and-moderators","content":"You don't have to add everyone here. The **Share** dialog has a **Co-presenter Join Link** and a **Moderator Join Link for Live room**, and a presenter or moderator can join with a link without having an EasyWebinar account at all."},"9624":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-members-vs-presenters","content":"A team member is someone with their own login to your EasyWebinar account, added under **Settings → Team** as an **Admin** or a **User**. A presenter or moderator is someone running a specific webinar, added on that webinar's Overview tab. Add someone to the team when they work in EasyWebinar regularly; send a join link when they're a guest on one session."},"9625":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#share","content":"Click **Share** to see the seven links the webinar generates, grouped under **Share Links**, **Registration Widget** and **Share on social media**, with a **Shorten URL's** toggle. The one to promote is the **Registration Page Link**. The co-presenter and moderator links let someone into the room in that role, so keep them private."},"9626":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#share","content":"**Registration Page**, beside **Share**, opens the live registration page so you can see what visitors see."},"9627":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"On a live webinar, **Enter Room** takes you into the webinar room."},"9628":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"Click **Enter Room**."},"9629":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"Check your **camera, microphone and speakers** and pick your devices."},"9630":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"Click **Continue to Green Room**. The button stays greyed out until the room can see a working camera and microphone."},"9631":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"If another webinar is already on air, you'll see \"You can only have one event live at a time.\" Join that one, or go live with the new one."},"9632":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-recorded-session","content":"A recorded webinar has no live room to enter. On an evergreen webinar, wait for a session to be running: the **Sessions** panel's **Live** tab shows it, marked *Live now*, with **Enter room**."},"9633":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-recorded-session","content":"*1 The Live tab, showing sessions currently on air · 2 Enter room, which opens the session.*"},"9634":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#verify-the-result","content":"**The schedule is right.** **Scheduling Options** shows the frequency, start date and timezone you expect, and the **Upcoming** tab lists the sittings you meant to run."},"9635":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#verify-the-result","content":"**The pricing is right.** **Registration Pricing** shows **Free**, or your pricing title, price and a connected **Payment Gateway**."},"9636":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#verify-the-result","content":"**The team is in place.** **Team & Moderators** lists your presenters and moderators instead of \"No presenters or moderators added yet.\""},"9637":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#verify-the-result","content":"**Registrations are counting.** After a test registration, **Registrants** moves off zero and the session row's registration count goes up."},"9638":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#what-it-is","content":"The Overview tab is the first of nine tabs on every webinar, and the one each webinar opens on. It summarises the webinar rather than configuring its content: numbers at the top, then schedule, sessions, pricing and team."},"9639":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#what-it-is","content":"Pages, emails, polls, offers and replays are set up on the other eight tabs. The Overview is where you check that those pieces add up to a webinar ready to run."},"9640":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#what-its-for","content":"The Overview tab is the home screen for one webinar. It answers everyday questions without opening any of the other eight tabs. Is anyone registering, when does it run, what does it cost, who is presenting, and which link do you send?"},"9641":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#how-it-helps","content":"**One place to check before a session.** Schedule, pricing, team and links sit side by side, so a last check takes seconds."},"9642":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#how-it-helps","content":"**Session-level control.** You can act on one sitting from its row without rewriting the whole schedule."},"9643":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#how-it-helps","content":"**Numbers that update as you run.** The stats change as the webinar runs, so you can watch registrations and attendance move."},"9644":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#how-it-helps","content":"**A straight route into the room.** **Enter Room** is on the same screen as the stats, so going live doesn't mean hunting for a link."},"9645":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#without-it","content":"Without a single summary screen, the basics of a webinar get scattered. The schedule lives in one place, pricing in another and the presenter list somewhere else. It becomes easy to promote the wrong date. A co-presenter may only get their link after messaging you to ask for it."},"9646":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#why-buyers-care","content":"The Overview matters most to teams running more than one webinar a month. Each webinar needs a quick status check and the right links for the right people. That need grows when guest speakers change from one session to the next."},"9647":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#approach","content":"Take a typical case. A regional wildlife charity has a fundraising team of three and around 900 monthly donors. Each month it runs a live 40-minute briefing for donors, with a guest speaker from its field team. The goal is to keep monthly givers engaged, so fewer cancel their gift."},"9648":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#approach","content":"A common way to manage this is a shared spreadsheet and a long email thread. The date sits in one place, the speaker's link in another and sign-up numbers in a third. It tends to work until a busy month. Then a guest may get the wrong link, or a called-off date may still be promoted."},"9649":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#approach","content":"The briefing itself rarely goes wrong. The risk sits in the handovers between people and tools before it starts. Fewer places to look means fewer chances to miss a detail."},"9650":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#approach","content":"EasyWebinar keeps those details on the webinar's **Overview** tab. **Scheduling Options** and **Sessions** show each month's sitting, and a sitting that is called off moves to **Cancelled**. The team copies the **Co-presenter Join Link** from **Share** for the guest, who joins without an EasyWebinar account. **Registrants** shows sign-ups on the same screen."},"9651":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#approach","content":"The screenshot under Open the Overview tab numbers seven areas, from the nine tabs to **Team & Moderators**. How other platforms handle guest links, registration links and session history is covered in How the Overview tab compares, below."},"9652":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-registration-page","content":"The registration page is built on the **Content** tab and opened from the **Registration Page** button here. The **Registrants** stat counts people who complete its form."},"9653":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-paid-registration","content":"On a paid webinar, **Registrants** counts everyone who has registered and paid, and **Revenue** is the total taken. Every transaction is listed under **Analytics → Revenue → Paid Webinar**."},"9654":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-analytics","content":"The four stats are a summary of what the **Analytics** tab shows in detail. A brand-new webinar shows zeros on both until registrations start."},"9655":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-replays","content":"**Total Attended** includes replay viewers, and the **Attendee Replay link** sits in the Share dialog. Replay availability and design are set on the **Replay** tab."},"9656":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-cloning","content":"The type of a webinar can't be changed after it's created. To run the same webinar as a different type, clone it from its card on **My Webinars**. The copy starts with no registrations."},"9657":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the tab fits different teams."},"9658":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#coaches","content":"A coach runs a weekly live session. Before each one they open the Overview, check the **Upcoming** tab for the right date, glance at **Registrants**, and use **Enter Room** to get into the green room early."},"9659":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#agencies","content":"An agency runs webinars for clients, with the client's own speaker presenting. The account manager sends the speaker the **Co-presenter Join Link** from **Share**, so the speaker doesn't need an EasyWebinar login, and adds a colleague as moderator under **Team & Moderators**."},"9660":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team runs a webinar for a product launch. The Overview gives them the **Registration Page Link** to promote, and the gap between **Registrants** and **Live Attended** tells them, after the session, whether reminders did their job."},"9661":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#course-creators","content":"A course creator runs an evergreen webinar every day. The Overview shows the generated run of upcoming sessions, and the **Live** tab lets them enter a session while it is running."},"9662":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare","content":"EasyWebinar's Overview gives each webinar private join links for guest presenters, a one-click registration link for known contacts and a **Revenue** figure. Sessions that are called off stay on their own **Cancelled** tab. EasyWebinar is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"9663":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare","content":"Webinar management features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"9664":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare","content":"| Platform        | Join links for guest presenters | One-click registration link | Revenue shown for the webinar | Cancelled sessions kept on their own list |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **EasyWebinar** | Yes                             | Yes                         | Yes                           | Yes                                       |","table":"table-5"},"9665":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare","content":"| Platform                       | Join links for guest presenters | One-click registration link | Revenue shown for the webinar | Cancelled sessions kept on their own list |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarJam and EverWebinar** | Yes (detail)                    | Yes (detail)                | Yes (detail)                  | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-5"},"9666":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare","content":"| Platform       | Join links for guest presenters | One-click registration link | Revenue shown for the webinar | Cancelled sessions kept on their own list |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **WebinarKit** | Yes (detail)                    | Yes (detail)                | Yes (detail)                  | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-5"},"9667":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare","content":"| Platform  | Join links for guest presenters       | One-click registration link | Revenue shown for the webinar | Cancelled sessions kept on their own list |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Demio** | Yes (guest presenters and moderators) | Yes (detail)                | Not in docs                   | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-5"},"9668":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare","content":"| Platform      | Join links for guest presenters | One-click registration link | Revenue shown for the webinar | Cancelled sessions kept on their own list |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Livestorm** | Yes (unique speaker links)      | Not in docs                 | Not in docs                   | Not in docs                               |","table":"table-5"},"9669":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"9670":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare-stronger","content":"**Known contacts register in one click.** EasyWebinar's **One-Click Registration Link** carries a contact's name and email in the URL. Livestorm's help centre documents sharing the registration page, with no one-click registration link. Compare EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."},"9671":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare-stronger","content":"**Revenue beside registrations.** EasyWebinar's Overview shows **Revenue** next to **Registrants** and attendance. Demio's help centre doesn't document a revenue figure for a webinar. Compare EasyWebinar vs Demio."},"9672":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare-stronger","content":"**A record of called-off sessions.** EasyWebinar keeps cancelled sittings on a **Cancelled** tab so the webinar's history stays intact. WebinarJam's help centre doesn't document a list of cancelled sessions. Compare EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."},"9673":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"9674":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**The webinar type is fixed.** It can't be changed from the Overview or anywhere else after creation. Clone the webinar instead."},"9675":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Scheduling Options changes the whole webinar.** For one sitting, use the options menu on that session's row."},"9676":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-154","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Cancelled sessions stay listed.** They're kept under their own tab so the history of the webinar stays intact."},"9677":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-155","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Converting to paid doesn't add a price to the registration page.** Choose **Paid** at creation instead."},"9678":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-156","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Presenter and moderator links are private.** Anyone holding one can join your room in that role."},"9679":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-157","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Only one event can be live at a time.** Entering a room while another webinar is on air shows a message saying so."},"9680":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-158","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**A new webinar shows zeros** across all four stats until registrations start."},"9681":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-159","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-promote-link","content":"Click **Share** on the Overview tab and copy the **Registration Page Link**. That's the public one."},"9682":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-160","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-live-vs-total","content":"**Live Attended** counts people who joined the live session. **Total Attended** adds replay viewers, so it's the larger number."},"9683":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-161","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-change-date","content":"Use the options menu on **Scheduling Options**. It changes the schedule for the whole webinar, not a single sitting."},"9684":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-162","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-one-session","content":"Use the options menu on that session's row in the **Sessions** panel."},"9685":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-163","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-cancelled","content":"Cancelled sessions are kept under their own tab so the webinar's history stays intact."},"9686":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-164","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-guest-speaker","content":"Send them the **Co-presenter Join Link** from **Share**, or add them under **Team & Moderators**. They don't need an EasyWebinar account to join with a link."},"9687":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-165","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-convert-to-paid","content":"There's a **Convert to paid** button, but the registration page of a converted webinar keeps the free form. Create a new webinar and choose **Paid** on the pricing step instead."},"9688":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-166","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-change-price","content":"Use the pencil on **Registration Pricing** in the Overview tab."},"9689":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-167","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-zeros","content":"A new webinar shows zeros across the board until registrations start."},"9690":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-168","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-cant-enter-room","content":"**Continue to Green Room** stays greyed out until the room can see a working camera and microphone. If you see \"You can only have one event live at a time.\", another webinar is already live. The camera not detected guide covers device problems."},"9691":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-169","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-evergreen-enter","content":"A recorded webinar has no live room to enter. When a session is running, it appears on the **Live** tab of the **Sessions** panel with **Enter room**."},"9692":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-170","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#related","content":"Sharing links: who gets each link behind **Share**, and which to keep private."},"9693":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-171","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#related","content":"Registration page builder: edit and publish the page the **Registration Page** button opens."},"9694":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-172","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#related","content":"Paid webinars: set a price at creation, since a converted webinar keeps the free form."},"9695":{"id":"/product-docs/