ause trust grows when people can ask you questions. Plan the talk with the outline template, and use timed offers for the booking link. A full guide to coaching webinars is on the way."],[6617,"Coaches running open office hours"],[2806,"Coaches, consultants and solo advisers care most when the diary is full of delivery and empty of sales. It matters when a cohort start date is fixed and places are still open. It also matters to anyone who wants new clients from people outside their own network."],[2902,"Coaching webinar features, from each platform's public documentation (Kajabi for its webinar funnels):"],[2732,"Coaching Webinar: How to Teach, Invite Attendees to Apply or Book, Then Follow Up"],[2838,"Coaching webinars often include a short hot-seat, where you coach one person live. In EasyWebinar, presenters and co-hosts wait backstage, and you move someone to the stage when it's their turn. So invite your volunteer as a presenter before the session, using the join links on the **People** panel. The live room guide covers the stage controls."],[2198,"Colleagues who work across your own webinars need a login on your account, not a workspace. On **Settings → Team**, click **Add user** and give each person their own email address. You set their password, and nothing is emailed to them. An **Admin** can change everything, including settings and billing, while a **User** gets basic access to the features. More on roles is in team members and roles."],[4811,"Collect registrations and send each person the link for their slot."],[7604,"Collect sign-ups in a form and send the join link by email."],[34,"Common questions"],[174,"Common questions"],[363,"Common questions"],[565,"Common questions"],[786,"Common questions"],[985,"Common questions"],[1109,"Common questions"],[1275,"Common questions"],[1521,"Common questions"],[1743,"Common questions"],[1885,"Common questions"],[2061,"Common questions"],[2463,"Common questions"],[4432,"Common questions"],[4580,"Common questions"]