es from one week to the next."],[6616,"Consultants selling a masterclass"],[2084,"Contact EasyWebinar support with the webinar name, the browser you are using and a screenshot of the message. Don't send passwords."],[678,"Continue through the emails, polls and offers, or whichever of them you selected. The flow drops you on the finished webinar's **Overview**, and from here it behaves like a webinar you built by hand, with the same nine tabs. Your pages are on the **Content** tab, and the Overview tab guide explains the rest of the screen."],[9445,"Continue to choose a registration template and click **Create Webinar**. The template you pick includes the price automatically. You can switch back to **Free** at any point before creating the webinar."],[9619,"Converting needs a connected Stripe account. But when a free webinar is converted to paid after creation, its registration page keeps the free form, so people can still register without paying. If you want to charge, create a new webinar and choose **Paid** on the pricing step."],[6432,"Copy an existing EasyWebinar webinar into a new one, choose its type and which pages, schedule, CTAs, emails and integration settings come with it, without touching the original."],[3239,"Copy last month's registration page, emails and polls into a new webinar by hand."],[8979,"Copy the **Embed Code**."],[3688,"Copy the **Replay Page Link** into your templates."],[8116,"Copy the **Replay Page Link** with **Copy**, or check the page with **Open**."],[9291,"Copy the link you need."],[3888,"Copy the public registration link from your webinar platform."],[3801,"Copy the registration link"],[8982,"Copy the snippet."],[4279,"Copy this checklist into your own document or print it, and fill in the last column as you go. It is a template from this guide; EasyWebinar doesn't generate it for you. Each row names the screen where the check happens."],[3868,"Copy this template and replace every field in square brackets. It's a plain-text pattern