th attendees registering for specific dates. Evergreen makes pre-recorded content available 24/7, with viewers watching on their own schedule."],[5766,"Live chat"],[6111,"Live chat"],[2658,"Live chat has two visibility settings. **Everyone** lets attendees see and answer each other, which suits most workshops. **Hosts only** makes each attendee's messages private to your team. Choose it for sensitive topics, or where buyers shouldn't see each other's questions."],[5813,"Live chat is the panel in the webinar room where attendees post messages while the webinar runs. In EasyWebinar you set it up on the webinar's **Engagement** tab before the session: built-in chat or no chat, and whether attendees see each other's messages or only talk privately to your team. On simulive and evergreen webinars you can also embed an external chat tool instead. During the session, your team reads and answers messages from the **Chat** panel in the room."],[7315,"Live chat settings: decide how chat behaves before your moderator joins backstage."],[6720,"Live chat, polls and questions from attendees are set up on the webinar's tabs after you create it, ready for the session itself."],[5618,"Live chat: the **Easywebinar Chat** setting that simulation depends on."],[6233,"Live chat: the chat setting you choose next to Q&A on the **Engagement** tab."],[6088,"Live chat: the open conversation that runs alongside your polls."],[2954,"Live first, then automate"],[2277,"Live or automated: choosing your first format"],[8209,"Live recordings and cloning"],[5146,"Live recordings often begin with minutes of waiting and small talk. If you edit the file outside EasyWebinar, you can cut out the beginning, middle, or end of a video in YouTube Studio without re-uploading it. YouTube's editor works on videos shorter than six hours. EasyWebinar can then play the video from YouTube, or you can upload your trimmed file with **Local import**."],[6514,"Live recordings reach the Library when **Auto Recording** i