r, choose Evergreen on the copy, and use the recording of the live session."],[1668,"Not directly. Workflows send to saved lists, so save the filtered view as a list first with Add List on the Leads screen. The list then appears as a tab beside All Leads."],[130,"Not from the Team screen. Contact support if ownership of the account needs to move."],[1862,"Not from this tab. Use **EasyCast**, a separate item under **Integrations** in the sidebar."],[3300,"Not in place, because a webinar's type is fixed once created. Clone it and choose Evergreen as the copy's type, then pick a recording on the new webinar's Content tab."],[6937,"Not in place. Clone it and choose **Evergreen** on the copy."],[8757,"Not necessarily. Turn it on when the content matters more than the event feeling, and leave it off when you want a scheduled session people turn up for."],[4385,"Not on a phone, and not in a browser window narrower than 768 pixels. Make your slides readable at phone size without zooming in, and test them on your own phone the day before."],[3515,"Not sure what to send after a webinar ends? A webinar follow up email has to fit what each person did, so this guide gives real templates for attendees and no-shows, says when to send each one and how to schedule them per webinar, so every registrant gets the right next step."],[718,"Not until you publish. Each page has its own **Publish** button, and saving alone keeps a draft. The registration link doesn't work until the registration page is published."],[7870,"Note the **LIVE** timer before you click **End Session**, then compare it with the duration on the recording's card. A much shorter recording is worth opening before you share it."],[3671,"Note who clicked your offer and who has already bought, if your tools record it."],[5522,"Nothing about the video has to change. What helps is a chat that raises the questions readers usually ask, at the moment the video covers them, with an answer from the host. A room with a few voices