s you as expected. Turn on **Shorten URL's** if you want a tidier link. The sharing links guide covers every link in the dialog."],[4982,"Open the webinar's **Overview** tab and use the options menu on the **Scheduling Options** panel. That menu changes the schedule for the whole webinar rather than for a single session."],[7053,"Open the webinar's **Overview** tab."],[5391,"Open the webinar's **Overview**. The Sessions panel has a **Live** tab, and a running session appears there marked **Live now**, with **Enter room**."],[2253,"Open the webinar's Analytics tab for visitors, registrations, attendance and offers, and export a filtered list from People. There are no scheduled report emails, so you send the numbers in your own monthly note."],[4844,"Open the webinar's Overview tab and confirm the sessions list looks right. With just-in-time on, the timezone reads **Attendee's local timezone**. If the schedule is wrong, fix it now, before anyone registers. For a fuller walkthrough of the first launch, EasyWebinar's getting started guide to automated webinars covers the funnel around it."],[2840,"Open the webinar's settings and find **End of Session** on the **General** tab."],[3864,"Open with the reader's problem in a sentence they'd say themselves. Then say what they'll be able to do after the session. Your name, your credentials and the webinar title can wait until the second paragraph."],[4999,"Open your registration page link and register as an attendee."],[5528,"Open your simulive or evergreen webinar and click **Engagement**, then **Chat Simulation**."],[5547,"Open your simulive or evergreen webinar and click **Engagement**, then **Chat Simulation**."],[4618,"Open your webinar and click **Analytics**. It opens on **Overview**."],[5706,"Open your webinar and click **Content**, then **Edit** on **Registration Page**."],[6320,"Open your webinar and click **CTAs**."],[8834,"Open your webinar and click the **Content** tab."],[8976,"Open your webinar and click the **C